#. family.fonxan intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "封山剑派是当今武林中最大的一支剑派。相传三位剑术名家在封山灵狐顶相互印证所学，创出封山剑法；招式不难学，难在剑意，讲究不抢先，等对手露出空子。七十年前一代掌门把乔阴柳家的家传拳法融进剑意，创出柳家拳，补上了剑派近身的短处。雪亭镇的淳风武馆是这一派的门户，镇上的后生多在那里学拳。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "雪亭镇的淳风武馆"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "柳家拳没什么花样：先打实一拳，人就贴上去了；贴上去，重拳才够得着，一拳比一拳沉。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "最怕的是打空。一拳落了空，人就被拉开了，再重的拳头也只砸在风上——得重新打实一拳，才能再贴上去。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "所以这拳是抢来的。对面守得稳，你就先用快的、虚的去碰，碰着了再压上去。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "想拜馆主为师？馆主只看{requires}，哪一样不到，他都会摇头。拳脚简单，一拳就是一拳，先跟我拆几招也好。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.accept
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "好，拆三回合，点到为止。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.earned
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "看见没有？我一拳打实了就贴上来，接着那记重的才够得着你。柳家拳的拳，是这么抢来的。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.not_earned
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "三回合我一拳都没打实，就一直够不着你——柳家拳最怕的就是这个。你要学，先学怎么把第一拳打实。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.player_earned
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你贴上来那一记，压得对，就是这个劲。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.refuse_hurt
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你身上带着伤，拆什么招？先去桑邻药铺把伤治好。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.refuse_family
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你是别派的弟子，馆主吩咐过，不许和外人过招。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.rounds
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "记住：一回合不是一招，是几手的事。你出一手，我出一手；谁手上还有余力，谁就多出一手。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.rounds
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "看我这一拳——打实了我就贴上来，紧跟着的那一记重的，你躲得开么？"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides liuh-ken lesson.rounds
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "最后一回合。你要是能让我一拳打空，我就得退开重来；你要是也打实了一拳，就试试压上来。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "爹爹的剑法，我只学了个皮毛。封山剑不抢先，先用引手逗对方出招——对方一剑刺空，或是被我架开，那一下就是空子，我这边就多出一剑来。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "多出来的那一剑最要紧：可以追着刺，也可以用「封」字诀把他封住，一封住，他好几手都出不来。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "可是贪不得。多出来的那一剑要是只顾着攻，对方的下一手就没人守了。爹爹说，封山的剑是等出来的。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword teach
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你若想拜爹爹为师，他只看{requires}——不到的，他会说学剑的人要胆大心细。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.accept
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "那……只拆三回合，不伤人。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.earned
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "方才你那一下刺空了，我手里就多出一剑，那记「封」就是这么来的。封山的剑，是等人露空子。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.not_earned
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "三回合你一招都没打空，我就一直没等到空子，只好跟你慢慢磨。封山的剑是等出来的，等不到，就只能这样。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.player_earned
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你也等到了我的空子，多出来的那一剑用得对。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.refuse_hurt
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你带着伤呢，爹爹不许我跟伤者动手。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.refuse_family
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你是别派的人，爹爹说过不能跟江湖人物比武过招。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.rounds
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "一回合里你出几手，我也出几手——你出完了，我才接着出。不急。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.rounds
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "你尽管来刺。要是刺空了，我手上就多一剑；看清楚我是怎么追上来的。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan guides fonxansword lesson.rounds
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "最后一回合。你也可以不急着出手，等我刺空了再说。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.waiter say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "封山剑法？小的不懂剑，只听来往的武师说：柳馆主的剑从不抢先，专等人家刺空了的那一下。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.guard say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "馆主的剑我看了五年。来踢馆的，十个有九个是自己刺空了，才挨那一下的。想拜他为师？他只看{requires}。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.teacher say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "柳淳风是个读书人，剑法嘛……文绉绉的，依老夫看没什么杀气。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.trainee say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "绘心师妹的剑最吓人的是那记「封」字诀，被封住了好几手都出不来。不过她说剑要等——等什么，我也说不上来。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.herbalist topic
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "伤口"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.herbalist say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "这是剑伤，口子又直又深——封山剑的路数，多半是这位$RESPECT自己先刺空了，人家才补的这一剑。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.woodcutter say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "柳家拳？镇上后生练的都是这个。我瞧他们打架，先是一拳碰着人了，立马就贴上去，一拳比一拳重。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.smith say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "李教头那身板，一拳打实了接着就是一记重的，叫什么虎吟。想拜柳馆主的，先去武馆找李教头拆拆招，拳脚简单，一拳就是一拳。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.farmer say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "柳家拳好是好，就是练了脾气暴，李教头那些徒弟三天两头在街上跟人动手。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.beggar say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "柳家拳最怕打空。一拳落了空，人就离远了，再重的拳也够不着——小的挨过，知道。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.herbalist say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "这是拳伤，一片青紫，底下还压着一记重的——柳家拳的路数，人贴上来才打得出这么重。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan hearsay snow.npc.herbalist say
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "这位$RESPECT身上没什么新伤，用不着看。"
msgstr ""

#. family.fonxan_north intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "封山剑派北宗是封山剑派里的一支，剑法、拳脚和内功都与本宗同出一源。绮云镇口的公告上，至今还写着「封山剑派北宗所在的雪亭镇」。"
msgstr ""

#. family.zhenyuan name
#. zhenyuan name
#. cloud.npc.b_header family.name
#. cloud.npc.bfighter family.name
#. city.npc.chen family.name
#. city.npc.chen inquiry topic
#: data/common/families.json data/story/factions.json data/cloud/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json data/cloud/voxel/biaoju_house.json data/cloud/voxel/outdoor.json
msgid "振远镖局"
msgstr ""

#. family.zhenyuan intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "振远镖局是京师第一大镖局，在京城一带几乎无人不知其名，绮云镇上也有振远的镖局。镖局里的人走镖凭的是一手春风快意刀。走镖危险，镖局收人先看胆识。"
msgstr ""

#. family.zhenyuan seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "京师的振远总局"
msgstr ""

#. family.dongfang name
#. dongfang name
#. cloud.npc.god family.name
#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi family.name
#: data/common/families.json data/story/factions.json data/cloud/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "东方神教"
msgstr ""

#. family.dongfang intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "东方神教是一个行事隐秘的教门，不立山门，也不收寻常弟子。教中人散在各处，平日看不出身份，外人对它的宗旨所知甚少。只听说教中高手使一路雪影剑法，身法轻疾。"
msgstr ""

#. family.celestial name
#. common.npc.fighter.champion family.name
#. common.npc.fighter.master family.name
#. celestial name
#: data/common/families.json data/common/npcs.json data/story/factions.json
msgid "天邪派"
msgstr ""

#. family.celestial intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "天邪派以水烟阁为大本营。水烟阁在雪亭镇西边青石官道尽头的山上，相传最早的主人是武术之神杞庸，后来成了历代武林盟主的行馆，每年正月十七在阁外虹台推选盟主。天邪神功与天邪神掌是这一派的根本，相传是杞庸见灵兽天邪虎而悟出；另有一路六阴追魂剑法，是三百年前一位前辈从废墟中得来的。门规甚严，拜师要么立誓恪守门规，要么接下三招。"
msgstr ""

#. family.juechen name
#. common.npc.juechen.master family.name
#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry topic
#. juechen name
#: data/common/families.json data/common/npcs.json data/story/factions.json
msgid "绝尘派"
msgstr ""

#. family.juechen intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "绝尘派是绝尘子一手所创的门派。绝尘子原是佛门中人，后得奇人指点，悟得道家真谛，佛道双修，访遍名山大川后自号绝尘。他的修行之所在青石村的石室里，门上写着「非我弟子，莫入此门」。入门看慧根，也要有相当的江湖历练。"
msgstr ""

#. family.juechen seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "青石村的石室"
msgstr ""

#. family.maoshan name
#. common.npc.taoist.taolord family.name
#. common.npc.taoist.taolord inquiry topic
#. maoshan name
#. temple.npc.trainer family.name
#. temple.npc.trainer inquiry topic
#. temple.npc.tfighter family.name
#. temple.npc.tfighter inquiry topic
#. city.npc.shangshu.gardener inquiry topic
#: data/common/families.json data/common/npcs.json data/story/factions.json data/temple/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json
msgid "茅山派"
msgstr ""

#. family.maoshan intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "茅山派自张天师开山立派，世代以降妖伏魔为己任，门户在茅山上的灵心观。门下修谷衣心法，排去体内的五谷秽气，炼成护体之气；修到小成，左眼眼珠会变成金色。法术以治鬼除魔为主，根基是天师正道。灵心观是出家人的道观，只收男弟子。"
msgstr ""

#. family.maoshan seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "茅山的灵心观"
msgstr ""

#. family.latemoon intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "晚月庄是绮云镇以西林子深处的一座大宅院，朱漆大门，门口挂着灯笼，出现在乡野之间显得有些突兀。庄里多是女子，只收女弟子，庄主的琵琶闻名千里。武功以七宝天岚舞的身法、柔虹指和寒雪鞭法见长，内功意寒功纯走阴柔一路。"
msgstr ""

#. family.sanyen intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "山烟寺在绮云镇南、泓水对岸的日照山上，整座寺由上好的桧木建成，金碧辉煌。寺中老方丈医术通神，受过恩惠的富豪出资修整，名气比京城的白象禅院还大。要入寺先得剃度出家，只收男子；武功以流云杖法和疗伤的莲华心法为主，佛法精深的还修八识神通。"
msgstr ""

#. family.sanyen seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "日照山的山烟寺"
msgstr ""

#. family.xiaoyao name
#. latemoon.npc.room.guest family.name
#: data/common/families.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "逍遥派"
msgstr ""

#. family.xiaoyao intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "逍遥派的门户不在这一带，中原少见其门人。听说这一派收徒讲究人品文采，掌门是个风流倜傥的人物。"
msgstr ""

#. family.tianshan name
#. latemoon.npc.room.tguest family.name
#: data/common/families.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "天山派"
msgstr ""

#. family.tianshan intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "天山派的门户远在天山，中原少见其门人。晚月庄后门外的小径，据说就是通往天山的路。"
msgstr ""

#. family.buxuan name
#. common.npc.scholar.master family.name
#. buxuan name
#: data/common/families.json data/common/npcs.json data/story/factions.json
msgid "步玄派"
msgstr ""

#. family.buxuan intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "步玄派是四百年前「秃笔狂生」骆步玄在京城创立的门派。骆步玄原是屡试不中的书生，一日在街边书肆望见一副对子，竟悟出一套武功，从此闯荡江湖。门下的步玄七诀号称天下轻功「轻捷第一」，使起来姿态有如书法；骆家至今是京城有名的武林世家。想入门的人，要先走一趟乔阴曼雩台东边的桃林。"
msgstr ""

#. family.buxuan seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "乔阴县城的曼雩台"
msgstr ""

#. family.huazi name
#. common.npc.beggar.master family.name
#. huazi name
#: data/common/families.json data/common/npcs.json data/story/factions.json
msgid "花紫会"
msgstr ""

#. family.huazi intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "花紫会是乞丐们的帮会，只收身上没几个钱的化子。龙头的信物是一只打着二十三个结的皮酒囊；龙头行踪诡秘，据说各处总有七八个替身。会中的武功有油流麻香手和伏蛟功。"
msgstr ""

#. family.huazi seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "乔阴县城的福林大街"
msgstr ""

#. family.shield_guild intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "铁盾会是番坊里大秦人的剑会，门前立着两面比人还高的铁包边大盾，盾面上漆着展翅的鹰。大秦人的祖上从西边来，在这片海边落了脚。会里的剑手左手盾、右手短剑，两两对练；铁盾剑法盾在前、剑在后，没有盾的人不教。"
msgstr ""

#. family.shield_guild seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "番坊的铁盾会"
msgstr ""

#. family.ghost_hat_ronin name
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master family.name
#: data/common/families.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠馆浪人"
msgstr ""

#. family.ghost_hat_ronin intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "鬼笠馆是番坊里倭人浪人开的武馆，门楣上挂着一顶破了边的斗笠，馆名就是这么来的。门规只有一句：「一击之内定生死」——刀出鞘，只出一次。鬼笠刀法的刀比中原的窄而弯，劈下去就收，不出第二刀。"
msgstr ""

#. family.ghost_hat_ronin seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "番坊的鬼笠馆"
msgstr ""

#. family.ritola_temple intro
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "日陀罗寺是番坊里一座不大的寺院，由两位天竺僧人所建，赭红的墙头长着草。院中一棵大榕树，是第一代师父从天竺带来的枝条插活的。入寺要先剃度出家，只收男子，所传的是莲华心法、流云杖法这些佛门功夫。"
msgstr ""

#. family.ritola_temple seat
#: data/common/families.json
msgid "番坊的日陀罗寺"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master name
#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry topic
#. snow.npc.mercenary inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_chunfeng_lake name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/snow/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "柳淳风"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master nickname
#. native.npc.liu_chunfeng_lake nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "风雨双侠"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳淳风是个相当高大的中年儒生，若不是从他腰间挂著的「玄苏剑」你\n"
"大概猜不到眼前这个温文儒雅的中年人竟是家大武馆的馆主。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master rank_info.respect
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "柳馆主"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master family.title
#. common.npc.scholar.master family.title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "掌门人"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. snow.npc.girl inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "竹书"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "书在匣里。年轻时的糊涂话，留着给自己看。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "书在绘心那里。……她读得比我当年明白。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "竹林道尽头那块大黄石，照我教你的法子推。书取出来，带回来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "看着窗外的竹影，半晌才开口。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "二十岁那年，我在天驼关的竹林里住过一冬，悟出一点架剑的道理，写成一卷，起名《悟疾风劲竹书》，留在竹林尽头的石室里。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "石室的口子有一块大黄石堵着。硬推，没有几十年的内力推不动——我当年也推不动。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "那块石头不是那样推的。贴着它左下角那道青苔印，肩抵住，脚蹬石根；等风过竹林、石头自己松那一下，再发力。竹子是这么弯的，石头也是这么开的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "书只有那一本。你替我取出来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.竹书.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "一卷旧书罢了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "本宗"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.confirm
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"跟柳淳风守本宗：封山的剑不外传。\n"
"他亲传你「点」字诀，你是掌门传人；柳绘心会离开武馆，带着「北宗」两个字去绮云镇。封山在虹台上的那一票跟着柳淳风——等盟主回来。\n"
"这是封山这条线的大分裂，选了不能改。要跟师父吗？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "本宗的规矩，从今往后是你我两个人守。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你选了。武馆的门不拦你——只是剑，我不能再教了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.marks_asker
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "跟了本宗"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.marks_asker
#. snow.npc.girl inquiry.北宗.rules.marks_asker
#: data/common/npcs.json data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "学了点字诀"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "点了点头，像是早知道，又像是松了一口气。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "好。那从今日起，「点」字诀归你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "平时使剑，内力聚在手臂上；「点」字诀把劲力聚在剑尖，以意使剑。刺出去的那一下，比你现在重得多——内力不够的时候别使，剑会脱手。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "拔出玄苏剑，剑尖在你面前的青砖上轻轻一点。砖没有裂，砖下的土陷下去一个指头深的坑。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "封山这一辈，掌门的剑往后传给你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绘心……她要走，我不拦。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.本宗.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "封山剑派只有一宗。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. snow.npc.girl inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/snow/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "点字诀"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.点字诀.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "劲在剑尖，意在剑先。内力不够的时候别使。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.点字诀.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绘心自己悟的那一路，劲发得早了半分。你替我告诉她——不，不必说是我说的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.点字诀.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "「点」字诀是掌门一脉单传的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "武馆的事"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "镇上清净了。门户的名头不是谁都能借的——这一回，是你替武馆拿回来的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "镇西官道上那几个人，你去会一会。先看清他们凭的是什么，再动手。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "放下手里的茶，看了你一眼。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "既入了门，武馆的事你也该担一件。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这几日有来投师的人说，在镇西的青石官道上交过「拜师钱」——十两银子，收钱的自称封山弟子。淳风武馆收徒，从来不收这个钱。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我不便去。掌门出手打几个骗子，传出去是笑话。你是新面孔，他们不认得你——去看看他们凭的是什么。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.武馆的事.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "武馆自家的事，不劳外人费心。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. snow.npc.mercenary inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/snow/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "腰牌"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "牌我收着。逄师弟什么时候自己来取，什么时候还他。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "他认了就好。牌给我吧。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "牌没带回来？……丢了也好，省得再有人拿它骗人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "门户的名头，不是谁都能借的。这件事你办得干净——从今日起，你是这一辈的大弟子。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "还有一件事，李教头会同你说。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "接过腰牌翻过来，看见背面那个字，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "逄……是逄义师弟的牌。同辈里他的剑不比我差，只是好赌。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "牌是真的，人是假的——那就是牌从他手里流出去了。他这些年多半泡在绮云镇的赌场里。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你去问他一句：牌是怎么到外人手里的。问明白了，再把牌带回来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "把腰牌递还给你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.腰牌.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "封山弟子人人有一块腰牌，正面一座山，背面是自己的姓。你的那块，等你的剑入了门再说。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. snow.npc.mercenary name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/snow/npcs.json
msgid "逄义"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.逄义.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "他肯认，就还是封山的人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.逄义.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "逄师弟与我同辈，剑上的天分不在我之下。……好赌，多年不回武馆了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.淳风武馆
#. cloud.npc.b_header inquiry.淳风武馆
#: data/common/npcs.json data/cloud/npcs.json
msgid "淳风武馆是先父所创，在下辱承其名，虽忝掌封山门户，不敢忘了先人遗志。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "先人遗志"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.先人遗志
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "先父临终之时将这武馆交到在下手中，需得好好照看。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. quests.target
#. snow.npc.guard name
#. snow.npc.teacher inquiry topic
#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/common/quests.json data/snow/npcs.json data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "刘兄弟在寒舍管事已经五年了，过去之事不须再提。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你既然知道我是柳馆主，怎麽不知道我是柳淳风？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.here
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这里便是淳风武馆。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "隘口"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.隘口
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "听说大内的人在黄石隘口挖出了东西，又被人抢了去。抢东西的若是往老松岭去了，多半是投老松寨。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.老松寨
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "老松寨的常老大，人称泼风刀王，什么钱都收。要过他的寨门，带够银子；有本事的，就在寨门外叫阵——硬闯的人，没几个回来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry topic
#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader inquiry topic
#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.black_taoist_pass name
#. native.npc.black_taoist name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/oldpine/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣道士"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.黑衣道士
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠黑衣的道士？这一带没有道观。你若在老松岭遇上，小心些，那种人下手没有分寸。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#. native:snow/old_letter name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json data/native/items.json
msgid "荐信"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.荐信.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "老岑的信，你留着。末一行我不认得——他说过他在山里见过一座城，我只当是饿昏了的话。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "接过信，看了很久，又折好还给你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "老岑……二十多年前我在山里迷了路，三天没吃东西，是个砍柴的老人领我下的山。他不识几个字——这封信，他写了多久啊。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "他托你来，武馆的门你随时进。拜不拜师，你自己定。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "末一行我不认得。他说过他在山里见过一座城，铃声满耳……我只当是饿昏了的话。你收好。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.荐信.rules.say
#. canyon.npc.general inquiry.信.rules.say
#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.荐信.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json data/canyon/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "什么信？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.emote
#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "信没了？……罢了，我再写一封。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "提笔又写了一封信，封好了交给你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这回收好。潘军禅认信不认人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "信已经给你了。去水烟阁找潘军禅，他是我的结拜义弟，见信如见我。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "听你说完山洞里的事，沉默了半晌。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "洞里那个道士，是你杀的？……头一回手上沾血，夜里睡得着就好。睡不着，来武馆找我，我陪你坐一坐。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前，振远镖局押一趟镖过老松岭，镖师随从一个都没回来。镖局丢了脸，陈剑秋到今天都不肯提。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "那具骸骨若真是水烟阁的人，这事就该问水烟阁。我写一封信，你拿去给执法使潘军禅，他是我的结拜义弟。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "提笔写了一封信，封好了交给你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "先去绮云镇问问陈剑秋，把镖单要来。上了山，别带着兵刃进阁。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "还有一件：前夜老松岭上起了火，山下都看得见——是老松寨。那道士的同伙回来了，挨个问寨里的人：匣子在谁手里。夜里睡觉，把门闩上。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master inquiry.水烟阁.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁在青石官道西头的山上，武者同盟的总坛。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master recognize_apprentice.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "规矩是规矩。北宗的人，我不能再教了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这卷书，你不是已经给了绘心么。……拿回去还她。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.ask
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"把《悟疾风劲竹书》交给柳淳风。\n"
"他会把它收进匣里，不再示人。书只有这一本，给出去就读不到了；柳绘心也读不到。\n"
"要交给他吗？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "接过书，没有翻开，用袖口把封皮上的灰擦了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "直竹贵地生……二十岁写的。那时候以为自己什么都懂。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "年轻时的糊涂话，收起来罢。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "把书收进了案头的匣里。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绘心这些日子常往内院去，一去就是半天。你改日替我看一眼。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这卷书……你从竹林里取出来的？先留着读。武馆的事办完了，再同我说。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "把腰牌收进袖里。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "找回来了？我替他收着。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "牌我替他收着。他什么时候戒了赌，什么时候自己来取。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master accept_object.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "牌是逄师弟的。你先去绮云镇问他一句，牌是怎么到外人手里的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你跟了她。……也好。她一个人，我不放心。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "武馆的门不拦你。剑，我不能再教了——规矩是规矩。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "刘兄弟的事，李教头回过我了。规矩是先父立的，我不能为他破。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "五年前我留他，是我的事；今天你说破，是你的事。都没有错。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "……说到规矩。我年轻时在天驼关的竹林里留过一卷书，写的也是这两个字。改日同你说。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "李教头说，那伙人认错了人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "看了你很久。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master calls.steps.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "刘兄弟的来历，五年前我就知道。你替他担了这句话——往后，也替武馆担着。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你跟了绘心，就是北宗的人。本宗的门，我不能再为你开。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "学剑之人必须胆大心细，依我看$RESPECT的资质似乎不宜？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.swordsman.master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "很好，$RESPECT多加努力，他日必定有成。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison name
#. quests.target
#: data/common/npcs.json data/common/quests.json
msgid "县城官兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是个正在执行公务的县城官兵，虽然和许多武林人物比起来，官兵\n"
"们的武功实在稀松平常，但是他们是有组织、有纪律的战士，谁也不\n"
"轻易地招惹他们。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"县城官兵喝道：还不快放下武器束手就缚？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.garrison chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"县城官兵喝道：大胆刁民竟敢拒捕？反了！反了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion name
#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry topic
#. native.npc.deng_xiao inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_wind name
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lake name
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lakebottom name
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_altar name
#. native.npc.herald_uncle name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json data/imperial/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "大天邪"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion title
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lake title
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lakebottom title
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_altar title
#. native.npc.herald_uncle title
#: data/common/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁传功使"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武是当今皇上的叔父，但是他毕生浸淫武学，甘愿抛弃荣华富\n"
"以换取水烟阁传功使一职，以便阅读水烟阁中所藏的武学典籍，无论\n"
"你有什麽武学上的疑难，他都能为你解答。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.武学
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"武学之道....嗯....只可意会，不可言喻。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.水烟阁
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"水烟阁乃是历届武林盟主的行馆，你有什麽事要见武林盟主？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.拜师
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"哦....老夫向来有个规矩，凡是想拜我为师的，得接我三招不死，你想试试？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry topic
#. city.npc.boss inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fu_an inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/city/npcs.json data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇上"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.皇上.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "老夫在朝上一天，庾子建就不是一个人说了算。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.皇上.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "昭儿？……他还小。朝廷的事，老夫不问了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry topic
#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry topic
#. main.chapter10 title
#. native:lancheng/xuanmang name
#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry topic
#. lancheng.whirl.self name
#. lancheng.whirl.uncle name
#. lancheng.whirl.xiao name
#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/story/chapter10.json data/lancheng/items.json data/lancheng/npcs.json data/lancheng/world.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "旋芒"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "在老夫手里。三百年前於兰家拔错了一把——决战那日，你来叫我，看老夫这一回拔得对不对。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "你拔的。好——於兰家这一回，不用再错一次。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "萧家那孩子拿去了。他回了一趟岚城，比老夫配。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "寒於氏的剑。於兰家的血里有寒於氏的一份——君违嫁过来的那一份。三百年前，我家的人拔错了一把剑。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "旋芒……先帝找了一辈子。老夫不找。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.岚城.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "找到城，叫我。风会知道怎么找到於兰家的人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion inquiry.岚城.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "樵夫撞进去过，先帝的人没有。老夫不信那些。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.ask_say
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.ask_say
#: data/common/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "$RESPECT若真的有心，不妨让我看看你的所学"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.ask_tell
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.ask_tell
#: data/common/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "如果想拜师的话，就请接受测试"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武点了点头，说道：很好，这是第一招...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.fail
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武叹了口气，说道：连第一招都撑不过，真是自不量力...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武说道：这是第二招...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.fail
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武「哼」地一声，说道：便是有这许多不怕死的家伙...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武说道：第三招来了...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.blows.fail
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武叹道：可惜，难道老夫一身武功竟无传人...."
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion apprentice.success
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武哈哈大笑，说道：今日老夫终於觅得一个可造之才！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "接过黄笺，看了一遍，又看了一遍，半晌没有说话。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "昭儿的字……还是这么慢。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "三百年了，於兰家的人又要去碰那东西。老夫不回去，这孩子一个人扛不住。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "把手诏折好，揣进怀里，站了起来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.champion accept_object.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "传功使的事，交给萧辟尘。——老夫回京。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master name
#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_home name
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lake name
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lakebottom name
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar name
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_ice name
#: data/common/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "萧辟尘"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master nickname
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_home title
#: data/common/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "小天邪"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"萧辟尘自幼生长於岚城之中，看起来仙风道骨，不食人间烟火。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.armed
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "{respect}既然使兵刃，在下空手接招未免不敬。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.armed
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "进招吧！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.unarmed
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "既然{respect}不使兵刃，在下自然奉陪！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master chat_msg_combat.unarmed_many
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "嗯... 既然{count}位都是空手，在下理当奉陪！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.ask_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我天邪派门规甚严，$RESPECT如果真的有心，且发个誓来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.again_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "多说无益，若不发誓恪守门规，便是跪著求我也没用。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.oath
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "守门规"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "这就是了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.岚城.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我回去过一回了。城还是那个样子，铃挂在钩上。……风记得我。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.岚城.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "……这是我的铃。」他把铃接过去，翻来覆去看了很久，拇指在那个「尘」字上摸了一下，又还给你：「铃在，风认人。你带着它，比我带着它有用。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.岚城.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我四岁那年起了一场大风，醒来就在山外了，身边什么也没有。铃丢了，风就不认得我，我再也回不去。……风是从城里往外吹的。小时候我放风筝，线总是往外拽。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.岚城.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "岚城……我是在那里长大的。别的，不说了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "风铃"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.风铃.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "铃舌上那个字是铃匠刻的。岚城的孩子，人人一只。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.风铃.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "那只匣子……对着岚城的风才开。镜子里的上道，风从那头来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.风铃.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "黄石隘口挖出来的那只石匣，后来在哪里？……先帝的人当年从山外收走过一只铃。我一直想，那是我的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.风铃.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "风铃？水烟阁的檐下也挂着几只，风一大就响。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "在我背上。决战那日，它跟我下湖。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "是你。好。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "皇叔拔的？……也好。於兰家欠这把剑一回。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "岚城有一把剑，叫旋芒。守剑的老人不卖，不赏，不问剑给谁做什么——只问谁拔。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "旋芒？朝廷要找的那把剑。……小天邪不问这个。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry topic
#. native.npc.huo_zheng_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guo_cheng_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_ce_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.annie_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.wei_canglan_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.elon_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_chunfeng_lake inquiry topic
#. native.npc.liu_huixin_lake inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "湖底"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "湖底那颗头，三百年前是穿灵钉住的。这一回，我拿旋芒去。回不来，就回不来。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.master inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "湖底？玉螺湖底下的事，小天邪不问。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "潘军禅"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner nickname
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "书 剑 侠"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁执法使"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"潘军禅是当今武林的一位传奇性人物，以他仅仅二十八岁的年龄竟能做到\n"
"水烟阁执法使的职位，著实是一位不简单的人物。潘军禅是封山剑派掌门\n"
"柳淳风的结拜义弟，但是他为人其实十分风趣，又好交朋友，丝毫不会摆\n"
"出武林执法者的架子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.柳淳风
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "柳大哥？他是我的结拜义兄。你有他的信？拿来我看。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "阁里那把是假的，真剑不在这儿。要找去年那个道士，往野羊山北麓去。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.emote
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "看了柳淳风的信，笑了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "柳大哥的朋友就是我的朋友。邪剑穿灵？阁里挂着的那把，是仿的。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "真剑早就不在水烟阁了。挂一把假的，是鱼饵——钓那些冲着它来的人。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "去年就钓上来一个：黑衣黑冠的道士，夜里来试剑，发觉是假的就走了。我的人跟到野羊山北麓，跟丢了。那边没有道观，只有一片黑砖。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "柳大哥让你来的？信呢？没有他的信，执法使的佩剑不是你问得的。信丢了，回武馆找他再写一封。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.邪剑穿灵.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "执法使的佩剑，也是你问得的？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry topic
#. main.chapter4 title
#. waterfog.npc.elder5 inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.guest inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.tguest inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.old inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon inquiry topic
#. latemoon.npc.room.annihi inquiry topic
#: data/common/npcs.json data/story/chapter4.json data/waterfog/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "晚月庄。守它的人不白给——我说过了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "寒於宝衣？你倒问到点子上了。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "当年三件东西各归一处，宝衣归月神族保管。月神族早没了，只剩晚月庄那些女子——自称人灵区冥的后人，庄里供着她的神像，池边立着凤凰护庄。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "衣在不在庄里，我不知道。守它的人不白给——你去了就明白。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#. waterfog.npc.elder5 inquiry.宝衣.rules.lines.say
#: data/common/npcs.json data/waterfog/npcs.json
msgid "还有——野羊山那边前夜出了事。一伙黑冠道士摸上山，抓走了寨里两个人，挨个问：那天闯道观的孩子是谁。他们在找你。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.fighter.executioner inquiry.宝衣.rules.say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "执刑使管的是刀，不管衣裳。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绝尘子"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绝尘子本为释家人，后得奇人指点，得悟道家真谛，佛道双修，\n"
"皆入化境。后访遍名山大川，自号绝尘，创此绝尘一派。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master family.title
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "祖师"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绝尘子道：你为何无故滋事，误我清修！\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master chat_msg_combat
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绝尘子道：贫道向以遁世为乐，你何苦如此相逼？\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry.绝尘派
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "绝尘派是我所创，你有何指教？"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry.拜师
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "入我派者，需有慧根。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master inquiry.name
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "我便是绝尘子。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master apprentice.commoners_only
#. latemoon.npc.room.elon apprentice.commoners_only
#: data/common/npcs.json data/latemoon/npcs.json
msgid "{title}{nickname}{name}要叛师！！！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "入我派者，需有慧根。$RESPECT的资质不宜！"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "$RESPECT似乎尚缺江湖历练，不宜投入绝尘门下。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.juechen.master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "很好$RESPECT多加努力他日必定有成。"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier long
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一位来自天界的守护神，专门担任护法之责。\n"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name
#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name_pick
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "天甲神兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name_pick
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "天乙神兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name_pick
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "天丙神兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name_pick
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "天丁神兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name_pick
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "天戊神兵"
msgstr ""

#. common.npc.heaven_soldier name_pick
#: data/common/npcs.json
msgid "天己神兵"
msgstr ""

