#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard name
#. native.npc.keep_ambusher name
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "土匪喽罗"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard long
#. native.npc.keep_ambusher long
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这家伙满脸横肉，一付凶神恶煞的模样，令人望而生畏。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard chat_msg
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"土匪喽罗横刀拦住去路，喝道：站住！要过老松寨，留下十两银子买路钱！\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.买路钱
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "十两银子，一个子儿不能少。拿来！"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.老松寨
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "老松寨是常老大的寨子，泼风刀王常老大，听过没有？想进去，先留下买路钱。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.黑衣道士
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "前些天是来过一个黑衣黑冠的道士，拿一块金牌买了路，往里头去了。你要问，问寨主去——先留下买路钱。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry topic
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "叫阵"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.叫阵.confirm
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "叫阵是跟常老大单打独斗——寨里的人不插手，但常老大的泼风刀下，没几个人站得住。要叫阵吗？"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.叫阵.rules.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "叫过了还叫？聚义厅在东头，常老大等着你。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.叫阵.rules.lines.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "好大的口气！"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.叫阵.rules.lines.emote
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "朝寨子里扯着嗓子喊：有人叫阵——！"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard inquiry.叫阵.rules.lines.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "进去吧，聚义厅在东头。常老大一个人等你，寨里的弟兄不插手。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard accept_object.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "钱已经交过了，进去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard accept_object.line
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"土匪喽罗掂了掂银子，咧嘴一笑：算你识相。进去吧，寨里的弟兄不会难为你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_guard accept_object.line
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"土匪喽罗往地上啐了一口：打发叫花子呢？十两银子，少一个子儿都不行！\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader long
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这家伙眼神凶恶，一双精光四射的眼珠正盯著你的脖子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader chat_msg_combat
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"土匪首领阴恻恻地说道：这种三脚猫的功夫也敢上老松寨来撒野？！\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader chat_msg_combat
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"土匪首领说道：去你的，老子今天要剁下你的头来练练毒爪！\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader chat_msg_combat
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"土匪首领虎吼一声，欺身上前。\n"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_leader inquiry.黑衣道士
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "那道士的事，寨主自己会说。聚义厅在东头。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander nickname
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "泼风刀王"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander title
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "老松寨寨主"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander inquiry.黑衣道士.rules.lines.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣黑冠的道士？来过。拿一块金牌子买的路——金子打的，比你那十两银子值钱多了。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander inquiry.黑衣道士.rules.lines.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "他问我瀑布后头的山洞怎么走。老子这寨子什么钱都收，收了钱就指路：往东过石桥，瀑布旁边有藤蔓，荡过去就是。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander inquiry.黑衣道士.rules.lines.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "他抱着个石匣子，宝贝得很。你要找他，也往瀑布去吧，老子不拦你。"
msgstr ""

#. oldpine.npc.bandit_commander inquiry.黑衣道士.rules.say
#: data/oldpine/npcs.json
msgid "你是什么东西，也敢问老子的事？"
msgstr ""

