#. canyon.bamboo3.stone act.acts.steps.line
#: data/canyon/world.json
msgid ""
"你将大黄石缓缓的向左边移动，而出现了一个小小的隙缝。\n"
msgstr ""

#. canyon.bamboo3.stone act.acts.steps.line
#: data/canyon/world.json
msgid ""
"你照柳淳风教的法子，肩抵住青苔印，脚蹬石根，等风过竹林的那一下才发力——大黄石缓缓的向左边移动，而出现了一个小小的隙缝。\n"
msgstr ""

#. canyon.bamboo3.stone act.acts.steps.line
#: data/canyon/world.json
msgid ""
"你出力不太够喔！\n"
msgstr ""

#. canyon.bamboo3.gap name
#: data/canyon/world.json
msgid "隙缝"
msgstr ""

#. canyon.bamboo3.gap act.verb
#: data/canyon/world.json
