msgstr ""

#. canyon.bamboo3.gap act.acts.steps.line
#: data/canyon/world.json
msgid ""
"当你通过隙缝，大黄石又急速地合闭。\n"
msgstr ""

#. canyon.train.bookcase act.acts.steps.line
#: data/canyon/world.json
msgid ""
"你在书柜找了找但没找到些什么\n"
