#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.steps.line
#: data/city/world.json
msgid ""
"铁门开着。守门的禁军认得你，侧身让开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.ask
#: data/city/world.json
msgid "在午门外候到天亮殿试。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走：别处的人该走的走、该好的好。"
msgstr ""

#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.choice
#: data/city/world.json
msgid "候到天亮"
msgstr ""

#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.steps.line
#: data/city/world.json
msgid ""
"你在午门外的石狮子旁边站定。守门的禁军看了你一眼，没有赶你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.steps.line
#: data/city/world.json
msgid ""
"东方的天空中开始出现一丝微曦。午门外渐渐有了人：坐轿的、骑马的、走路的官，一个个在铁门外排好了班。\n"
msgstr ""

#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.steps.line
#: data/city/world.json
msgid ""
"铁门「轧轧」地开了。一个太监站在门里尖着嗓子喊：「宣——武状元觐见！」\n"
msgstr ""

#. city.wumen.wait act.acts.ask
#: data/city/world.json
