#. death.npc.hell_guard attack_ask
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "阴鬼牙将是守关鬼卒里的精锐，你现在只是一缕鬼魂，打输了会再死一次，再受一次死亡的惩罚。确定要攻击他吗？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle name
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle long
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白无常伸著长长的舌头瞪著你，死白的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白无常把长长的舌头伸出来，缓缓地舔了舔自己又白又长的手指。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常用奇异的眼光盯著你，好像要看穿你的一切似的。"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常「哼」的一声，从袖中掏出一本像帐册的东西翻看著。"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常阁上册子，说道：咦？阳寿未尽？怎么可能？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.wgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "白无常搔了搔头，叹道：罢了罢了，你走吧。"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle long
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑无常伸著长长的舌头瞪著你，黝黑的脸上看不出任何喜怒哀乐。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑无常发出一阵像呻吟的声音，当他发现你正注视著他的时候，瞪了你一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle chat_msg
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑无常把长长的舌头伸出来，缓缓地舔了舔自己又黑又长的手指。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle calls.steps.say
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "喂！阳人来阴间做什么？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "黑无常说道：喂！新来的，你叫什么名字？"
msgstr ""

#. death.npc.bgargoyle calls.steps.line
#: data/death/npcs.json
msgid "黑无常用奇异的眼光盯著你，好像要看穿你的一切似的。"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/bridge1 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里是一条漫长的石桥，往南石桥延伸进大雾之中，望不到尽头，\n"
"往北引隐约约有一座城楼，不过你分不清是真实的影像还是幻觉，东西\n"
"两面都是一望无际的大雾，一阵阵阴冷的微风从雾中吹过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/bridge long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在正站在一条极长的石桥上，桥头一块石碑上面刻著「奈何桥\n"
"」三个古篆，东、西两面都是大雾，连桥底下是不是水都看不到，浓雾\n"
"中有许多朦胧的人影鱼贯地向北走去，奈何桥往南延伸到一片大雾之中\n"
"，北边引隐约约有一座城楼的影子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/gate long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"这里就是著名的阴间入口「鬼门关」，在你面前矗立著一座高大的\n"
"黑色城楼，许多亡魂正哭哭啼啼地列队前进，因为一进鬼门关就无法再\n"
"回阳间了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/gateway long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你现在来到一座黑色城楼之前，城楼上刻著三个大字：酆都城。往\n"
"南不远处有一座桥，桥上鬼影幢幢，但是却听不到半点声音，往北走进\n"
"城楼只见一片黑漆漆的，只有少许暗红色的火光若隐若现地闪烁著。\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/road1 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你走在一条阴森森的路上, 浓浓的雾环绕在你的四周, 好像永\n"
"远都不会散去似的. 往南看去你勉强可以分辨出一个城楼的模样,\n"
"往北隐约可以看到几盏灯笼, 在浓雾中显得格外的诡异. 路的两旁\n"
"各有一栋木造的建筑, 门都是半开的, 但你看不清楚里面有什么.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/inn1 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你一进来就发现屋里异常的温暖, 墙角壁炉里微弱的火光将你\n"
"的影子投射在对面的墙上. 几个人影(shadows)围在炉旁不知在讨\n"
"论些什么. 屋内有几张木桌, 椅, 墙上挂了几幅字画, 一切看来非\n"
"常的详和宁静, 你几乎忘了自己身在何处.\n"
" \n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/inn2 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"屋里相当冷清, 外面的浓雾还不时地从半开著的门缝飘进来,\n"
"地面上散著一些破旧的物品, 不过光从外表已经无法分辨出那是些\n"
"什么东西了. 墙上(wall)刻著一些潦草的字体, 墙角的一盏灯笼挣\n"
"扎似地发出一阵阵微弱的光芒, 也始得那些字看来格外的诡异.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/road2 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"你走在一条阴森森的路上, 浓浓的雾环绕在你的四周, 好像永\n"
"远都不会散去似的. 整条路前后只看到零星的几盏灯笼........\n"
" \n"
msgstr ""

#. es2:d/death/road3 long
#: data/death/rooms.json
msgid ""
"浓雾在这里聚成一堵墙，路到这里就断了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.gateway.no_return lines
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "一个空洞的声音在你耳边响起...."
msgstr ""

#. death.gateway.no_return lines
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "没有回头路了!"
msgstr ""

#. death.road2.long_road lines
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "你走著走著..... 发现四周景色居然都没有变...."
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.landmark.shadows name
#. death.inn1.ask_home name
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "人影"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.landmark.shadows long
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"从你站的位置很难辨别出那几个人的容貌, 四个披著黑斗蓬的人斜靠在壁\n"
"炉边的角落, 偶尔传来其中几人说话的声音, 不过从这个距离你无法听到\n"
"他们讨论的内容. 当你还在考虑要不要靠过去一点时, 其中一人回头看了\n"
"你一眼, 你愣住了... 那人... 那人......... 居然长得跟你一模一样!\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn2.landmark.wall long
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"几行你勉强分辨得出来的字:\n"
"我被困在这里了.... 我要回家啦!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"                      ^^^^\n"
"                        靠自己啦...\n"
"什么叫靠自己啊?!?!? 这里连个活人都没有...\n"
"\n"
"看到你自己时问一下吧... 自己人都会互相帮忙的说.. \n"
"                                    ^^^^\n"
"                                 你... 确... 定?!?!\n"
"喔.. \n"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.ask_home act.verb
#: data/death/world.json
msgid "打听「回家」"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.ask_home act.acts.steps.line
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"你走上前去, 低声的向那个长得跟你一样的人询问回家的事.\n"
msgstr ""

#. death.inn1.ask_home act.acts.steps.line
#: data/death/world.json
msgid ""
"那人一句话也不说就往你这边撞过来, 你眼前一阵黑....\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/black_crown name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "黑冠"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/black_crown long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一顶黑绢裹的道冠，冠前镶一枚乌黑的铁片，铁片上錾着一个看不懂的字。逆灵宫的道士人人戴它——戴上它，他们也把你当自己人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger name
#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#: data/niling/items.json data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "账册"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一本黑皮的账册，封皮上没有字。翻开是一笔笔纳供的账：金帛、腌肉、麻绳……每一页的末尾另起一行，记的不是东西。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger no_drop
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "这本账册不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"你翻到最后几页。每一页末尾另起的那一行，记的是人：\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"「野羊寨，三名，丁未年秋，入丹房。」\n"
"「关北民夫，七名，戊申年冬，三名入丹房，四名留用。」\n"
"「傅家坡，孩童一名，七岁，戊申年腊月，留用，待子时。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/tribute_ledger act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"纳供的不只是金帛。你把账册合上，手心全是汗。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一叠公文纸，每张末尾盖着一方朱红的大印，印文是「兵部之印」。纸是新的，印泥还没干透。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers no_drop
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "这叠文书不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"文书的格式一板一眼，字是衙门里的楷书：\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"「着逆灵宫代为收管关北河工逃役若干名，解送之日另行知照。」\n"
"「着逆灵宫代为收管野羊山匪徒若干名，毋庸解京。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/war_ministry_papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"每一张的印都盖得端端正正。兵部的印，怎么会盖在一座黑道观的账上？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_key name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "地牢钥匙"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_key long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一把乌黑的铁钥匙，齿很深，柄上系着一截黑布。地牢三扇铁栅门用的都是它。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_key no_drop
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "这把钥匙还用得着，不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/scroll_fragment name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "逆灵天书残卷"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/scroll_fragment long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"半卷黑皮的经书，封皮上「逆灵天书」四个字只剩下三个。里面的字横着竖着走，看一眼就头晕。这是玄冥子的——他说过，要练六阴剑，拿着它来后山找他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/scroll_fragment no_drop
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "这卷残卷不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_huo name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "霍铮的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_huo long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"霍铮的尸首。铁链还在手腕上，拳头攥着，指缝里有血——不是他的。他到最后也没求饶。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_shitou name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "石头的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/body_shitou long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一个小孩子的尸首，头上两个小抓揪。他蜷在墙角，手里还攥着一颗小石子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/shang_jue_sword name
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid "黑剑"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/shang_jue_sword long
#: data/niling/items.json
msgid ""
"一把通体乌黑的长剑，剑身上没有一点光，像是把照上去的光都吃了进去。握在手里冰凉，剑脊上刻着一行细字，看不懂。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，两手把着绞盘的摇柄，肩膀一耸一耸。他看了你一眼，又低头去摇，像是什么也没看见——能上到这里来的，在他眼里都是宫里放上来的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士咬着牙摇了一圈绞盘，绳子吱吱地响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士嘟囔道：今年的供比去年沉……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士朝裂口里喊了一声：下面的，拴好了没有！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士头也不抬：供在那边堆着，管事叫你搬就搬。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士道：宫里的事，问管事去，别问我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士摇绳的手顿了一顿：不认识。……你问这个做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist inquiry.裂口
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "绞盘道士道：底下是野羊山的山路。宫里的人不走山路，只走这根绳。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_winch_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"绞盘道士松了绞盘，尖声道：来人哪！有生人上来了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在门房的桌后，面前摊着一本簿子，手里的笔却半天不动。他的眼睛不看簿子，看门洞——谁进来，他先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "抬眼看了看你头上的黑冠，又低下头去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "新来的？进去别乱走。后殿不许去，地牢不许去，管事叫你干什么就干什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士道：这里就是。进了这道门，就别再问这个名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士道：野羊寨的供今天到。东边货栈，搬完了再说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士的笔停了一下：没这个人。……谁让你问的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper inquiry.后殿
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "门房道士道：后殿是宫主行法的地方。没有大弟子的话，谁都不许进。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"门房道士厉声道：哪里来的野人，敢闯逆灵宫！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gatekeeper chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"门房道士朝院里喊：有生人！拦住他！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "守门道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，背着手站在院子里，腰上一柄短剑。他站得笔直，眼睛半闭着，像在听什么——听见生人的脚步，眼睛就睁开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士把腰上的短剑往上提了提。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士低声念了一句什么，声音像蚊子哼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "守门道士道：少说话，多干活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "守门道士朝东边一偏头：货栈。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士喝道：生人闯宫，留下！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_gate_guard chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门道士一剑劈空，剑风带起一股苦味。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽着，正把一只箱子里的绸缎一匹匹抖开来数。他数得很慢，数到一半停下来，往那几只画着符的箱子那边瞟一眼，再从头数。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士数着绸缎：……十一、十二……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士踢了踢一只画着符的箱子，箱子里没有动静，他松了口气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士道：都是野羊寨的供。你是哪一房的？管事让你来搬？搬那边的，画着符的别碰。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.箱子
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士压低声音：画符的那几只，是「祭」。等子时，大弟子来取。你没见过，我也没说过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士道：干活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "货栈道士道：野羊寨的大寨主？半年前就进了地牢，还问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士叫道：有贼！有贼偷供！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_store_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"货栈道士一边招架一边往门口退。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，跪在蒲团上，两手按着膝盖，嘴唇一开一合。他诵经的声音又低又快，像是怕慢一个字就要挨罚。他的眼睛是闭着的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士低声念道：……灵不灵，逆之则生……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士的声音忽然高了一下，又压了下去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士跪得久了，膝盖动了动，领诵的木鱼声一停，他立刻又跪直了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士闭着眼睛：诵经的时候不说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry topic
#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "经"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.经
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士压低声音：逆灵天书。你连这个都不知道？……不要问我，问领诵。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士的嘴唇停了一下，又接着念，像没听见。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter inquiry.后殿
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "诵经道士道：宫主在后殿行法。子时开坛，没你的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士尖叫道：生人！前殿有生人！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"诵经道士一边念经一边拔剑，念的和砍的一样快。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的老道士，跪在最前头的蒲团上，面前一只乌黑的木鱼。他一下一下敲着，节拍一丝不乱，诵的字句比别人多一倍。进来什么人、出去什么人，他一次头也没抬过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士的木鱼声一下紧似一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士念道：……以身为供，以劫为师……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士的木鱼没停：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。这是第一句。你连第一句都要人教？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.经
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士道：逆灵天书，宫主亲授。前殿只诵前三卷，后面的，没到你的分。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士的木鱼慢了一拍：野羊寨那个？在底下。子时便用他开坛。——你是哪一房的，问这个？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.后殿
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士道：后殿是宫主的。大弟子不带，谁也不许过那道门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "宫主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter inquiry.宫主
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "领诵道士道：宫主姓商。别的，不是你该问的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士霍地站起，木鱼槌一指：拿下！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_lead_chanter chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"领诵道士喝道：殿前动手，坛上加供！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在账房的大案后面，手里一支笔，面前一本账。他的手指上全是墨，指甲缝里是黑的。他抬头看了你一眼，眼睛先落在你的冠上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管事道士拨了两下算盘，皱起眉头，又拨回去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管事道士对着账册自言自语：七个……还差三个。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.纳供
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：野羊寨的供今年足数。关北的车下月到。你是来领活的？货栈搬箱子去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.账册
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士把手按在账册上：账是宫主要看的，不是给你看的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry topic
#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry topic
#. native.npc.customs_clerk inquiry topic
#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "文书"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.文书
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：兵部的公文，你认得字？……认得也当不认得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：野羊寨的大寨主，账上第三笔。子时开坛。你问这个做什么？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "钥匙"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：地牢的钥匙在大弟子腰上。我这里只有账，没有钥匙。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "管事道士道：少废话。干活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_steward chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管事道士把账册往怀里一塞，叫道：有贼！护账！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer name
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，靠着甬道的石壁站着，腰上没有钥匙，只有一柄短剑和一根鞭子。他听见脚步声就直起身来，先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士用鞭柄敲了敲铁栅：安静！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士打了个哈欠，往西边那间牢房瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：钥匙？在大弟子玄冥子腰上。开坛的时候他才下来开门。我们只看人，不开门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士朝西边一偏头：西边那间。骂了半年了，嗓子还没哑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.spice_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "孩子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.孩子
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：北边那间的小的？傅家坡抓来的。宫主说小孩子的供最干净。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry topic
#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry topic
#. native.npc.palace_steward inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry topic
#. native.npc.site_officer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.site_corvee name
#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.民夫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：东边两个，关北挖河的。挖不动了，就送到这里来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer inquiry.逆灵宫
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士道：底下不许多话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士抽出鞭子，吼道：地牢有生人！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng title
#. native.npc.huo_zheng_lake title
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山大寨主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高大的汉子，瘦得脱了形，颧骨突出来，手腕上两道铁链磨出来的血痕。头发胡子乱成一团，眼睛却亮得吓人。他被锁在牢房里，看见你，先骂了一句，再看清你的脸，骂声停了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮朝铁栅外啐了一口：臭道士！有种把老子放出去打！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮用铁链在墙上狠狠砸了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮喃喃道：黄霸……黄霸这个王八蛋……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮咬着牙道：两年前他们上山，寨子折了一半弟兄。老子带人来烧他们的观，中了埋伏——跟老子上山的弟兄，一个也没回去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shitou name
#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "石头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.石头
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮朝北边一偏头：北边那间的娃娃，傅家坡抓来的，才七岁。半年了，哭都哭不出声了。你要是能开门，先开他的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.黄霸
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮的眼睛红了：老三。老子前脚进来，他后脚纳供。纳的什么供？纳的是老子的弟兄！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮道：钥匙在那个姓玄的腰上——他们叫他大弟子。他每天子时下来一趟，挑人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "野羊寨"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.野羊寨
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮道：寨子还在吗？黄霸还在土地庙？……他要是还在，告诉他，老子没死。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.刘安禄
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮一愣：老刘？老刘没进来？好，好。他在哪？……他若肯回来，寨子还有救。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "二寨主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng inquiry.二寨主
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "霍铮低声道：老二就是老刘。那天他不肯跟来，骂老子是去送死。……他骂得对。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮吼道：来！老子手上有链子也打得死你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "挣了挣手上的铁链——链子早让他磨断了一半，一扯就开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "好兄弟。老子跟你走。北边那间还有个娃娃，一起带上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个七岁的小孩子，头上梳着两个小抓揪，脸脏得看不出模样，衣服还是傅家坡的粗布。他缩在牢房的角落里，看见你，往墙上又缩了缩，没有哭。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"石头把墙角的几颗小石子摆了又摆。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"石头小声说：娘……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "娘"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.娘
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头抬起头：娘在傅家坡。娘说别跟人走。……我没跟人走，是他们把我装进箱子里的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.傅家坡
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头道：我家在湖边，门口有瓜地。娘每天到村口等我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.黑松山
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头摇头：不是黑松山。是黑衣服的道士，他们说是黑松山的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头小声道：他们晚上来挑人。挑走的就不回来了。那个大胡子叔叔说，轮到我他就把门撞开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "石头道：西边的大胡子叔叔。他骂人的时候我就不怕了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "愣了一下，爬起来抓住你的衣角。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shitou calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "……带我回家。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑瘦的汉子，手掌全是老茧，肩膀上一道挑担磨出来的硬皮。他穿的是河工的短褂，上头印着一个「役」字。他靠着墙坐着，眼睛半闭，像是把力气都省着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关北民夫揉着肩膀，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关北民夫低声道：……河挖不动了，人也挖不动了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.关北
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：俺们是关北挖河的。河工挖不动的，官府说送回家，车一拐就到了这里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：这里的道士拿人当药材。俺亲眼看见的，不骗你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.文书
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：押车的说俺们是兵部批的。兵部？俺们挖河，关兵部什么事？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北民夫道：西边那位是条汉子。有他骂着，俺们还敢喘气。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_corvee calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "俺们回关北！多谢恩公！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue name
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake name
#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting name
#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting name
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue title
#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake title
#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting title
#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting title
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫宫主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道人，背对着你站在黑石坛前，双手拢在袖里。他的衣冠和别的道士一样，只是黑得更深，像是吸光的。他念经的声音不高，一句接一句没有停顿，像水从石缝里渗出来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "商玦没有回头：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。你既走上坛来，便是明白人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "商玦的声音没有起伏：供品。子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "后殿里没有神像。一座黑石坛立在正中，坛上一团黑焰无声地烧着，照不亮什么。商玦背对着你，念经的声音没有停。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "……以身为供，以劫为师。灵不灵，逆之则生。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "转过身来，目光在你的脸上停了一停。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "宫主，有生人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "祭品自己走上坛来，是劫的意思。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "黑焰忽然向上一窜，焰心里现出一个人形——没有头。它站在坛上，两只手朝前摸索着，像在找什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "的手摸到了坛沿，停住了。整座后殿冷得像井底。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "它在找头。找了五千年。子时开坛，带祭品上来，它便安静一夜。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "解下腰间一把乌黑的钥匙，看也不看，往后一抛。玄冥子接住了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "去，告诉底下的人：子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "黑焰里的人形散成一股黑烟，坛上又只剩一团焰。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "你戴着我们的冠，却不是我们的人。等子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.emote
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "转身走向坛后的黑门。门开了，门里比殿里更黑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "子时见。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue calls.steps.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "坛底的石缝里有什么东西在爬。两个鬼卒从坛底爬了出来——灰绿的皮，手里一柄钢叉，面目狰狞。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi name
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi title
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff title
#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff moods.owed.title
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫大弟子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，比别的道士高出半个头，站在坛边，腰上挂着一柄长剑和一串钥匙。他的脸上没有表情，眼睛却一直在动——看坛、看门、看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子按住腰上的钥匙串：子时。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子站在崖径当中，长剑已经出鞘。崖边的绳索断了，商玦不在。他挡在你和断崖之间，没有让的意思。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子冷冷道：宫主先走。你，留下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子的剑上带着一股阴风，剑过处连雾都裂开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.商玦.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "宫主下了崖。他不要我了，我也不要他了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.商玦.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子冷冷道：宫主已经走了。你追不上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry topic
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "六阴剑"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.六阴剑.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "要练六阴剑，带着残卷来后山找我——不是现在。宫里的事还没完。你记住这条路。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.六阴剑.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "残卷不在你身上，谈什么六阴剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.六阴剑.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "玄冥子冷笑：你也配问？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.关北.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北的车不来了。宫主要的那扇门还在土里——你以为踏平一个工地，就断得了他的念头？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.关北.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北的车还在走。你救了几个？四个？车上这个月少了两个人，宫主连眉毛都没动一下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff inquiry.关北.rules.say
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "关北？挖不动的人从那儿来。你问这个做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xuan_mingzi_cliff moods.owed.chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"玄冥子靠着后墙坐着，看着断崖，没有说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.headless_shade name
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "无头黑影"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.headless_shade long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个人形的黑影，没有头。它的脖颈处是一片比夜更黑的空，两只手朝前伸着，一下一下地摸索。它不出声——它没有嘴。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner long
#. native.npc.hell_runner_tomb long
#. native.npc.hell_runner_finale long
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个灰绿皮肤、面目狰狞的鬼卒，手里一柄钢叉。它的眼眶里没有眼珠，只有两点青火。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.hell_runner_tomb chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.hell_runner_finale chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"鬼卒喝道：孽障！随我赴阴司受审吧。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.hell_runner_tomb chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.hell_runner_finale chat_msg_combat
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"鬼卒的钢叉带起一股腥风。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hell_runner vanishes.line
#. native.npc.hell_runner_tomb vanishes.line
#. native.npc.hell_runner_finale vanishes.line
#: data/niling/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "鬼卒一声不响地散成一股黑烟，钢叉当啷掉在地上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed long
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，靠着甬道的石壁站着，腰上多了一把乌黑的钥匙，一只手一直按在上面。他听见脚步声就直起身来，先看冠，再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士摸了摸腰上的钥匙，往西边那间牢房瞟了一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed chat_msg
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid ""
"狱卒道士低声道：子时……还有两个时辰。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry.钥匙
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士按住腰上的钥匙：大弟子刚丢下来的。子时开坛，你等着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_jailer_keyed inquiry.霍铮
#: data/niling/npcs.json
msgid "狱卒道士朝西边一偏头：西边那间。子时第一个就是他。"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/winch long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"野羊山北麓的崖顶。脚下就是那道裂口，一根粗麻绳从绞盘上绕下去，没进黑黝黝的口子里——山路转角的纳供就是从这里吊上来的。\n"
"吊上来的箱子在平台上堆了一人高，箱板上烙着「羊」字。北边一条货道沿着山脊往北麓去，尽头隐约是一片黑砖的屋脊。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/goods_path long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一条被车轮和脚印压实的货道，顺着北麓的山脊往北去。两旁是枯黄的长草和风化的黑灰色岩石，没有一棵像样的树。\n"
"路北头立着一座全用黑砖砌成的大道观，山门敞着，门里黑幡垂地；靠东有一条岔路绕向道观的东墙根。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/side_door long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"道观东墙根下的一块空地，车辙到这里为止。黑砖墙上开着一扇矮门，门楣上没有字，门槛磨得发白——供品是从这里进去的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/gatehouse long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的山门。黑砖砌的门楼有两丈高，门扇敞着，门洞里凉得像井底。两侧各挑着一盏暗红的灯笼，白天也点着。\n"
"门房的桌上摊着一本簿子，桌后坐着一个黑衣黑冠的道士。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/yard long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"黑砖铺地的大院子，踩上去没有一点声响。院当中一只黑铁香炉，烧的不是香，是一股子苦味。四面黑幡垂地，风过时幡上的字一闪一闪，看不清写的什么。\n"
"北边是前殿，殿门关着，推一推就开；东侧一排矮房是货栈。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/store long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间堆满箱笼的矮房，箱子上都烙着「羊」字，有的开着，露出金帛、腌肉和成捆的麻绳。角落里几只箱子钉得死紧，箱盖上用朱砂画着符。\n"
"南墙的矮门通向墙外，西边的门进前院。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/front long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的前殿。殿里没有神像，正中一张乌黑的长案，案上供的是一卷摊开的黑皮经书。五个黑衣黑冠的道士面壁跪在蒲团上诵经，领诵的敲着木鱼，一下一下，谁进来都不抬头。诵的字句一个也听不懂，只觉得殿里比外头冷。\n"
"西边一道门通丹房；北边的门紧闭着，门后隐约也有诵经声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/alchemy long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间烟气熏黑的屋子。正中一座三足的铜丹炉，炉火没有熄，炉口里的火苗是青的，不是红的。四壁的药架上摆满了罐子，罐子上贴的签子写的不是药名，是地名和日子。\n"
"东门回前殿，北门进账房；西南角上一道石阶往下，黑得看不见底。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/counting long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的账房，比丹房还小。一张乌木大案占了半间屋，案上摊着一本账册，旁边一叠盖了朱印的文书，压着一方乌黑的镇纸。墙上挂着算盘，算珠磨得发亮。\n"
"门在南边，通丹房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/corridor long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"丹房石阶底下的甬道，低得要弯腰。墙上一盏松油灯忽明忽暗，照着三扇铁栅门：西、北、东各一扇，锁都是新的。地上一层潮气，墙根有抓挠过的痕迹。\n"
"石阶在南边，上去是丹房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_huo long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头凿出来的牢房，只有一张草席、一只破碗。墙上用指甲刻了一排又一排的道道，数到一半刻不动了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_shitou long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头凿出来的牢房，比西边那间还小。草席上放着半块干饼，墙角摆着几颗排成一排的小石子，像是谁在玩。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cell_others long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头凿出来的牢房，两张草席并排铺着。墙上用炭画了一条河，河边画着一排小人在挖土。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/altar long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫的后殿。殿里没有神像，正中一座黑石砌的坛，坛上一团黑焰无声地烧着，照不亮什么，只把坛边的影子拉得老长。四壁的黑幡比前殿的更高，幡上的字是暗红的，像血写的。\n"
"南门回前殿。坛后有一道黑门，门上一个字也没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/master long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"商玦的居所，比后殿暖，暖得不自然。一张乌木书案，案上笔墨整齐；靠墙一座书架，空了——架上的灰尘留着一排书脊的印子。案角一只黑匣，开着，里面什么也没有。\n"
"南边的黑门回后殿；北墙一扇小门，门外是风声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cliff_path long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"逆灵宫后山的崖径，窄得只容一人，一边是黑砖的后墙，一边是深不见底的崖。风从崖底上来，带着雾。崖径往北走到头是断崖。\n"
"南边的小门回宫主的居所。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:niling/cliff long
#: data/niling/rooms.json
msgid ""
"崖径的尽头。一根绳索拴在崖边的铁桩上，另一头垂进雾里——绳子在三尺外被割断了，断口新得发白。再往前一步就是空的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.front.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "殿门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_huo.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "西牢房的铁栅门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_huo.door locked
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "铁栅门锁着，锁是新的，摇一摇纹丝不动。钥匙不在这里。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_shitou.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "北牢房的铁栅门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_shitou.door locked
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "铁栅门锁着。栅栏里的孩子往后缩了缩。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_others.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "东牢房的铁栅门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cell_others.door locked
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "铁栅门锁着。里面的人抬起头看了看你，又低下去。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.altar.door name
#: data/niling/world.json data/choyin/voxel/town.json
msgid "北门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.winch.rope act.verb
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "下到山路"
msgstr ""

#. niling.winch.rope act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你抓住麻绳，顺着裂口里的岩壁一点点溜下去。绳子磨得手心发烫，脚下终于踩到了山路的石头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "小门"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.verb
#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.choice
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "追出去"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。崖径上空无一人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.ask
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "后门外是后山的崖径，商玦刚从这里出去，玄冥子跟在后头替他断后。追出去，要和玄冥子打一场，也赶不回地牢了——救人和追宫主，只来得及一件。"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.back_door act.acts.steps.line
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"你推开小门，风裹着雾扑进来。崖径上有脚步声，往北去了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.winch.landmark.crates long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"吊上来的箱子堆了一人高，每只箱板上都烙着一个「羊」字——野羊寨的记号。箱缝里露出绸缎的一角，另一只箱子底下渗出暗红的水渍，闻着是腌肉的咸味，也许不是。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.banners name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑幡"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.banners long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"黑布的幡从一丈多高的杆子上垂到地，布面上用暗红的颜色写满了字，笔画横着走、竖着走，像是经文又像是符咒。风一过，字就一闪一闪地动，盯久了眼睛发酸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.burner name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "香炉"
msgstr ""

#. niling.yard.landmark.burner long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"一只齐腰高的黑铁香炉，炉口里烧着的不是香，是一把把黑色的碎末，冒着极淡的青烟，味道苦得呛人。炉身上铸着一圈无头的人形，手拉着手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.front.landmark.scripture name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "经书"
msgstr ""

#. niling.front.landmark.scripture long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"乌黑的长案上摊着一卷黑皮的经书，字是暗红的，横着走竖着走，和黑幡上的一样。你盯着看了一会儿，字像是在动，赶紧移开了眼。案角摆着一只木鱼，鱼身上的漆被敲掉了一块。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.alchemy.landmark.furnace long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"一座三足铜丹炉，炉身熏得乌黑。炉口的火苗是青色的，没有一点热气。炉边的托盘上摆着几颗乌黑的丹丸，闻着是一股说不出的腥甜。你不想知道它们是什么炼的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.alchemy.landmark.jars name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "药架"
msgstr ""

#. niling.alchemy.landmark.jars long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"药架上的罐子一只只封着口，签子上写的不是药名：「野羊 · 丁未秋」「关北 · 戊申冬」……有一只罐子的签子上写着「傅家坡 · 待」，罐子是空的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.corridor.landmark.scratches name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "刻痕"
msgstr ""

#. niling.corridor.landmark.scratches long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"西边那扇铁栅门里的墙根上，一排排指甲刻出来的道道，五个一组，刻了一百多组。最后一组只有三道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.altar.landmark.altar name
#. lancheng.diviner_altar.landmark.altar name
#: data/niling/world.json data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "黑石坛"
msgstr ""

#. niling.altar.landmark.altar long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"黑石砌成的坛，齐胸高，坛面磨得发亮。坛上烧着一团黑焰，没有温度，没有声音，凑近了看，焰心里像有东西在动。坛脚的石缝里塞着碎骨。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.landmark.shelf long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"空书架。灰尘上留着一排书脊的印子，最宽的那一道在正中。架子最底下掉着一页烧了一半的纸，只剩「逆灵」两个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.landmark.box name
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid "黑匣"
msgstr ""

#. niling.master.landmark.box long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"一只黑漆木匣，开着。匣里垫着黑绒，绒上压出一个长条形的印子，像是放过一卷书——或者一把剑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. niling.cliff.landmark.rope long
#: data/niling/world.json
msgid ""
"绳索被割断了，一头垂在雾里。断口整齐，是一剑。商玦就是从这里下去的，你没法跟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould name
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "印模"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一块巴掌大的泥模，拓的是镇国大将军印的印面，「镇国大将军」五个字反着。模子边上沾着一抹朱砂，正红的，拿到亮处看还泛一点黄光。赫造基拓它的时候，真印正丢在后备兵手里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.verb
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "比印"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"你把印模翻过来，按在兵部文书末尾那方「镇国大将军」印旁边，对着光看。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"模子上的朱砂是正红的，泛一点黄光——真印的颜色。文书上的印色暗红发黑，像是朱砂里掺了别的东西。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"字口一模一样，一笔不差。只差一个颜色。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"你想明白了：文书上兵部自己的印是真的——文书确实出自兵部；旁边这方「镇国大将军」印是照赫造基卖出去的模子浇的，严廷殷从没盖过。兵部借镇国大将军的名头设卡拿人，令是在先帝那一句后头添的；人，就是拿这样的文书抓走的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"你记住了这个颜色。往后再见到这方印，一眼就能看出是哪一颗盖的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:canyon/seal_mould act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"光拿着模子比不出什么。得有一张盖了印的文书，把印模按在印旁边看。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/saber name
#. native.npc.guanbei_smith inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/items.json data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "马刀"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/saber long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一把关北的马刀，刀身带弯，刀背厚，刀柄缠着牛皮绳。马上一撩就是一条口子，平地上使也凑合。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/gladius name
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "大秦短剑"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/gladius long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一把大秦的短剑，剑身宽而直，两面开刃，剑尖是一个三角。剑柄是一整块骨头雕的，握上去正合手。剑鞘是铁片缀的，上面錾着一只看不出是什么的鸟。卢卡说这是好剑，他没说错。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mares_milk_wine name
#. native:guanbei/mares_milk_wine liquid.name
#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/items.json data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "马奶酒"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mares_milk_wine long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一只羊皮缝的酒囊，装着酸味冲鼻的马奶酒。关里人头一口皱眉，第二口就不皱了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mares_milk_wine unit
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "囊"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mutton name
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "手抓羊肉"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mutton long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一大块带骨的羊肉，锅里现捞出来的，撒了一把盐。关北人不用筷子，用手抓。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mutton food.leaves.name
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "啃干净的羊骨头"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/mutton food.leaves.long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一根啃得干干净净的羊骨头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/saber_manual name
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid "马刀谱"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/saber_manual long
#: data/guanbei/items.json
msgid ""
"一册翻得起毛的小册子，羊皮封面，里头是用炭笔画的七页图：一个人在马上，刀自下而上撩出去。每一页边上都写着同一句话：「撩，不是砍。」最后一页画的是一个人跳下马，把刀插回鞘里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/saber_manual unit
#. native:imperial/palace_blade_manual unit
#: data/guanbei/items.json data/imperial/items.json
msgid "册"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关门兵"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "天驼关守军"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿铁灰号衣的兵，手里横着一杆长枪，枪头擦得雪亮。他眼睛盯着出关的人，不盯进关的——出关的要留钱。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关门兵把枪往地上一顿：出关的，过路钱。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关门兵眯着眼看了看北边的天：又要起风沙了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"关门兵喝道：闯关？你当这是你家后院！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "翻了翻手里的名册，抬头看你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "名册上有你。大队长列的——过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.信.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "说过了，过去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.信.rules.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "接过信，看了看封皮上的字，又还给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.信.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "乔阴程县令的信？老王爷的侄子……行。过去吧。关北的事，我们不管。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.信.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "什么信？没信就留钱。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "过路钱"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.过路钱.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你的钱留过了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.过路钱.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "五两。王法朝法都管不到这道门，这是大将军的规矩——出关的留五两，进关的不要钱。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.关北
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "出了这道门就是槐阳王的地界。那边是王法，不是朝法。那边的事，我们不管，也管不了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.严廷殷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "大将军的兵。门是大将军的，钱也是。你要是大将军的朋友——他可没朋友。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry topic
#. guanbei.gate_road.landmark.gate name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "关门"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier inquiry.关门
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "谷地东壁这道门是先帝年间开的，通关北的军道。以前一年走不了几个人，这一年多了——兵部的车，一辆一辆往北去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "过了就过了，钱老子不嫌多。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "掂了掂，揣进怀里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "五两，过路钱。过去吧——关北的事别回来找我们。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "五两。少一个子儿不开门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pass_gate_soldier accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "这是什么东西？拿回去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "城门兵"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿灰褐短袄的兵，腰里一把弯刀，脸让风沙吹得黑红。他看人的眼神直来直去，不像朝廷的兵那样先看你的衣裳。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"城门兵冲进城的驼队点了点头，没要钱。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"城门兵朝告示那边努了努嘴：都看看，王爷的话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry.告示
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷贴的。兵部的人要是敢拿着文书来关北拿人，先过我们这一关。你是外乡人？看看就知道这儿的规矩了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry.民夫
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "去年到今年，关北没了几百个壮丁。王爷拒了兵部的令，可人还是一批一批没了——都是往草原东边去的。王爷查到今天。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry.兵部
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的令，在关北不算数。王爷说的，我们照办。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry.王府
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "大街北头，朱门就是。王爷不见生人——你有凭据，门军会放你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_gate_guard inquiry.槐阳王
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老王爷镇关北二十年。他说话不绕弯子，你也别绕。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "驼夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个裹着羊皮袄的驼夫，脸上一层沙，牙倒是很白。他的骆驼卧在城门里嚼草，鼻子里哼哼地出气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"驼夫拍了拍骆驼的脖子，骆驼不理他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"驼夫说道：关北的马，关里的茶，一进一出。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "驼队"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver inquiry.驼队
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "皮子、盐、砖茶，从西边来，到槐阳换马。关北的矮脚马耐跑，关里人抢着要。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver inquiry.关北
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北好啊，没人查你的货。王爷只收一成，剩下的都是你的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camel_driver inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边？别去。兵部的人圈了一大片地在挖什么，见了生面孔就拿去当民夫。我们的驼队都绕着走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "铁匠"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个光着膀子的铁匠，胸口的汗混着铁屑。砧子上一把弯刀刚出炉，还红着。他打的是马刀——关北的刀都带弯，马上好使。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"铁匠把一把弯刀按进水槽，嗤的一声白烟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"铁匠说道：关北的刀带弯，马上一撩就是一条口子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith inquiry.马刀
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的马刀，弯的，马上使的。十五两一把，不还价。你要是在平地上使，也凑合。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/choyin/voxel/town.json data/city/voxel/main.json data/guanbei/voxel/town.json
msgid "铁"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith inquiry.铁
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "铁从关里来，炭是草原上的羊粪烧的。别笑，羊粪火稳。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guanbei_smith inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的人来买过铁镐，一买两百把。两百把铁镐，挖的不是官道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "巴朗"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "马贩"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个矮壮的马贩子，脸上皱纹像刀刻的，腰里别着一根马鞭。他看马的眼光比看人准，看你的时候像在估你能驮多少。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"巴朗掰开一匹马的嘴看了看牙，摇摇头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"巴朗冲卢卡那边喊：高鼻子，今天卖出去了没有？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "马"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry.马
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的矮脚马，不好看，耐跑。一天二百里，不吃精料。你要买，先学会骑——不会骑的人我不卖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.luca name
#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "卢卡"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry.卢卡
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "那个高鼻子？大秦来的，说是什么剑会的人。在我这儿坐了半个月，天天想卖他那把剑换路费——没人识货。他那把剑是好东西，我看得出，可关北人不使短剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部征马也征人。草原东边挖什么古坟，我的马卖过去二十匹，一匹没回来。人也是——那些民夫进去了就不出来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry.关北
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北是王爷的。王爷不奉兵部的令，兵部就自己来人。你看吧，早晚要出事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.balang inquiry.番坊
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "卢卡老说的那个地方？海边，很远。他说他们的人都在那儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca title
#. native.npc.luca moods.bitter.title
#. native.npc.luca moods.going.title
#. native.npc.luca moods.waiting.title
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman name
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman_lake name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大秦剑手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高鼻深目的异族人，头发是褐色的，剪得很短，下巴上一层胡茬。他穿着关北人的羊皮袄，袄底下露出一截铁片缀成的甲。面前铺着一块布，布上放着一把短剑，剑身宽、直，和中原的剑都不一样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡用一块布擦着短剑，擦得很慢。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡看着东边的天，说了一句你听不懂的话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡沉声道：你，不该动手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "不卖了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "剑在你手里了。用它，别挂着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "剑还在。路费是会里给的，这把是我自己的。二十两，你要，还卖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "剑。大秦的铁，好剑。二十两，换路费——我要去海边。你不买，看看也行。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "路费"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.路费.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "到了。走了一个月。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.路费.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "去海边，番坊。远。马、吃的、过关的钱。二十两，够。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.鬼.rules.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "放下布，看着你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.鬼.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我们那边的老兵，传一个故事：东方，有一个鬼，没有头。找自己的头，三百年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.鬼.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我以为是故事。到了东方，人人都在找一把剑——找剑的人说，剑钉着一个头。我就想，不是故事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.头.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "鬼的头在哪里，我不知道。会首知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.头.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "头？我们那边的老兵说，东方有一个鬼找自己的头。三百年。你问这个——你也在找？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#. native.npc.andun family.title
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "会首"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.会首.rules.say
#. native.npc.luca inquiry.安敦.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "船上。押走的。——你知道那文书是假的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.会首.rules.say
#. native.npc.luca inquiry.安敦.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首在里头。我跟他说了你——他知道你要来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.会首.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首安敦。铁盾会的会首，我们的头。他的祖上，三百年前，在这里当过兵，见过那个鬼的头——怎么封的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.会首.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "他在番坊，海边。你去，说卢卡让你去。他会见你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.会首.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首？我们的头。先问鬼。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.番坊.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "没有我们的地方了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.番坊.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "就是这里。港口小，人多，各过各的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.番坊.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "海边。大秦人、天竺僧、倭人，都在那里，各过各的。远——玉螺湖村，出忘情谷，走海崖道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry topic
#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "大秦"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.大秦
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "很远。西边的西边。我们是逃出来的人，不是使臣。剑会收我们，给饭吃。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#. native.npc.andun name
#. native.npc.shield_youth inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "安敦"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.安敦.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首。在番坊等我——等不到我，等到你也行。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.安敦.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我们的会首。先问鬼。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.铁盾会.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "空了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.铁盾会.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我们的会。剑、盾、饭，都是会里的。会首管。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "假的。你知道。我知道。火也知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄走了。会首说，你欠的人情，我们记着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "市舶司的那张纸。印是假的——会首看过，说那方镇国大将军的印不是真印盖的。可印是不是真的，不是我们说了算。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "跟我走"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.跟我走.confirm
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "让卢卡跟着你走——他会跟你去每一个地方，站在你这边打。要叫他跟上吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.跟我走.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "不。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.跟我走.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.跟我走.rules.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "把短剑挂上腰，站到你身边。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.跟我走.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首说了：你去哪儿，我去哪儿。走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.跟我走.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首没说。冯禄的事了了，再说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "等我"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.等我.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "好。我在这儿等。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca inquiry.等我.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "等什么？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "剑卖了。钱，够了。谢谢。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "把钱数了一遍，点点头，把短剑连鞘递给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "好剑。别挂着，用它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "把钱数了一遍，点点头，把布上的短剑连鞘递给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "好剑。别挂着，用它。——路费够了。我去番坊。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "二十两。少了，不卖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "不要。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "看见你，站了起来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你来了。路，不近。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "会首在里头。他知道你要来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "坐在栈道头上，没有起身。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你知道那文书是假的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "看了一眼湖水，停住了脚。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "大秦人不会水。我在岸上等你。那东西上来了，我在这儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "站了起来，短剑出了鞘。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "上来了。我说过我在这儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca moods.bitter.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡看着海，没有说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca moods.bitter.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡把短剑连鞘放在膝上，手按在上面。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca moods.going.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡跟在你身后，短剑挂在腰上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca moods.going.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡说道：走。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.luca moods.waiting.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卢卡靠着墙，等你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "牧民"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿毡袍的牧民，腰里系一条红布带，脚上是软底的皮靴。他赶了两匹马来卖，自己坐在栏边啃干肉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"牧民啃了一口干肉，冲马栏里吹了声口哨。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"牧民说道：草原上的风，今年早。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman inquiry.草原
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "出了东门就是。往东走一天，有我们的帐篷；再往东，就是兵部圈的地了，别去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "帐篷"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman inquiry.帐篷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我们的帐篷在东门外。毡子做的，冬天暖，拆了就走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herdsman inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的人在草原东边挖一座古冢。我们的老人说，那是不能动的地方——金乌的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "胡三娘"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "酒肆掌柜"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高大的女人，袖子挽到肘，手里一把剁肉的刀。她说话嗓门大，不笑，可谁的酒碗空了她都看得见。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"胡三娘一刀剁下去，案板跳了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"胡三娘说道：马奶酒三十文一囊，羊肉四十文一份，要就坐下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry.马奶酒
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "马奶发的酒，酸，后劲大。三十文一囊。关里人头一口都皱眉，第二口就不皱了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "羊肉"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry.羊肉
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "手抓的，锅里现煮。四十文一份，管饱。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry.民夫
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "墙根坐的那几个，都是等人的。等男人，等儿子。兵部的人押了壮丁去修官道——说是修官道。去了的一个没回来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。别去，兵部的人见了生面孔就拿。我这儿的酒客去了两个，都没回来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry topic
#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry topic
#. native.npc.palace_guard inquiry topic
#. native.npc.palace_steward inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.hu_sanniang inquiry.王爷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷是好王爷，拒了兵部的令。可拒了令，人还是没了——王爷也只能在城门上贴张告示。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "秦婆子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦小的老妇人，裹着一件补了又补的毡袍，坐在墙根的板凳上，面前一碗马奶酒没动。她每过一会儿就看一眼门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"秦婆子朝门口看了一眼，又低下头去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lao_qin name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老秦"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry.老秦.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "回来了。你看他坐在那儿，瘦得脱了形——是你开的牢门，他跟我说了一百遍。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry.老秦.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我家老秦。去年腊月让人押走的，说是修官道。车是往东边去的……到今天没回来。听说挖不动的人会让道士的车接走——我家老秦，腰不好。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。我去过一回，栅栏外头站了一天，白衣的武官拿枪杆把我赶走了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "都回来了？营地那边说人都回来了。王爷的兵去的——这回王爷不光贴告示了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "回来了四个。营地那边有人哭有人笑。我家老秦早回来了，我没资格说什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_popo inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的壮丁，一批一批。王爷拒了令，兵部就自己来人拿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "秦小六"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个半大的少年，瘦，眼睛很亮，手里攥着一根马鞭。他坐在老妇人身边，一会儿站起来一会儿坐下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"秦小六站起来，又让他娘按着坐下了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "爹"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu inquiry.爹.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我爹回来了。他说是一个外乡人开的牢门——是你？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu inquiry.爹.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我爹让兵部的人押走了。我要去找他，我娘不让。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.qin_xiaoliu inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我去过一回，栅栏外头。白衣的武官不让近。里头在挖一个大坑，坑边上一排排的人戴着枷。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "逃回来的民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦得脱了形的汉子，手腕上铁链磨出来的印子还没褪。他坐在酒肆的角落里，背靠着墙，看见生人进门就缩一下肩膀——然后看清是你，站了起来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"老秦摸了摸手腕上的印子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "从墙角站起来，盯着你看了一会儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "是你！开牢门的是你！——婆子，是这位恩人开的牢门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "那地方……我们七个人从工地让车拉走，到了那儿，三个进了丹房再没出来，四个关进地牢。后来又提走两个。你开了牢门，我和老赵才活着回来——老赵回他家去了，在草原上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "听说了。王府的骑兵冲进去，把棚里的人全放了。那地方该踏平——我在那儿挖了三天，腰就废了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "听说夜里有人进去救了四个。四个……剩下四个还在那儿挖。换了我，也只能救四个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。白衣的武官督着挖一座古冢，挖不动的人，就让道士的车接走。我腰不好，第三天就让接走了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin inquiry.车
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "黑布蒙着的车，两个黑衣黑冠的道士押着。一路往南，过天驼关，到野羊山北麓。车里的人谁也不说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lao_qin inquiry.地牢
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "铁栅门，黑得看不见手。隔壁关着一个汉子，骂了半年没停过——后来听说是野羊山的大寨主。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府门军"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿灰褐短袄、外罩皮甲的门军，腰刀，手按在刀柄上。他看你的眼神不凶，只是不让。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"王府门军往门里看了一眼，又站直了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry.信.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "进去吧。正厅，王爷在。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry.信.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "信？拿着信去叩门。王爷等这封信等了半个月了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry.信.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "什么信？没凭据，王爷不见生人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry.王爷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老王爷在正厅。有凭据的进，没凭据的回。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "凭据"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry.凭据
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府的令、县衙的信、王爷认识的人的话——有一样就行。空口无凭，回去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_gate_guard inquiry.兵部
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的人来过一回，拿着文书要王爷交人。王爷把文书扔出了门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "程朔"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"六十六岁的老人，坐在交椅上背挺得笔直，头发全白了，眉毛也白了，眼睛却亮。一身灰布袍子，腰里一把刀，不是摆设。他说话直来直去，一句是一句，从不说「本王」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔把手里的文书往案上一放。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔说道：关北的事，关北自己了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo moods.read.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔把那封信又看了一遍，折好收进袖子里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo moods.read.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔说道：不平这孩子，字还是那么瘦。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo moods.rebel.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔把一封兵部的文书看了一眼，扔进火盆。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo moods.rebel.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔说道：兵部文书至：槐阳反。随他们说。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo moods.clean.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔看着厅外的天，没有说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo moods.clean.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"程朔说道：夜里的事，王府不知道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "接过信，拆开，看了很久。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "不平的字。兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的——我早说了，没人听。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "他说你从逆灵宫一路追过来，带着文书、抄本，还有人证。好。关北欠你一顿饭。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你要找的人在草原东边：兵部圈了地，三千民夫在挖一座古冢，说是修官道。挖不动的人，一辆道士的车接走。我的告示贴了，人还是没了——他们拿的是兵部的印，我的兵拦不住朝廷的印。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "要动那块地，两条路：借我的兵踏平它，或者让郭承带你夜里进去。你自己想，想好了开口。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "钱留着。关北不缺这个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "这是什么？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo accept_object.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "东西留着。信呢？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "借兵"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.confirm
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "借槐阳王的兵踏平工地——救下所有人，可兵部会以此定关北「反」。要借吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵已经给你了。郭承在校场点人，六骑够了——多了反而是反。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你和郭承说好了夜里去。那就夜里去——兵不动。两头都要，哪头都做不成。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.rules.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "看了你很久，站起来，把刀从椅旁拿下来又放回去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "踏平了，工地上的人一个不少。可兵部的文书第二天就到京师：槐阳王反了。皇帝十六岁，先听到的是这句。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你想好了。那就借。郭承，六骑，听他的。——去校场找郭承。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.借兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "信还没到我手里，谈什么兵。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.南危水.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "二十年没见的弟弟。他昨天才到——说你在水烟阁替他守了口。关北欠你的，不止一顿饭。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.南危水.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁来信，说我弟弟装死二十年的事让人告到长老会去了。……他不会来关北了。你不必说是谁告的，我不想知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.南危水.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我弟弟？他随母姓，入了江湖，二十年没音信。不提。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.程不平
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我侄子。读书读得太多，当官当得太清。他写信来，是真急了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.兵部
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部去年发令：征三千民夫修官道，寻剑。先帝的令只说寻剑，没说征人——我不接。他们就自己来人，拿着文书到关北拿人。我拦不住朝廷的印，只能贴告示。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "踏平了。工地上的人一个不少，兵部的文书今早到了：槐阳反。随他们说——帽子扣不死人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里的事王府不知道。白天工地还在，剩下的四个还在挖——这笔账先记着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边，东门出去过了帐篷营地再往东。白衣的武官督着，一个姓吕的监工管账。挖的是一座古冢——老人说那是金乌的地方，不能动。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。你是外乡人，别去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.古冢
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老人说那是金乌的地方，不能动。兵部那位尚书信商句遗书末两句指的是北边的旧地——挖得动他就挖，挖不动的人，他送给道士。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "不奉诏"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.不奉诏
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "不奉诏？先帝的令只说寻剑。征人、拿人的令，我不接。扣什么帽子随他们——帽子扣不死人，民夫的枷才扣死人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "潜入"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "郭承的事郭承办。夜里的事王府不知道——你也记住这句。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵都借了，还潜什么。踏过去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "郭承在校场。夜里的事找他说，别找我——王府不知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.庾子建.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你说什么？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "骑兵"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.骑兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的骑兵欠你一阵。要用的时候，你开口——不是六骑，是关北所有的马。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo inquiry.骑兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的马好，关北的骑兵也好。没仗打，他们在校场劈木人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "从交椅上站起来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "郭承回来了，六骑一个不少，八个人也一个不少。兵部的文书今早到了：槐阳反。随他们说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的骑兵欠你一阵。要用的时候，你开口。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼，又看了看厅外。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "郭承说夜里救出来四个。四个就四个——另外四个的名字，王府记着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cheng_shuo calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里的事，王府不知道。你也不知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng name
#. native.npc.palace_soldier inquiry topic
#. native.npc.guo_cheng_lake name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "郭承"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng title
#. native.npc.guo_cheng moods.going.title
#. native.npc.guo_cheng_lake title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "王府骁将"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高个子，皮甲，马刀，脸让风沙吹得黑红，左边眉毛上一道疤。他练刀的时候不说话，说话的时候不多说一个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承一刀劈在木人肩上，木屑飞起来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承喝道：撩！不是砍！马上没有砍的工夫。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承的马刀一撩一劈，不带花样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承喝道：撩他的肩！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng moods.going.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承跟在你身后，手一直按着刀柄。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng moods.going.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承说道：走。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "把刀插回鞘里，冲校场上的兵吼了一声，六个人应声出列。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷的话到了：六骑听你的。马在东门外的营地——我跟你走。到了工地，你一句话，我们就冲。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.whisper
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "守夜的两个在火边。开枷的工夫别出声——开一个走一个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "把刀上的血在守夜武官的白衣上擦了，看了一眼棚里剩下的四个人，又看了你一眼。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "走！帐篷里的醒了。救不完的别回头——这话我说过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你就是把野羊寨的霍铮从逆灵宫地牢里背出来的那个？关北有两个从那地牢逃回来的民夫，跟他关过一个牢——他们认得你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "听说你在野羊山追一个道士，回头的时候地牢里的人没了。……这回到了工地，先救人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.confirm
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "带郭承夜里潜入工地——救得几个算几个，王府干净。要这么做吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "说好了，夜里。跟紧我，别出声。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷点了兵，那就白天踏过去。不用潜。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.rules.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼，点点头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里。兵部的人白天醒着，夜里只留两个守夜。东门外帐篷营地的篝火边等到天黑，我带你进去——救得几个算几个，救不完的别回头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府不知道这件事。你也不知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.潜入.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "你是谁？王爷还没见你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.借兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "六骑。马在东门外。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.借兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "说好了潜，就不借兵。两头都要的人两头都空。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.借兵.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵是王爷的，你去问王爷。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "踏平了。八个人都回营地了。兵部的文书明天到京师——王爷知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "四个。另外四个的名字你记着就行，别再去。白天他们加了岗，夜里加了双岗。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。栅栏、营帐、民夫棚、土方，最里头是古冢口。白衣武官六七个，一个队长，一个监工。白天别靠近。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.兵部
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的人在关北拿人，拿的是王爷的子民。王爷不让动手，我们就看着。看了半年了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.马刀
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北的马刀，马上使的。撩，不是砍。等这事了了，我给你一册刀谱（问我「刀谱」）。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "骁将"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.骁将
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府的骁将有七个，去乔阴县衙帮不平公子的那几个也是。我管校场。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刀谱"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.刀谱.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "刀谱给你了。撩，不是砍——自己练。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.刀谱.rules.lines.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "从怀里掏出一册翻得起毛的小册子，递给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.刀谱.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "《马刀谱》。关北的刀，马上使的七招。事了了，说话算话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.刀谱.rules.lines.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "《马刀谱》。救了四个，也是救。拿着——另外四个的名字，你记着就行。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng inquiry.刀谱.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "等这事了了，我给你一册刀谱——现在没工夫。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_guard name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "侍卫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_guard long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个王府的侍卫，皮甲，马刀，站在交椅一侧，眼睛看着门口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_guard chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"侍卫的手在刀柄上换了个位置。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_guard inquiry.王爷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷在上面。有话直说，王爷不爱绕。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_guard inquiry.兵部
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的人上回来，王爷把文书扔出了门。我们没动手——王爷不让。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "管家"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个干瘦的老头，灰袍子，手里一本账，耳朵上夹着一支笔。他是王府唯一不带刀的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管家在账上划了一笔，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"管家说道：又少了一村的壮丁，今年的马料谁割。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward inquiry.王爷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王爷在正厅。王爷不爱排场，你有话直说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward inquiry.民夫
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "账上去年少了三百四十一个壮丁。三百四十一个，我一个个记的名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "账"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_steward inquiry.账
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府的账，马、草、人。人那一页最难记。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_soldier name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府兵"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_soldier long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个王府的兵，光着膀子练刀，皮甲放在木人脚下。他的刀法只有两式：撩，劈。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_soldier chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"王府兵一刀撩在木人肩上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_soldier chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"王府兵喘着气说道：郭将军，再来一遍？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_soldier inquiry.郭承
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "郭将军。刀最快的一个。他说马上没有砍的工夫，只有撩。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_soldier inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。我们想去，王爷不让。兵部的印，拿去了就是反。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"南危水是当世使剑的名家，也是槐阳王的弟弟，一身武学集天邪、封山\n"
"两派之所长，在水烟阁七长老中武功仅次于二长老莫谦容。南危水手中\n"
"的焦殇剑也是一把罕见的利器，传说这把剑是名铸剑师黄炎炎生平六把\n"
"名剑中排名第一的杰作。\n"
"他站在兄长的交椅旁，二十年没站过的地方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"南危水看着厅外的天，没有说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "从交椅上站起来，看着弟弟。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "危水。二十年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "大哥。山洞里替我挡刀的那个人，我还没找到他家里人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "找。关北帮你找。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest calls.steps.emote
#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "转过头来看你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "这位替你守了二十年的口。——坐下说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.五长老
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老夫便是五长老。在这儿，老夫只是程朔的弟弟。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.槐阳王
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我大哥。二十年没见，他白了头，脾气一点没改。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.山洞的骸骨
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老夫都说了。阿岭的家里人，大哥答应帮我找。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.保密
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "多谢。老夫能站在这儿，是你的功劳——要不是你守着口，水烟阁的信先到，大哥就得先听到我死而复生的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.借兵
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "大哥的兵一动，关北就是反。你想清楚再开口——想清楚了，老夫不拦你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.潜入
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "郭承是好手。夜里的事老夫不掺和——老夫的脸在兵部那儿是死人的脸，露不得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_guest inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "老夫路过时看了一眼。白衣武官——和二十年前老松岭瀑布前的是同一身衣裳。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun name
#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "吕隼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun title
#. native.npc.lu_sun moods.fighting.title
#. native.npc.lu_sun moods.talked.title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部监工"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿青袍的中年人，腰里别着算盘，手里一本名册，名册的边让手汗浸黑了。他不穿白衣，不是武官，可武官都听他的——他管账，也管谁挖不动了往哪儿送。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"吕隼翻了一页名册，用笔在一个名字上划了一道。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"吕隼说道：今天的土方，少一筐扣一顿饭。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"吕隼叫道：拿下！兵部的工地动手就是反！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的工地，闲人免进。要找人，拿兵部的文书来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "数了数棚前的人，又翻了一页名册。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "少了四个。兵部要我补。……你昨夜在哪儿？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "从名册上抬起头，看见你身后的人，手停了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的工地，闲人——"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.emote
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "把刀抽出半截。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.say
#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.say
#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/fanfang/world.json data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "拿下！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"六个白衣武官抽了剑围上来。栅栏外马蹄声炸响——王府的六骑冲了进来！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前就该把你们这些人都料理干净。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun moods.fighting.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"吕隼把名册塞进怀里，拔了刀。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun moods.talked.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"吕隼捂着伤口，不敢抬头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun moods.talked.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"吕隼低声道：我只是管账的……\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "修官道是幌子。挖的是那座土丘——尚书大人要里头的东西。挖不动的人，宫里的车来接，我只管在名册上划一道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部修官道。征的是民夫，发的是口粮——有文书的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "十一批。前十批挖不动的七个，交了逆灵宫。名册上都有……都有。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部征的，王府不认，可文书是真的。你要人，去京师找兵部要。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.古冢
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "古冢？那是土丘。兵部修路，土丘碍事，挖平了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.兵部
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部尚书大人的令。我一个监工，令怎么说我怎么做。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.逆灵宫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "宫里的车。文书上写「代为收管」……收管到哪儿去，我不敢问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.逆灵宫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "什么宫？没听过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.庾子建.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "尚书大人……你怎么知道这名字？是他的令，是他的印。印是真的！我亲眼见过他盖印。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.车.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里闹过之后，宫里的车把两个挖不动的接走了。少了四个，兵部要我补——补不上，就是我的名字上名册。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.车.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "宫里的车。挖不动的人上车，车往南去，去哪儿我不问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lu_sun inquiry.车.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "车？运土的车。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "裴照"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao title
#. native.npc.pei_zhao moods.fighting.title
#. native.npc.pei_zhao moods.beaten.title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "白衣武官队长"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白衣的武官，比旁人高半个头，腰悬长剑，剑穗是黑的。他站着不动的时候像一根旗杆。白衣的左襟上绣着一只三足乌——和你在逆灵宫见过的腰牌是一样的记号。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"裴照的手搭在剑柄上，眼睛扫过栅栏外的草原。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"裴照冷冷道：王府的人也敢动兵部的差。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao moods.fighting.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"裴照的剑出了鞘。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao moods.beaten.chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"裴照靠着栅栏，看着自己的剑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "白衣"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry.白衣
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "朝廷的武官穿白。二十年前这身衣裳就在关北走过一趟——你听谁说的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的差。闲人免进。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "二十年"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry.二十年.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "……抄本？那二十三个人是我的前辈。他们没找到，我们找。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry.二十年.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前的事，与你无关。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "三足乌"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.pei_zhao inquiry.三足乌
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的记号。问多了没好处。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer name
#. native.npc.site_officer_fighting name
#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry topic
#. native.npc.white_officer name
#. native.npc.inn_raider name
#. native.npc.herald_ministry name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "白衣武官"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个身着白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑，站得笔直。白衣下摆沾着黄土。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白衣武官盯着你，手按在剑柄上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的差，闲人免进。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer inquiry.民夫
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部征的。有文书。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer_fighting long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个身着白衣的朝廷武官，剑已出鞘，白衣上溅了土。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_officer_fighting chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白衣武官喝道：兵部办差，拦者死！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_watch name
#. native.npc.night_watch_fighting name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "守夜武官"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_watch long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白衣武官坐在火边，剑横在膝上，脑袋一点一点地打盹。火快灭了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_watch chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守夜武官的头点了一下，又抬起来，往火里添了根柴。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_watch_fighting long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白衣武官，剑在手里，眼睛还带着刚醒的红。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_watch_fighting chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守夜武官大叫：有贼！来人！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_watch_fighting chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守夜武官喝道：王府的人？！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "被征的民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑瘦的汉子，脖子上套着木枷，枷上的铁环拴在桩上。手掌全是血泡，肩膀磨破了。他抬眼看了看你，又低下头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"民夫把枷挪了挪，脖子上磨出的血痂又裂了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"民夫低声道：挖不动了……下一车就是我。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry topic
#. native.npc.freed_corvee inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "枷"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry.枷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里锁着，白天开了挖土。挖不动的，车来接——接走的没有回来过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "名册"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry.名册
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "棚柱上钉着。划了道的，是上车走了的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry.吕隼
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "监工。他不打人，他划名册。划一道，人就没了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.site_corvee inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "说是修官道。修官道往土丘里挖什么？挖出来的都是灰白的老土和碎陶。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spent_corvee name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "挖不动的民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spent_corvee long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦得脱了形的汉子，靠在车轮上，枷倒是摘了——挖不动的人用不着枷。他的眼睛看着土丘，不看人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spent_corvee chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"挖不动的民夫咳了一阵，咳出一口带土的痰。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spent_corvee inquiry.车
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "道士的车。说送俺们回家……挖不动的都这么走的，没一个回来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spent_corvee inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "家"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spent_corvee inquiry.家
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "关北。营地里有俺婆娘。你要是去，别说看见俺。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist name
#. native.npc.passing_taoist name
#. native.npc.tribute_taoist name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "押车道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽到肘上，手里一根鞭子。他看一眼车上的油布，又看一眼土丘的口子，像在等什么。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"押车道士往车上的油布瞥了一眼，拿鞭子把一角压好。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist inquiry.车
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部交办，收管逃役。车上的事，问兵部去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "……施主从哪儿听来的名字？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist inquiry topic
#. native.npc.passing_taoist inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "挖不动的"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist inquiry.挖不动的
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部说修官道要人；不中用的，宫里替他们收管。慈悲。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.barrow_taoist inquiry.石门
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "那门？兵部的人凿了半年。凿不开的东西，自有开得了的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_rider name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府骑兵"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_rider long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个王府的骑兵，皮甲马刀，脸让风吹得黑红，刀还在马上的撩势里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_rider chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"王府骑兵的马刀一撩，白衣上开了一道口子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huaiyang_rider chat_msg_combat
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"王府骑兵喝道：王爷有令，一个不留！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "牧羊人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个老牧羊人，坐在石头上，鞭子横在膝盖上，羊在他四周的草里走。他的脸晒得像牛皮，眼睛眯着看东边。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"牧羊人吹了声口哨，一只走远的羊回过头来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"牧羊人说道：东边那土，刮了半年了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "那边。兵部的人圈了地，挖那座土丘。我爷爷说那土丘底下睡着金乌的人，不能动。他们动了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd inquiry.敖包
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "过路的人放石头的地方。兵部的车每过一回，我们就刻一道——刻了十一道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd inquiry.车
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "从工地出来往西去的车，蒙着油布，里头有人。往东去的时候是空的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "羊"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shepherd inquiry.羊
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "我的羊。兵部征人，倒没征羊。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "民夫家属"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个裹着头巾的妇人，坐在篝火边搓着手里的一根羊毛绳，眼睛一直往东边看。她男人被兵部的人带走四十天了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"民夫家属往火里添了一把羊粪，叹了口气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"民夫家属说道：四十天了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "回来了！八个都回来了——俺家的也在里头。火边坐的人今天都散了，就俺们几个舍不得走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里回来四个。俺家的……没在里头。回来的人说，棚里还有四个，名字他们都记着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.民夫.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "俺家的。兵部的人拿着文书，一家抓一个。王爷的告示贴了，人还是没了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.工地
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "草原东边。俺去过一回，栅栏外头站了半天，白衣的不让进。听见里头有人喊。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry topic
#. guanbei.camp.fire name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "篝火"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.篝火.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "等消息的火。今天不用等了——人都回来了。火还烧着，烧给没等到的那些年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.篝火.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "等消息的火。回来了四个，火边少了四个人。剩下的还在等。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_family inquiry.篝火.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "等消息的火。谁家男人回来了，火边就少一个人。到现在没少过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee name
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "回来的民夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee title
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "回家的人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑瘦的汉子，脖子上枷磨出的一圈印子还红着。他坐在火边，手里捧着一碗奶茶，一口没喝，只是捧着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"回来的民夫摸了摸脖子上枷磨出的印子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee chat_msg
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"回来的民夫低声道：回来了……真回来了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "王府的骑兵冲进来的时候，俺以为是来拿俺们的。枷一开，俺腿都软了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee inquiry.工地.rules.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里有人撬开俺的枷，叫俺别出声、往栅栏门跑。俺跑了。棚里还有四个——老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee inquiry.枷
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "夜里锁着，白天开了挖土。脖子上这圈印子，要带一辈子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee inquiry topic
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "恩公"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.freed_corvee inquiry.恩公
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "俺不知道恩公是谁。郭将军说，别问，记着就行。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist long
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，一手牵着骡子的缰绳，骡车上蒙着油布，油布底下有东西在动。他不看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist calls.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一辆蒙着油布的骡车从东边过来，两个黑衣黑冠的道士一个牵骡子一个跟着走。油布底下有人咳了一声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "让开。宫里的车。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist calls.steps.say
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "工地昨夜闹贼，两个挖不动的今天就接走，省得再丢。——走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist calls.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid ""
"骡车从你身边过去，往西、往南去了。油布底下的人没有再出声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist inquiry.车
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "宫里的车。让开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.passing_taoist inquiry.挖不动的
#: data/guanbei/npcs.json
msgid "兵部交办，宫里收管。慈悲。"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/gate_road long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"出了关门，一条军道贴着骆驼东峰的脚往北折。路是碎石铺的，车辙压得很深，两边的山壁比谷地里的矮，颜色也黄得发白。风从北边来，带着土腥气。回头能看见关门的铁栅和门楼上那面黄旗。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/dust_road long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"山壁到这里退开了，路面从碎石变成黄土，再往北黄土里就长出一丛丛枯黄的草来。风很大，沙子贴着地皮跑，打在腿上沙沙地响。远处的地平线是平的——你在天驼关的谷地里待久了，一时看不惯这么宽的天。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/boundary long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"草原从这里开始。路边立着一方青石界碑，刻着「关北封国界」。草是灰绿的，高不过膝，风过去一浪一浪地倒。往北，一座土黄的城墙横在草地尽头，城门楼子上飘着一面旗——那是槐阳城。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/gate long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"夯土的城墙，土黄色，墙头长草。城门洞不高，门楼上的朱漆褪成了砖红，梁上画着石青的卷草纹。门里是一片踩实了的黄土场子，驼队和马车在这儿卸货验货，驼铃叮当地响。守门的兵穿的不是朝廷的白衣，是王府的灰褐短袄。城门旁的木板上钉着一张告示。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/street long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"槐阳城里唯一的一条正街，从城门直通北头王府的朱门。街面是黄土的，两边是矮矮的土坯房子：铁匠铺里叮叮当当打着马蹄铁，皮货铺门口挂着一张张晾着的羊皮，马具铺的鞍子一溜摆在门板上。街上走的人都带着风沙的颜色，说话直来直去。东边一条岔道通马市，马粪味就是从那边来的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/palace_front long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"大街的北头是槐阳王府。朱漆的大门褪得发白，门钉倒是黑亮的；门前一对石鼓，鼓面让人摸得溜光。门楼不高，却宽，梁上的彩画是塞外的样子——石青和赭红，画的是马和鹰，不是龙凤。门前的场子扫得干净，这是全城唯一干净的地方。两个门军守着门，王爷不见生人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/palace_yard long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"进了朱门是一面土坯的影壁，影壁上没有画，只刷了一层白灰，灰上有刀划的道道。绕过影壁是一片夯实的前院，扫得一根草都没有。北边三级石阶上去是正厅，廊下两盏灯笼。东边传来刀劈木头的声音——那边是校场。管家站在影壁下，手里拿着一本账。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/drill long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"前院东边的校场，一排木人，几个箭靶，墙根一溜拴马的桩子。地上的土让马蹄和靴子踩得比石头还硬。王府的兵在这儿练刀——不是花架子，是马上一撩一劈的刀，木人的左肩都让劈去了一块。领着练的那个高个子是骁将郭承。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/palace_hall long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"槐阳王府的正厅，比乔阴县衙的大堂还朴素。上首一把旧的胡床交椅，椅背搭一张磨秃了的虎皮；椅旁一架兵器，刀在上剑在下。两边各站一个侍卫，不说话。地上铺的是砖，不是木板，踩上去有声音。梁上的彩画是石青和赭红的马和鹰。槐阳王程朔就坐在那把交椅上——六十六岁，背挺得笔直。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/side_hall long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"正厅东边的偏厅，王爷看文书的地方。一张书案，案上的文书摞得整整齐齐，最上面一封是兵部的，封皮上有刀划的叉。墙上钉着一张羊皮地图，草原东头用朱砂圈了一个圈。角落一个火盆，盆里的灰还温着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/market long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"大街东边的一片空场，围着木栏的马栏占了一半，栏里十来匹关北矮脚马，栏外的木桩上拴着刚换了主的。靠南是驼栏，两峰骆驼卧着嚼草。马贩子的秤挂在木架上，地上是草料和马粪。北边一间土坯房子门口挑着一面酒旗，写着「酒」——塞外酒肆。马栏边坐着一个高鼻深目的异族人，面前铺一块布，布上放着一把短剑。东边土墙上开着一道门，门外是草地和毡帐的白顶。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/inn_hall long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间土坯墙的酒肆，屋顶是椽子上铺的草泥，矮得伸手能摸到梁。屋子正中是一个火塘，吊着一口黑锅，羊肉的香味和羊粪火的烟味混在一起。几张矮桌，几条板凳，墙上挂着皮囊和马鞭。掌柜的是个女人，站在柜后剁肉。靠墙坐着几个等消息的人，不说话，一碗马奶酒喝半天。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/inn_back long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"酒肆的后屋，堆着成捆的干草和几口大缸，缸里泡着马奶酒，酸味扑鼻。墙角挂着整扇的羊，房梁上吊着一串串风干的肉条。地上铺着一张破毡子，是掌柜的睡处。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/camp long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"出了马市的东门，城墙外的草地上扎着五顶毡帐，毡子有白的有灰的，门帘朝南。帐外晾着肉干和奶皮子，奶桶倒扣在木架上，一群羊圈在柳条围的圈里。营地中间一堆篝火，火边坐着等消息的人——都是被兵部征了男人的人家。往东，草原路从营地东头出去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/camp_east long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"营地东头，毡帐到这儿就没了，只剩一排拴马的木桩和一口饮马的石槽。草原路从这里往东去，车辙在草里压出两道黄土。风从东边来，带着一点土腥和烟味。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/steppe_road long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一条车路穿过草原，两边的草从枯黄转成灰绿，一直铺到天边。路北一座敖包立在小丘上，路南地势起了一道缓坡。羊群在草里走，牧羊人坐在石头上。往东，天边有一缕黄尘一直不散。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/cairn long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"小丘顶上一座敖包，石头一层层垒起来有一人多高，顶上插着树枝，枝上绑满了褪色的红布蓝布。路过的人绕着它走三圈，放一块石头。风一吹，布条哗哗地响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/rise long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道缓坡，站到坡顶能看出去很远。东边，草原尽头有一片栅栏围着的地方，几顶白帐篷，土堆得老高，一缕黄尘一直从那儿升起来——兵部的工地。坡上的草被牛羊啃得短短的，石头缝里长着紫苜蓿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/fence_gate long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道木栅栏把草原拦断，栅栏门上钉着一块木牌：「兵部 · 修官道 · 闲人免进」。门里是踩出来的黄土地，马粪、车辙、断了的扁担。白衣的武官守在门里，监工拿着一本名册站在门边。北边一排帐篷，南边两溜民夫棚，东边土堆得像小山。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/tents long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"三顶帐篷排成一行，两顶是武官住的，帐门口立着兵部的白旗；东头一顶小些，是监工的，帐外一张条案，案上压着账本和算盘。帐篷后头堆着粮袋和水桶。夜里这儿只留两个守夜的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/sheds long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"两溜草顶的长棚，棚里铺着烂席子。棚前一排木桩，桩上钉着铁环，环上挂着枷锁——民夫白天挖土，夜里就锁在这儿。棚柱上钉着一张名册。地上是干了的血点子和没吃完的粥。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/diggings long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"挖开的土方一坑连一坑，土堆得比人高，坑里架着木梯和辘轳。土是黄的，往下挖出来的却是灰白的——像是夯过的老土。往东，土方尽头是一座长满草的大土丘，丘脚下挖开了一个口子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/barrow_mouth long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"大土丘脚下挖开的一个口子，深深地陷进去，坑壁上架着木架，一架辘轳吊着土筐。坑底露出一道石砌的墓道，墓道尽头一扇石门。坑边堆着挖出来的碎陶和一截朽了的木头，木头上还有漆。南边停着一辆蒙着油布的车。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/stone_door long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"墓道尽头的石门，两扇，合得严严的，门缝里塞着多少年的土。门楣上刻着一只鸟，三只脚，翅膀张着——金乌。门上有凿过的痕，凿不开；门前的土被人跪出两个坑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:guanbei/cart_stand long
#: data/guanbei/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一辆骡车停在土坑南边，车上蒙着油布，油布底下有人。两个黑衣黑冠的道士守着车，一个在喂骡子，一个靠着车辕打盹。车辕上挂着一块木牌：「逆灵宫 · 收管」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace.gate name
#. guanbei.palace_front.knock name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "王府大门"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate_road.landmark.gate long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"回头看，关门是一座石砌的门楼，门洞里嵌着铁栅，这会儿抬着。门楼上没有匾，只钉着一面褪了色的黄旗，旗上一个「严」字。门里是天驼关的谷地，门外就是关北了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.boundary.landmark.stone name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "界碑"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.boundary.landmark.stone long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"一方齐人高的青石碑，碑面朝南，刻着「关北封国界」五个大字，字口里的朱漆早褪成了褐色。碑脚堆着过路人放的石子，碑背面有人用刀刻了一行小字：「出了关，就是王法。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.landmark.wall long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"夯土的城墙，一层一层夯出来的横纹看得清清楚楚，墙根被风沙磨得发白，墙头长着一丛丛枯黄的草。门楼也是土的，木梁朱漆褪成了砖红，梁上画着石青的卷草。这不是京师的城，是塞外的城。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.market.landmark.pen name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "马栏"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.market.landmark.pen long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"木栏围着的马栏，栏里十来匹马，枣红的、青的、黑的，都是关北的矮脚马，耐跑。栏外的木桩上拴着两匹，是刚换了主的。马粪和草料的味道混在一起，风一吹满街都是。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.landmark.drums name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "石鼓"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.landmark.drums long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"一对石鼓，鼓面让几十年的手摸得溜光，鼓身上刻的不是狮子，是两匹对着的马。鼓脚的石头裂了一道，用铁箍箍着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.drill.landmark.posts name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "木人"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.drill.landmark.posts long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"校场边一排木人，每个木人的左肩都让刀劈去了一块——王府的骁将练的是马上一撩的刀，撩的都是同一个地方。木人脚下的土踩得比石头还硬。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_hall.landmark.chair name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "交椅"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_hall.landmark.chair long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"正厅上首不是龙椅，是一把旧的胡床交椅，椅背上搭一张虎皮，虎皮的毛磨秃了一半。椅子旁立着一架兵器，刀在上，剑在下，都不是摆设——刀口上有新磨的痕。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.side_hall.landmark.map long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"偏厅的墙上钉着一张羊皮地图：槐阳城在中间，南边一道山是天驼关，东边一片草原画到纸边。草原东头用朱砂圈了一个圈，圈边写着三个小字：「兵部 · 工地」。圈旁边另一行墨字，笔迹不同：「古冢。勿动。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.inn_hall.landmark.hearth name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "火塘"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.inn_hall.landmark.hearth long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"屋子正中挖出来的火塘，四边砌着石头，塘里的羊粪火不旺，却一直不灭。火上吊着一口黑锅，锅里的羊肉咕嘟咕嘟地响。火塘边的地上磨得油亮，是多少年来人坐出来的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.landmark.yurts name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "毡帐"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.landmark.yurts long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"五顶毡帐，柳条扎的骨架，外头蒙着毡子，毡子用马鬃绳勒出一道道棱。门帘都朝南，帘子上缝着各家的花样：一家是云头，一家是鹿，一家什么也没有，只有补丁。帐顶的天窗开着，炊烟从那儿出来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.cairn.landmark.obo long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"石头垒的敖包，有些石头是路过的人新放的，颜色还白；底下的让风吹黑了。顶上的树枝绑着布条，红的、蓝的、黄的，最底下那层已经褪成了灰。石堆里插着一块木牌，字是刀刻的：「兵部的车从这儿过了十一回。」后头还有一笔，没刻完。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.rise.landmark.dust name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "烟尘"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.rise.landmark.dust long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"东边那缕黄尘不是烟，是土——几百个人在挖土，挖出来的土一筐一筐倒上去，风一吹就是这一缕。尘底下隐约有白点子在动，是武官的白衣。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.landmark.roll name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "工地名册"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.landmark.roll long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"钉在棚柱上的一张名册，纸让雨淋过，字还认得出：\n"
"「关北民夫 第十一批：王石头、刘拐子、老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三、巴图、胡阿大。」\n"
"底下另一行小字，墨不一样：「前十批挖不动者七人，交逆灵宫收管。」\n"
"名册末尾盖着一方印，印色暗红发黑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.barrow_mouth.landmark.windlass name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "辘轳"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.barrow_mouth.landmark.windlass long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"坑边架着一架辘轳，绳子磨得发亮，吊着一只土筐。筐里的土是灰白的夯土，夹着碎陶片，有一片上头还有红彩。坑壁上一层一层的土色不一样——这土丘不是天生的，是人堆的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.stone_door.landmark.door long
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"两扇石门，石面磨得光滑，门楣正中刻着一只鸟：翅膀张开，三只脚，头朝东。刻得深，几百年的土都填不平那三只脚。门缝里有新凿的痕迹，凿了一寸就停了，石头比铁硬。门前的土地上跪出两个坑——有人在这门前跪过很久。\n"
"你见过这只鸟：逆灵宫人腰牌上的徽记，也是这个样子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.knock act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"门军侧身让开：进去吧，王爷在正厅。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.knock act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"你叩了叩门。门军接过信看了看封皮，又看了看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.knock act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"门军说道：乔阴程县令的信——王爷等这封信等了半个月了。进去，正厅。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.knock act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"朱门开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.knock act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"你叩了叩门。门军没有动：王爷只认乔阴程县令的信。信呢？丢了的话，回乔阴县衙找程县令再写一封。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.palace_front.knock act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"你叩了叩门。门军没有动：王爷不见生人。有凭据再来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.verb
#. fanfang.office.papers act.verb
#: data/guanbei/world.json data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "看"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"城门旁的木板上钉了一张新告示，压在旧的上头，墨还新：\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"「兵部文书至：槐阳反。随他们说。——槐阳王府」\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"底下还是那方正红的印。旧告示的一角从新纸底下露出来，「本府不奉」四个字还看得见。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"一张告示钉在城门旁的木板上，纸已经让风沙打得发毛，字是粗笔写的：\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"「兵部征夫令，本府不奉。有持兵部文书到关北拿人者，以盗论。——槐阳王府」\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.gate.notice act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"告示底下盖着一方大印，印色正红。你见过逆灵宫那叠文书上的印——这一方和那些不一样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.fire act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"天已经黑了。篝火一堆一堆亮起来，帐篷里透出灯光。该走了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.fire act.acts.ask
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "在篝火边坐下等到天黑。等的工夫里，世上的事照样走：别处的人该走的走、该好的好。"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.fire act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"你在篝火边坐下。等消息的人往火里添了一把羊粪，没人说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.fire act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"太阳落下去，草原先黑，天后黑。篝火一堆一堆亮起来，帐篷里透出灯光，羊圈里的羊都卧下了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.fire act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"夜晚降临了。往东，工地那边只剩两点火光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.camp.fire act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"篝火边坐着等消息的人。你没有要等的事——借了兵的，白天就去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles name
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "枷锁"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.verb
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "打开枷锁"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"枷锁都开着，铁环空荡荡地挂在桩上。棚里没有人了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"剩下的四副枷锁还锁着人——老魏、周二牛、陈满仓、马三。白天六个武官在帐外走动，夜里他们加了岗。你救不了第二回。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"武官的尸首横在栅栏门里，吕隼趴在他的名册上。你走到木桩前，一副一副地打开枷锁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"铁环「当啷」落在地上。八个人站起来，先是不敢信，然后有人哭了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"郭承说道：回营地去。马市东门外的帐篷，你们的人都在那儿等着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"八个民夫互相搀着，从栅栏门出去了。古冢口那边，两个黑衣道士丢下车，往东跑了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"白衣武官还站着。先打。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.whisper
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "跟着我，别出声。先开西头的，开一个走一个。"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"你蹲到木桩前。枷锁的铁销锈死了，郭承用刀尖一点一点地撬。第一副开了，王石头爬起来，郭承指了指栅栏门，他弯着腰跑了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"第二副，刘拐子。第三副，巴图。第四副，胡阿大——铁销「咔」的一声响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"火边一个守夜的武官抬起头：「谁？！」两个人抽剑扑了过来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"夜里的工地。郭承不在你身边——他说过，篝火边等他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"白天。六个武官在帐外走动，吕隼在算账，枷锁上的铁销锈死了，撬一副要半天。郭承说过：夜里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.sheds.shackles act.acts.steps.line
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid ""
"枷锁是铁的，锁着。你没有钥匙，也没有理由。\n"
msgstr ""

#. guanbei.diggings.east_barrow lines
#: data/guanbei/world.json
msgid "土方东头两个白衣武官横过剑，拦住你：兵部重地，闲人免进。"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/glass_beads name
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid "琉璃珠"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/glass_beads long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一串琉璃珠子，有蓝的、绿的、琥珀色的，透亮，里头有一丝一丝的气泡。对着太阳一照，手心里落下一小片彩光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/carpet name
#. native.npc.carpet_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/items.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "毡毯"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/carpet long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一张卷起来的毡毯，红底黄花，花纹一圈套一圈。摸上去又厚又密，带着羊毛的气味。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/pepper name
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid "胡椒"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/pepper long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一小布袋胡椒，黑黑的一粒一粒，袋口一松，那股辣味直冲鼻子。在京师，这一袋能换不少银子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/pepper unit
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid "袋"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/hu_bread name
#. native.npc.spice_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/items.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "胡饼"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/hu_bread long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一张烤得焦黄的胡饼，上头撒满芝麻，又硬又香。走远路的人带着，一个月不坏。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/copper_kettle name
#. native.npc.copper_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/items.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铜壶"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/copper_kettle long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一把细嘴的铜壶，壶身上敲满了星星似的花纹。装着清水，一路晃荡也不洒。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet name
#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry topic
#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry topic
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/items.json data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铜牒"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"巴掌大的一片铜，边角磨圆了，颜色发黑，拿在手里沉甸甸的。正面刻着几行字，笔画很深，是用剑尖一下一下刻出来的——字是中原字，刻字的人却不大会写，有几个笔画反了。背面一只展翅的鹰。铜是凉的，可刚从火坛底下取出来的时候，是温的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"你把铜牒举到亮处，一行一行地认那些刻反了笔画的字：\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"「头在湖底冰下，以穿灵为钉；\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"钉在，鬼不得全；\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"钉拔，鬼成形；\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"要灭它，三器齐；\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"要再封，须有人留下。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bronze_tablet act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"背面那只鹰的翅膀底下还有一行小字，刻得浅，几乎磨平了：「吾见之。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/katana name
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid "倭刀"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/katana long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一把倭国的长刀，刀身窄而弯，只开一面刃，刀背磨得发亮。刀柄长，缠着黑丝绳，两只手握得下。浪人说：一刀。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/round_shield name
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid "大秦圆盾"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/round_shield long
#: data/fanfang/items.json
msgid ""
"一面大秦人的圆盾，木胎蒙牛皮，铁皮包边，盾心一个铁泡。盾面上漆着一只展翅的鹰，漆掉了一半，盾沿全是剑尖戳出来的白点。左臂套上去正合适。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盐脚夫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个背着盐包的脚夫，盐包压得他的腰弯成一张弓。他的脸上、眉毛上一层白霜，是汗干了留下的盐。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"盐脚夫停下来喘口气，抹了一把脸上的盐霜。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"盐脚夫把盐包往背上颠了颠，一步一步往上挪。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盐"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry.盐
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "码头那边晒的海盐。背上崖，送到玉螺湖村去换米，一包换一斗。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry.番坊
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "下了崖就是。码头、市集，再往里头是庙。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "路"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry.路
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "这条路是凿出来的，我爷爷那辈人凿的。下雨天别走，滑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry topic
#. native.npc.boatman inquiry topic
#. native.npc.stall_child inquiry topic
#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry topic
#. fanfang.cliff_path.landmark.sea name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "海"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.salt_porter inquiry.海
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "看多了就不看了。海又不给饭吃。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "船工"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个晒得黑红的船工，光着脚，裤腿卷到膝盖，肩上搭着一条湿缆绳。他的手上全是绳子勒出来的老茧。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"船工往海里啐了一口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"船工哼起一支调子，词你一个字也听不懂。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry topic
#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "船"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry.船
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "不是我们的船。南边商人的，西边商人的。我们只管拴、只管卸，一天三十文。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry.海
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "海上没有路。有路，也是别人的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry.番坊
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "港口小，船是别人的，人是各处来的。各过各的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry topic
#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry topic
#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry topic
#. native.npc.carpet_merchant inquiry topic
#. native.npc.stall_child inquiry topic
#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry topic
#. native.npc.customs_runner inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fire_worshipper inquiry topic
#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry topic
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shield_youth title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大秦人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会的。市集北头，门口立着两面大盾的那家。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry topic
#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry topic
#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "税"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.boatman inquiry.税
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "货上岸，十抽一。冯大人的规矩。我们不交，我们没货。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "卸货的胡商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant title
#. native.npc.glass_merchant title
#. native.npc.carpet_merchant title
#. native.npc.spice_merchant title
#. native.npc.copper_merchant title
#. native.npc.fire_worshipper title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "胡商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个缠着头巾的胡商，正指挥船工把箱子抬上岸。他一会儿用胡话骂，一会儿用中原话骂，骂完了自己先笑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"胡商冲着船工嚷道：慢点！那一箱是琉璃！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"胡商拿出一本小册子，在上头记了一笔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry topic
#. native.npc.customs_runner inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "货"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry.货
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "胡椒、琉璃、毡子。从西边来，走了一年。到了番坊，交了税，就剩一半。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry.税
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "十抽一！冯大人还说是轻的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry.西边
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "西边是沙子，再西边是山，山那边还是沙子。走一年，才到这儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cargo_merchant inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会的人？他们替商队看过货、打过强盗。现在没人雇他们了，就教人使剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "税吏"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个戴小帽的税吏，坐在码头当中的桌子后头。桌上一本账、一杆秤、一个钱匣子；他拨一下算盘，看一眼海，再拨一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"税吏拨了几下算盘，在账上记了一笔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"税吏冲着卸货的胡商喊道：先过秤，再上岸！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry.税
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "货上岸，十抽一，市舶司的规矩。你没货？没货就走吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry.市舶司
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "市集西头，灰墙的院子。冯大人在里头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_lu name
#. native.npc.customs_clerk inquiry topic
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.ronin inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry.冯禄
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯大人是京师派来的。番坊的事，他说了算。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会在市集北头，门口立着两面大盾。别说是我指的路。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tax_clerk inquiry.船
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "船是南边商人的，番坊没有自己的船。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "琉璃商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高鼻子的胡商，面前的毡子上摆满了琉璃珠子和琉璃杯。太阳一照，五颜六色的光落在他的胡子上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"琉璃商举起一颗珠子，对着太阳眯起眼睛看。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"琉璃商吆喝道：西边的火烧出来的琉璃——看看，不买也看看！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "琉璃"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant inquiry.琉璃
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "西边的火烧出来的，透亮。中原人喜欢，一串换一斗米。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant inquiry.番坊
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "好地方。没人问你从哪来，只问你卖什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.glass_merchant inquiry.市舶司
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯大人？他扣过我一箱杯子，说是要验。验了三个月，箱子还在他后院。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "毡毯商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个胡子花白的胡商，盘腿坐在一堆毡毯上。身后的竹竿上挂着一张张毡毯，红底黄花，花纹是一圈套一圈的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"毡毯商慢慢地抚平一张毡毯上的褶子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"毡毯商闭着眼睛，像是睡着了，可你一走近他就睁开了眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant inquiry.毡毯
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一张毡毯，一个女人织一年。你踩在上头，就是踩在她那一年上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "花纹"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant inquiry.花纹
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一圈套一圈，是路。从家里走出来，走到这儿，还没走完。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.carpet_merchant inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会的人买过我一张，铺在他们会首的屋里。会首是个老实人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "香料商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个包着头巾的胡商妇人，守着一排敞口的麻袋。她用一只铜勺子舀香料，舀一勺，抖一抖，再倒回去一点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"香料商抓了一把胡椒，凑到鼻子底下闻了闻，点点头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"香料商冲着街上喊了一句什么，她的孩子跑过来又跑走了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "香料"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant inquiry.香料
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "胡椒、姜黄、孜然。一勺胡椒，在京师换一勺银子。在番坊，换一张饼。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant inquiry.胡饼
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "我自己烤的。芝麻多，盐少。走远路的人带着，一个月不坏。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.spice_merchant inquiry.孩子
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "他会说三种话，一种也说不好。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铜器商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个胳膊粗壮的胡商，面前的木架上挂满了铜壶、铜盘和铜铃。他拿一把小锤子在一只盘子上敲花纹，叮叮当当，一刻不停。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"铜器商叮叮当当地敲着一只铜盘。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"铜器商举起一只铜壶，冲你晃了晃。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant inquiry.铜壶
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "装水，装茶，装酒，都行。走远路，水比钱要紧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铜"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant inquiry.铜
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铜是番坊的铜，手艺是我家的手艺。花纹是我爷爷教的，他说是天上的星星。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.copper_merchant inquiry.拜火祠
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "东头那座黑石头房子。火三百年没灭，祭司说火前不能说谎。我从来不进去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "看摊的孩子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个七八岁的孩子，头发卷卷的，替他娘看着香料摊。见人就喊「看看，看看」，喊的是三种话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"看摊的孩子冲你喊道：看看，看看！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"看摊的孩子从麻袋里偷抓了一撮什么，塞进嘴里，脸一下子皱成一团。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child inquiry.番坊
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "我娘说，番坊就是谁都来、谁都走的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会的人个子好高。他们说话像唱歌，吵架也像唱歌。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.stall_child inquiry.海
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "我没坐过船。船是别人的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "说书的老胡人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白胡子的老胡人，坐在街边的一块毡子上，面前一只铜碗。他讲的是中原话，讲得很慢，时不时冒出一个谁也听不懂的词，又自己把它换成中原话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"说书的老胡人说道：……那座城有一百道门，门门都有兵守着。可兵是会老的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"说书的老胡人停下来，喝了一口水，看着街上的人来来去去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "故事"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry.故事
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "西边，很远的西边，有一个大国。城一百座，路都是石头铺的，一直铺到海边。后来北边的蛮子来了，城一座一座地烧。剩下的人往东走，走到这里，走不动了。——这不是故事，孩子。这是铁盾会那些人的来历。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry.大秦
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你们叫它大秦。他们自己叫它别的名字。它已经没有了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "他们的祖上来得早，三百年前就来过一回，替你们这边打过北方的蛮子。这回来的，是没有家可回的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry.番坊
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "丝路走到头，就是这里。往东是你们中原，往西往南，是海。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.storyteller inquiry.海
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "海那边？我不知道。我是走路来的，走了一年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "市舶吏"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿青袍的小官，袍子洗得发白，袖口磨出了毛。他坐在书案后头，一手按着账册，一手拈着胡子，眼睛总往门口瞟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冯禄翻着账册，嘴里念念有词地算着数目。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冯禄看了一眼门外，又低下头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "……本司回去查。查清了再说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.文书.rules.lines.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "按住了案上的文书，手指头有点抖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.文书.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "印……兵部的文书，镇国大将军的印，哪一样是假的？你一个外乡人，懂什么印色？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的令，京师来的，盖着大印。大秦人聚众持械，着本司清出——我也是奉命行事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.大秦人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "清走了。浪人作的证，兵部的令，本司照办。——那块地？归谁，不是我说了算。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.大秦人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "……他们留下了。本司回去查那方印。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.大秦人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "他们在番坊住了三十年，税从来没拖过。可兵部的令下来了，我有什么法子？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry topic
#. native.npc.customs_runner inquiry topic
#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry topic
#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.ronin name
#. native.npc.ronin_fighting name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "浪人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.浪人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠馆的。他们想要铁盾会那块地，想了好些年了。兵部的令一下，他们比我还高兴。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.於兰天武
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "京师东二门挂着的那张。各州县都要抄一份，我也抄了。皇叔怎么成了要犯？我一个小吏，不敢问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.布告
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "京师东二门的原告，番坊照抄。上头让抄，我就抄。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.市舶司
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "收税、查货、看船。番坊的船都是外头的，税是我的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.船
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "南边来的，西边来的，没有一条是番坊的。番坊人不造船，只卸货。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu inquiry.铁盾会
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "市集北头。去吧，去告诉他们：兵部的令是兵部的令，不是我冯禄的令。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站在院门里，手里举着那纸文书，身后四个戴斗笠的浪人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的令在此：番坊大秦人等，聚众持械，着市舶司即日清出！——安敦，出来说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "从屋里出来，左腿先，慢。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯大人。三十年，税没拖过一文。令，我看过——那方镇国大将军的印，不是真印盖的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "印是不是，不是你一个番人说了算！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_lu calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你有一块印模——卢卡说的。拿出来，对一对。拿不出来……那就看你的了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_clerk name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "书办"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_clerk long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦瘦的书办，趴在书案的一角抄东西，抄一行，抬一次头，看一眼冯大人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_clerk chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"书办揉了揉手腕，又蘸了一笔墨。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_clerk inquiry.文书
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "抄了二十份了，番坊每家门口贴一份。大人说贴，我就抄。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_clerk inquiry.布告
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "那张也是我抄的。於兰天武四个字，我写了一百遍。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_clerk inquiry.冯禄
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "大人？大人这几天睡不着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "差役"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个腰里挂着铁尺的差役，靠着墙站着，一会儿换一条腿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"差役打了个哈欠。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"差役看了看墙头上的碎瓷片，又看了看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会那些人，个个带剑，个子比我高一头。真要清……就凭我们两个？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner inquiry.货
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "后院那些箱子？扣下来的。有的扣了三个月，有的扣了三年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.customs_runner inquiry.浪人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠馆的人倒是来过，问大人什么时候动手。大人说等。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会会首"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白头发的异族老人，眼睛是灰的，鼻梁高得像一道脊。他坐着的时候背很直，站起来却慢——左腿有旧伤，先迈左腿。一身中原的布袍，袍子底下露出一截铁片甲的边。他说中原话说得很慢，一个字一个字，省掉的字比说出来的多。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安敦把铜灯的灯芯拨亮了一点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安敦看着墙上那面旧盾，很久没有动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "祖上"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.祖上
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "三百年前。皇叔於兰淳焉，打北方的蛮族——雇了我们。一百二十个剑手，从西边来。打完，留下三十个。我是第十二代。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.老兵
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "三十个里的一个。他看见了——那个鬼的头，怎么封的。活着的时候不说。死前，刻在一片铜上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "牒在你手里。读了，再还我们一个人情——冯禄来的时候，站在门口。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "巴掌大，一片铜。十二代，传到我。三十年前，我把它存进拜火祠——火前最安全，没人敢在火前拿不是自己的东西。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "祠规：火前不说谎。取牒，要过一场问话。三句。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.lines.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "看着桌上的灯。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "我们过不了。三十年前，为了这块地，我们对祭司说过一句谎。火记得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你不是我们的人。你去。——先想好，站哪边：市舶司要清走我们，浪人要我们的地。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "坐下。先说我的祖上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "封头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.封头.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "牒上刻的。我读过，记不全——「头在湖底」，别的，你自己读。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.封头.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "先问铜牒。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站大秦人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.confirm
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站到大秦人一边——在拜火祠过问话取铜牒，替他们挡住冯禄的文书。从此鬼笠馆不见你，浪人刀法学不到。要站大秦人吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你站了我们这边。去祠里，火前说真话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你去了鬼笠馆。……没有话说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.rules.lines.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "看了你很久，站了起来——慢，左腿先。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "好。那你替我们去火前。三句真话，牒是你的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "读了，再还我们一个人情：冯禄来的时候，站在门口。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.站大秦人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "先听我说完铜牒的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.市舶司.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄走了。地还是我们的。——你欠我们的人情，我们记着；我们欠你的，也记着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.市舶司.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄。兵部的文书，说我们聚众持械。三十年，税没拖过一文。文书的印——卢卡说，你看得出。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "假的。你让他自己看见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你看出来了。假印。兵部没有下这个令——有人借兵部的名字要我们的地。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.文书.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄案上压着。你去看。印色——卢卡说你学过。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.浪人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠馆。早川。他们要这块地——练刀的板地不够用。冯禄一动手，他们就来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.卢卡
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "好孩子。走了一个月，剑没卖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.大秦
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "没有了。城烧了，人散了。我们不是使臣，是剩下的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.铁盾会
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盾在前，剑在后。盾不倒，人不倒。三百年，就这一条。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.鬼
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "没有头的那个。我们那边的老兵传了三百年。头在哪里，牒上有——去问铜牒。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry topic
#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盾"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.盾.rules.lines.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "从架上取下一面圆盾，递给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.盾.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "拿着。盾在前，剑在后——盾不倒，人不倒。套在左臂上，再来学剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.盾.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盾给过你了。丢了的话，市集铜器铺有卖的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun inquiry.盾.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盾在前，剑在后。会里的规矩。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "抬起头，灰眼睛看了你一会儿，站了起来——慢，左腿先。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "卢卡的人。他说，你在找一把剑钉着的头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "坐。我的祖上见过它。三百年前，皇叔於兰淳焉打北方的蛮族，雇了我们一百二十个剑手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "其中一个，看见那个鬼的头怎么封的。他死前，刻在一片铜上。十二代，传到我——问我「铜牒」。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "被两个差役押在船边，手上一副枷。他看见你，看了很久，没有说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "关北的事传到海边了：有人借了槐阳王的兵，踏平了兵部的工地。兵部说关北反了——说的是你吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "关北的工地一夜里少了一半人，兵部到今天没查出是谁。……是你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄的事还没了结。了结了，再说拜师。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.andun apprentice.accept_say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "好。盾在前，剑在后——从今天起，你是铁盾会的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高鼻深目的异族汉子，头发剪得很短，左臂绑着一面圆盾，右手一把短剑。他练得满头是汗，盾面上全是剑尖戳出来的白点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"大秦剑手把盾往上一抬，短剑从盾沿底下刺出去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"大秦剑手喊了一声号子，谁也听不懂。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"两面盾砰地撞在一起。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman chat_msg_combat
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"大秦剑手喝道：盾！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry.会首
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "里头。安敦。我们的头——他说的话，就是会里的话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry.盾
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盾在前，剑在后。盾不倒，人不倒。——会首教的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry.市舶司
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "要清我们走。走哪儿去？西边没有了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry.浪人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "刀快。可他们没有盾。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman inquiry.卢卡
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "回来了。剑没卖。会首说他做得对。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "穆护"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "拜火祠祭司"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦高的老人，白袍，白帽，嘴上蒙着一块白布——人说是怕他的气息污了火。他的眼睛被火光照得发亮，看人的时候一眨也不眨。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"穆护站在火坛前，一动不动，火光在他的白袍上一明一暗。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"穆护往火里添了什么，火没有变。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fire_worshipper inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "火"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.火
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "三百年没灭。不是我们在喂它——是它在看我们。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "祠规"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.祠规
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一条：火前不说谎。说了，火知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry topic
#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.verb
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "问话"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.问话.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "问过了。牒在你手里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.问话.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站到火前去。我问，你答。火听着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.问话.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "火前只问站定了的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "牒在你手里了。火让你拿的，不是我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "大秦人存的。三十年了。他们取不了——他们在火前说过谎。你要取，火前站着，答我三句。真话，牒给你；一句假，今天火不肯。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "祠里存的东西，各有各的主。你问的是谁的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "三十年前，他们为了一块地在火前说过一句谎。火记着。他们自己也记着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.浪人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "刀是刀，火是火。他们不进来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest inquiry.市舶司
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "冯禄不进来。他的文书也不进来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "抬起一只手，掌心向你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_priest calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "进来可以。火前，不说谎。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "拜火的胡商"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个跪在火坛前的胡商，额头贴着地，嘴里低低地念着什么。他的背上还搭着赶路的毡子，鞋底的泥是黄的——刚进番坊。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"拜火的胡商把额头贴在地上，很久没有抬起来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"拜火的胡商低低地念着什么，一句接一句。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper inquiry.火
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "我从西边来，走了一年。到了这儿，先拜火，再做生意。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "祭司"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper inquiry.祭司
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "穆护不骗人，也不让人骗。做生意的人，怕他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fire_worshipper inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "他们不进来。三十年了。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "龙若法王"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个七十来岁的老僧，皮肤黝黑，光头，眉毛全白了，耳垂长得几乎到肩。他盘腿坐在榕树下的蒲团上，一身赭红的僧衣，手里一串黑木的念珠拨得很慢。他说中原话带着天竺的腔，可一个字也不错。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"龙若法王拨着念珠，嘴唇动着，没有声音。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"龙若法王抬头看了看榕树，说道：阿弥陀佛。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.剃度.rules.say
#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.出家.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "阿弥陀佛！你我同是出家人，何故跟老衲开这等玩笑？"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.剃度.rules.say
#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.出家.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "阿弥陀佛！女施主，这里是寺庙，请到尼庵去剃度吧。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.剃度.rules.say
#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.出家.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "阿弥陀佛！善哉！善哉！施主若真心皈依我佛，请跪下(kneel)受戒。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "寺"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.寺
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "日陀罗寺。两个天竺僧人盖的，老衲是第二代。寺小，佛不小。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.山烟寺
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "山烟寺的独眼头陀？他的内功和老衲的是一个根——都是从西边的西边来的。阿弥陀佛。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "阿弥陀佛。他们拜的火，和老衲拜的佛，隔着一条街。火也好，佛也好，都不叫人撒谎。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.浪人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "刀出鞘，火就灭。老衲说过他们，他们不听。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.铜牒
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "大秦人存在火前的那片铜？老衲听说过。三百年前的事，刻在铜上，铜不会老。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry topic
#. fanfang.temple_yard.landmark.banyan name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "榕树"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.lama_master inquiry.榕树
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "第一代的师父从天竺带来一根枝条，插在这儿，活了。树活了七十年，老衲也活了七十年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "天竺僧"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个皮肤黝黑的僧人，光头，赤脚，身上裹着一块赭红的布。他念的经没有一个字听得懂，调子却很好听。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"天竺僧低声念着经，调子一起一伏。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"天竺僧双手合十，朝榕树的方向拜了一拜。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "法王"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry.法王
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "法王七十一了。他说他还要收十个弟子，收满了就坐化。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry.经
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "贝叶经。从天竺背来的，一片叶子一页。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry.山烟寺
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "山烟寺？那边有一位独眼的头陀，他的内功和我们的是一个根。法王说的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry.榕树
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "第一代师父带来的一根枝条。现在你看——一棵树像一片林子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.indian_monk inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "他们的火在街那头。我们的佛在这头。中间是卖香料的。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "早川直义"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠馆馆主"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个五十来岁的倭人，瘦，背挺得笔直，头发在头顶挽成一个髻。他坐在板屋尽头，一把窄而弯的长刀横在膝上，两只手搭在刀鞘上，一动不动。他的中原话说得很慢，一个字一个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"早川直义坐着不动，刀横在膝上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"早川直义的拇指把刀往外推了一寸，又按了回去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.rules.say
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你站了那边。我们没有话说。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "在你手里了。火前拿的也好，夜里拿的也好——铜不认人。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "夜里。拜火祠。火坛前站着，别出声。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "要铜牒？过我一刀。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.铜牒.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "大秦人存在火前的东西。你要？"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站浪人"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.confirm
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站到浪人一边——过早川一刀，夜里让浪人替你从拜火祠偷出铜牒；浪人会给冯禄的文书作证，市舶司就把大秦人清出番坊。从此铁盾会不认你，大秦人的盾剑学不到。要站浪人吗？"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "站过了。刀在这里——过我一刀。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.rules.lines.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "看了你很久，把刀从膝上拿起来，横在你面前。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "好。铜牒，我们替你拿——火前拿不到的东西，夜里拿。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "先过我一刀。一击之内定生死。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.站浪人.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "大秦人的铜牒，你还没听他们说过。先去铁盾会。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一刀"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.一刀
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一击之内定生死。刀出鞘，只出一次。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#. native.npc.ronin inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "门规"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.门规
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "门口那块牌子。一击之内定生死——刀出鞘，只出一次，出了就不收。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.鬼笠
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "门上那顶斗笠。从倭国来的时候戴的，破了，挂着。馆就叫这个。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "地"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.地
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会那块地，三十年前是我们的。火前，他们说了一句谎，地就成了他们的。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.铁盾会
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "盾在前，剑在后。好。可一击之内，盾没有用。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.拜火祠
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "火不说谎。人说。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.大秦人
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "三十年前，他们在火前说了一句谎。火没蹿起来——火也会看人。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.冯禄.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "……他的印是假的。我们早知道。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.冯禄.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "市舶司的。他要人，我们借他四个。差，是他的差。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.刀.rules.lines.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "从架上取下一把刀，连鞘扔给你。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.刀.rules.lines.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "你的。出鞘，只出一次。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.刀.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "刀给过你了。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master inquiry.刀.rules.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "架上的刀，都是出过鞘的。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "抬眼看了你一下，又低下头。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "从板屋尽头抬起头。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master trials.confirm
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"早川直义的一刀是真砍：\n"
"· 只有一刀，实打实地落在你身上，挨中了会受伤。\n"
"· 接不住，你随后会昏倒；他收着刀，不会要你的命。\n"
"倒了可以歇好再来。\n"
"确定过他一刀吗？"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master trials.deed
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "在鬼笠馆接下了早川直义的一刀"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master trials.label
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "过他一刀"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master trials.blows.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "早川直义站了起来，刀还在鞘里。「一击之内定生死。」——刀出鞘了。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master trials.blows.fail
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "早川直义把刀插回鞘里：「不够。歇好了再来。」"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master trials.success
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "早川直义收刀入鞘：「过了。今夜，拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。」"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master family.title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "宗道"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master apprentice.requires.refuse_say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一刀都没过，拜什么师。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.npc.ronin_master apprentice.accept_say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "……刀出鞘，只出一次。记住。从今天起，你是鬼笠馆的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin title
#. native.npc.ronin_fighting title
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "鬼笠馆"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个戴斗笠的倭人，斗笠压得很低，只看得见下巴。他腰里一把窄而弯的长刀，两只手一直离刀柄不远。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"浪人举刀，劈下，收刀——只有一刀。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin chat_msg
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"浪人把斗笠往下按了按。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.ronin_fighting chat_msg_combat
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"浪人喝道：一刀！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin inquiry topic
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "馆主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin inquiry.馆主
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "板屋尽头坐着的。早川。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin inquiry.门规
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "一击之内定生死。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin inquiry.铁盾会
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "那块地是我们的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin inquiry.冯禄
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "借我们四个。差是他的，刀是我们的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ronin_fighting long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个戴斗笠的倭人，刀已经出了鞘，窄而弯的刀身贴着小臂。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shadow_thief name
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "黑影"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shadow_thief long
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个从头到脚裹在黑布里的人，蹲在火坛后头，只露一双眼睛。火光照不到他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shadow_thief calls.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "从火坛后头站起来，手里一片发黑的铜。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shadow_thief calls.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"净室里传出一声骂，是波斯话。门没有开。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shadow_thief calls.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid "拿着。走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shadow_thief calls.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑影翻过屋顶的方洞，没了。火坛底下的暗格开着，空的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/cliff_top long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"忘情谷外的小路出了林子，地势一下子高了。眼前是一片光秃秃的崖头，风很大，草都贴着地长。往西看，崖下是一片灰蓝，一直铺到天边——那是海。路边一座小石龛，龛前摆着几个贝壳。路顺着崖往南下去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/cliff_path long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"路是从崖壁上凿出来的。东边是黑褐色的石壁，西边一道矮矮的石沿，石沿外头就是海。浪打在崖脚，轰的一声碎成白沫，风把水星子一直吹到路上。路面湿漉漉的，凿出来的台阶让背盐的脚夫踩得发亮。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/cliff_foot long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"崖到这里低了下来，路变成一段石阶，弯弯曲曲地通到下面的码头。从这儿看得见码头上的平底船和一垛一垛的货，再往东是一片挤在一起的屋顶——番坊。海风里有盐味、鱼腥味，还有一股说不上来的香料味。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/dock long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道石砌的码头沿着海边铺开，两条木栈道伸进海里。三条平底船拴在栈道边，船身黑乎乎的，帆卷着。卸货的胡商和船工吆喝着把一箱箱货抬上岸；码头当中摆着一张桌子，一个小吏坐在那里收税。往东，一条路通进市集。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/shed long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"码头西头，崖脚下搭着一溜草棚，几根木柱撑着一面草顶，风一大就哗哗地响。棚里堆着渔网、船桨、缆绳，一口锅架在石头上煮着鱼汤。船工没活的时候就坐在这里，补网，晒太阳，骂船主。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bazaar_west long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"番坊的市集只有一条街，街面是黄土夯的，两边挤满了摊子和矮房子。西头的摊子卖毡毯和琉璃：毡毯挂在竹竿上，红的黄的，花纹是中原没有的；琉璃珠子一串一串，太阳一照，满摊子都是光。南边一座灰墙的院子，门上挂着一块牌子：市舶司。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bazaar_east long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"东头的摊子卖香料和铜器。香料装在麻袋里，袋口敞着，黄的是姜黄，红的是胡椒，黑的说不上名字，一条街都是那股味。铜器摊上的壶和盘子敲得叮当响。街的尽头是一座黑石砌的矮房子，门口冒着烟——人说里面的火三百年没灭过。北边一条短巷，通到一扇立着两面大盾的门；南边屋子中间裂开一条坡道，坡底露出一截赭红的寺墙。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bazaar_north long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"巷子尽头是一扇厚木门，门两边各立着一面大盾，比人还高，铁皮包边，盾面上漆着一只展翅的鹰，漆掉了一半。门里传出铁器相碰的声音，还有人用听不懂的话喊着号子。这是大秦人的剑会，番坊人叫它铁盾会。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/office long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间方方正正的公事房，地上铺着青砖。靠里一张大书案，案上堆着账册，压着一杆戥子。墙上贴着几张告示，最新的一张盖着京师的大印。屋角堆着收上来的货：一卷毡子、两只铜壶、一袋胡椒，都贴着封条。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/yard long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"后院不大。靠墙码着一摞扣下来的货箱，箱上的字有中原字，也有弯弯曲曲的胡字。一辆没套牲口的车停在角落里，车辕上拴着一串锁链。墙角有一只箱子让人撬开过——夜里有人翻墙进来，想把自己的货拿回去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/bazaar_slope long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"市集东头的屋子中间裂开一条巷子，往南一路下坡。坡道是黄土夯的，两边是香料铺和胡商客栈的后墙，墙根晒着一排香料口袋，墙头爬着一丛开紫花的藤。坡底一座赭红墙的小寺，寺门口一棵大榕树，气根一根根垂到地上。寺里有时传出一声钟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/shield_yard long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"厚木门里是一个方方正正的大院子，地上铺着沙，踩出一个个脚印。十来个高鼻深目的汉子两两对着练，左手盾右手短剑，盾撞在一起砰砰地响。北墙下一排盾牌架，架上的圆盾一面挨一面；东墙根几根木桩让剑尖戳得坑坑洼洼。院子北头一间石屋，门敞着——那是会首的屋。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/shield_hall long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间石头砌的屋子，不大，屋顶很低。地上铺着一张红底黄花的毡毯，毯子中间一张矮桌，桌上一盏铜灯。墙根靠着一面旧盾，盾面上的鹰只剩一个影子；盾旁边钉着一块木牌，刻着一行弯弯曲曲的字。靠墙一排铺盖卷，卷得整整齐齐。一个白头发的老人坐在矮桌后头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/fire_hall long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"殿里很黑，只有当中一团火。火坛是黑石砌的，齐胸高，坛顶的火不高不低地烧着，看不见柴，也看不见油——人说它三百年没灭过。烟从屋顶的一个方洞出去。四壁的黑石让烟熏得发亮。火坛前的地上磨出一块白印子，是跪出来的。东边一道矮门，通到祭司的净室。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/priest_room long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间小小的石室，干净得过分：一张窄榻，一只木箱，一盏灯，再没有别的。墙上没有神像，只有一块黑石板，板上刻着一团火的形状。地上扫得一粒灰都没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/temple_yard long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一座不大的寺院，赭红的墙，墙头长着草。院子当中一棵大榕树，树冠把半个院子罩住，气根一根根垂下来，有的已经扎进地里成了树干。树下一个蒲团，一个老僧盘腿坐在上头。院角一口铜钟挂在木架上，钟身发绿。东边一间佛殿，门开着，里头一点灯光。南墙开着一道小门，门外的坡道底下是浪人的武馆。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/shrine long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"殿不大，供着一尊佛像，不是中原的样子：高鼻、细眼、卷发，衣褶一道一道贴在身上，是天竺来的。佛前一张供桌，桌上几盏酥油灯，灯火一跳一跳的。地上几个蒲团，一个天竺僧跪在那里念经，念的是谁也听不懂的话。殿角堆着几卷贝叶经。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/gate_yard long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道刷黑的木门，门楣上挂着一顶破了边的斗笠——这就是「鬼笠」。门里一小片夯土的门庭，墙根立着一块白木牌，墨写着一行字：「一击之内定生死」。东边一道敞着的板门，里头是练刀的板地，刀劈在木头上的声音一下一下，不紧不慢。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:fanfang/dojo long
#: data/fanfang/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间长长的板屋，地上铺着刷黑的木板，板缝里全是刀口。墙上一排刀架，架上的刀都比中原的刀窄、弯。几个浪人在板地上练刀，一人一刀，劈下去就收，谁也不出第二刀。板屋尽头坐着一个人，刀横在膝上，不说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.cliff_top.landmark.shrine name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "海神龛"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.cliff_top.landmark.shrine long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"一座齐腰高的石龛，石头让海风蚀出了一个个小洞。龛里供的不是神像，是一块磨得溜圆的黑石头。石前摆着贝壳、一枚铜钱、半块干饼——都是出海的人放的。龛边刻着两个字：「平安」，字口里长了青苔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.cliff_path.landmark.sea long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"海是灰蓝的，近处发绿，远处发黑，一直铺到天边，看不见对岸。海上一条船也没有——番坊的船都拴在码头上。浪一排一排地过来，在崖脚撞碎，退下去，又来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dock.landmark.boats name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "平底船"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dock.landmark.boats long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"三条平底船，船底平，船头方，帆是竹篾一片一片编的。船身刷的桐油黑得发亮，船头画着一只眼睛。船工说，船不是番坊的，是南边来的商人的；番坊人只管装卸、守船，拿一份工钱。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.bazaar_north.landmark.shields name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "大盾"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.bazaar_north.landmark.shields long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"两面大盾，比人还高一头，长方的，盾面弯成半个筒。木胎外头蒙着牛皮，边上包着铁，铆钉一圈一圈。盾面上漆着一只展翅的鹰，金漆掉了一半，露出底下的红。盾脚插在土里，插得很深，像是从来没拔出来过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.landmark.notice long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"墙上贴着一张布告，纸是京师的纸，字是抄的：\n"
"布告上写著：辑拿要犯----於兰天武。\n"
"布告的一角盖着市舶司的小印，旁边一行小字：「京师东二门原告，番坊照抄」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.landmark.fire name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "火坛"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.landmark.fire long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"一座黑石砌的火坛，齐胸高，石头让三百年的烟熏得乌黑发亮。坛顶一团火，不高不低，不红不白，烧得很静，看不见柴，也看不见油。火前的石头上磨出一块白印子，是一代一代跪出来的。坛身上刻着一行弯弯曲曲的字，没有人认得；祭司说那是祠规——火前不说谎。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.hall.landmark.tablet name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "木牌"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.hall.landmark.tablet long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"一块巴掌大的木牌钉在墙上，木头发黑，上面刻着一行弯弯曲曲的字——大秦人自己的字。安敦说，那是剑会的第一条规矩，三百年前第一代会首刻的：盾在前，剑在后。盾不倒，人不倒。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.temple_yard.landmark.banyan long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"一棵大榕树，树冠罩住了半个院子。气根从枝上一根根垂下来，细的像绳，粗的已经扎进地里成了树干，一棵树看着像一片林子。树下的地让人坐得光溜溜的。天竺僧说，这树是第一代僧人从天竺带来的一根枝条，插在这儿，活了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shrine.landmark.buddha long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"一尊天竺样子的佛像：高鼻、细眼、卷发，嘴角带一点笑，衣褶一道一道贴在身上，像是湿的。像是石头雕的，上过金，金掉了大半，露出底下的灰石。佛前几盏酥油灯，灯火一跳一跳，佛的脸也跟着一明一暗。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.gate_yard.landmark.rule name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "门规木牌"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.gate_yard.landmark.rule long
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"一块白木牌，立在墙根，墨写着一行字：「一击之内定生死」。字写得又瘦又硬，像刀刻的。牌子底下的土让人跪过，陷下去两个坑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"书案上压着一纸兵部文书，字写得端端正正：\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"「番坊大秦人等，聚众持械，着市舶司即日清出，不得延误。——兵部」\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"底下兵部的印旁边，还压着一方「镇国大将军」印，印色暗红发黑。你见过这个颜色：逆灵宫那叠文书上的印就是这样。印模上的真印是正红的，泛黄光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"这一纸文书的印是假的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"落款的日子，是关北工地出事后的第三天。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.office.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"底下兵部的大印旁边，还压着一方「镇国大将军」印，印色暗红。冯禄说这是京师来的令，谁也不敢不认。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "火前问话"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"火坛前没有人。穆护的净室里亮着灯，门关着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "天刚亮，火还没静。今天火不肯——明天再来。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.ask
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "火今天不肯。要在祠里等到明天黎明，再问一次吗？（世界的时间会过去，别的地方照旧过它们的日子。）"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.choice
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "等到明天"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "等。火自己会静。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"天亮了。坛顶的火又矮了下去，不红不白，烧得很静。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "火静了。——再来一次。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "牒在你手里了。火前没有你的事了。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "走到火坛前，掌心向火。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "三句。我问，你答。火听着。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.true.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"火矮了下去，矮得几乎看不见，只剩坛顶一圈发白的热气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.true.emote
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "把手伸进火坛底下——火一点没碰着他。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.true.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "火静了。它认你。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.true.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"穆护从火坛底下取出一片发黑的铜，放在你手里。还是温的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.true.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "大秦人存了三十年的东西。你拿去。火前拿的，谁也不能说你偷。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.false.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"火「轰」地蹿起来，一直蹿到屋顶的方洞，整座祠亮得像白天；又落下去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.false.emote
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "退了一步，白布底下看不出脸色。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.false.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "今天火不肯。明天再来。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "你站了浪人。火前没有你的事——他们拿东西，不走火前。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.fire_hall.questions act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "大秦人的牒？他们托了你。——那就先站定。火前只问站定了的人：你站大秦人，还是站浪人，去跟安敦说，或者去鬼笠馆。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "冯禄的文书"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.verb
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "对质"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"冯禄已经退走了。地还是大秦人的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "看了看地上的四个人，又看了看你，把文书卷起来揣进袖子。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "……兵部的令，本司回头再议。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"冯禄退出了铁盾会的门。院子里的大秦人把盾举起来，一齐喊了一声——你听不懂，可听得出是什么意思。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "番坊欠你一个人情。决战那天——不管在哪儿，铁盾会的盾到。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"你把印模翻过来，按在冯禄手里那纸文书的「镇国大将军」印旁边，举起来对着光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"印色不对。模子上的朱砂正红泛黄，文书上的暗红发黑——字口一模一样，颜色差着一截。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "盯着那方印，嘴张了张，没有声音。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "这……这是兵部发的文书……"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "假印的差，我们不接。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"四个浪人把刀收回鞘里，转身出了门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "……本司、本司回去查。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"冯禄挨过你那一顿，那纸文书再没人提。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"差是冯禄的差。他倒了，跟他来的人也就散了。院子里的大秦人把盾举起来，一齐喊了一声——你听不懂，可听得出是什么意思。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.ask
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "你拿不出能和那方印对一对的东西。冯禄身后站着四个浪人——要动手把他们打退吗？（铁盾会的人会替你打。）"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.choice
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "动手"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.shield_yard.papers act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"四个浪人拔了刀。会首的屋里冲出三个人，盾在前，剑在后，站到了你两边。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest name
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "板地"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.verb
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "歇"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "天已经黑了。去拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.ask
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "要在板地上歇到天黑吗？（世界的时间会过去，别的地方照旧过它们的日子。）"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.choice
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "歇到天黑"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"你在板地一角坐下。浪人们一刀一刀地劈，没有人看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"天黑了。板屋里点起一盏灯。\n"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.steps.say
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid "去吧。拜火祠——火坛前站着，别出声。"
msgstr ""

#. fanfang.dojo.rest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/fanfang/world.json
msgid ""
"板地是练刀的地方，不是歇脚的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/guard_token name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "御前侍卫腰牌"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/guard_token long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"一块铜腰牌，巴掌大，正面刻着「御前侍卫」四个字，背面一个编号，编号底下有人用刀尖划了一道——上一个带它的人留下的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/guard_token no_drop
#. native:snow/fonxan_tally no_drop
#: data/imperial/items.json data/native/items.json
msgid "这块腰牌不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/original_decree name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "寻剑令原本"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/original_decree long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"一卷黄绫裹着的诏书，只有一行字，先帝的御笔：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」后头钤着一方御宝，朱色正红。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/original_decree no_drop
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "先帝的诏书不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/war_ministry_copy name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "兵部抄本"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/war_ministry_copy long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"兵部存档的寻剑令复本，同一个日子，同一个开头。「寻剑」之后多出三行：「征民夫，设关卡，拿人。」后头盖着兵部的印，印色暗红发黑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/war_ministry_copy no_drop
#. native:choyin/decree_copy no_drop
#: data/imperial/items.json data/native/items.json
msgid "这卷抄本不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/woodcutter_record name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "樵夫的旧记载"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/woodcutter_record long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"一页发黄的手札，先帝的字：「樵夫言：入山遇风，风大不能行，伏地良久；风止，抬头见白石城，铃声满耳。——风停处即是城。」页边有一行小字，墨色新些：「父皇，儿也想去。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/woodcutter_record unit
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "页"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/woodcutter_record no_drop
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "这页手札不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/edict_for_uncle name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "手诏"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/edict_for_uncle long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"一张黄笺，字写得很慢，一笔一划：「皇叔：前诏非朕本意。朝中无人，侄儿请叔父回来。——昭」底下一方小印，印泥还没干透。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/edict_for_uncle no_drop
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "皇帝的手诏不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/late_emperor_reading name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "先帝的解读"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/late_emperor_reading long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"一卷先帝的手稿，推敲商句遗书的最后两句，密密麻麻改了好几遍。最后一页只写着：「风自岚来。逆风而行，风止之处，城见。」页角有庾子建的批注：「试过三次，未果。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/late_emperor_reading no_drop
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "这卷手稿不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/palace_blade_manual name
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid "禁中刀谱"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/palace_blade_manual long
#: data/imperial/items.json
msgid ""
"一册蓝布面的小本子，边角磨得发白，里头是工笔画的七个人形，一招一式都在宫门、长街、殿上。每一页的边上冯策用小楷批了一句，最后一页是：「刀在鞘里的时候最多。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "葛升"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "兵部武选司主事"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个四十来岁的官儿，青袍上落着几点墨，坐在棚下的条案后头，面前一本名册、一方砚、一支秃了尖的笔。他看人先看手——手上有没有茧——再看脸。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"葛升蘸了蘸墨，在名册上勾了一笔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"葛升说道：下一个。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 inquiry topic
#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 inquiry topic
#. native.npc.deng_xiao inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "武举"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.武举.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "三场都过了，还问什么。明日早朝殿试——午门候旨。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.武举.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "名字已经写上了。先是两位校尉，最后是邓将军。打到见血就算，不许下死手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.武举.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "抬眼把你从头看到脚，又看了看你的手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.武举.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "报武举？今年文武大选，兵部开的科。名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.武举.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "在名册上写了一行，吹了吹墨。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.武举.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "三场：两位御林军校尉，最后是邓将军。打到见血就算，不许下死手。三场都过了，明日殿试。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.兵部
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "兵部管天下的兵马，也管武举。小的只管写名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_zhao inquiry topic
#. native.npc.court_official inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry topic
#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "庾尚书"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.庾尚书.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "尚书……下了狱。武选司换了人管。小的只管写名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.庾尚书.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "尚书大人的事，不是小的能说的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "殿试"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.殿试.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "明日早朝，午门外候着，有人传你。见了皇上磕头，别抬头看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng inquiry.殿试.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先把三场打完再说殿试。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "把笔一搁，看了你半晌。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.ge_sheng calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "三场都过了。——明日早朝殿试，午门候旨。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "赵勇"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 title
#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "御林军校尉"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个二十来岁的校尉，红袍外头罩着软甲，袖子挽到肘上，胳膊上一道一道的旧疤。他刚和人对过刀，额头上的汗还没干。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.deng_xiao accept_fight.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "抱拳行了一礼，摆开了架势。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 accept_fight.say
#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 accept_fight.say
#. native.npc.deng_xiao accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "武考，点到为止。请。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 accept_fight.say
#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 accept_fight.say
#. native.npc.deng_xiao accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你已经过了我这一关。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先去葛主事那儿报了名再来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_1 inquiry.武举
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "第一场是我。打到见血就算，不许下死手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "孙锐"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个三十出头的校尉，个子不高，站得像钉在地上。他看人的时候眼睛半眯着，像在量你的步子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "赵校尉那一关还没过，轮不到我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.exam_lieutenant_2 inquiry.武举
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "第二场是我。赵勇那小子手重，我比他手准。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "邓骁"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "御林军将领"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个四十岁上下的将领，方脸，络腮胡子，骑在一匹高头大马上绕着场子巡视。他下马的时候马鞭往鞍上一挂，一句话不说，先活动手腕。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "前两场还没打完，找我做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao inquiry.武举
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "最后一场是我。过了我，明日见皇上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao inquiry.於兰天武
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "当年的武状元。一杆枪挑了七个人，七个人没一个见血——那才叫点到为止。后来他不做官了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"邓骁勒着马在场边转了一圈。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.deng_xiao chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"邓骁说道：手腕子软的，回去再练三年。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "守门禁军"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard title
#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes title
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate title
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden title
#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "禁军"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个披甲的禁军，红缨盔，手按着腰刀，站在午门的铁门前一动不动。他的眼睛不看人，看的是人的手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"守门禁军把长戟换了一只手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "进宫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard inquiry.进宫
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "宫门重地。要进去，要么是皇上宣的，要么是跟着上朝的官。校武场今年开武举，中了的明日殿试；相国府的人，早朝时跟着相国进。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard inquiry topic
#. imperial name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/imperial/world.json
msgid "皇城"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard inquiry.皇城
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你看见的是午门。里头的事，不是你该问的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wumen_guard accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "天子脚下，谁跟你比划。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "韦执中"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong title
#. native.npc.xiangguo_servant inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "相国"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦小的老人，穿一件洗得发白的旧袍子，袖口补过。他的背有点驼，可是看人的时候眼睛很亮，一句话要想一会儿才出口，出口就不收回。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"韦执中翻过一页书，在页边上点了一个墨点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"韦执中咳了两声，把茶壶里的凉茶倒了半盏。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老夫拿笔的手，拿不动刀。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "接过名帖，凑到灯下看了看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong accept_object.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "骆易的儿子荐来的。他父亲当年在老夫门下读过三年书，后来不读了，去练剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong accept_object.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "坐。说吧，什么事要找到相国府来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong accept_object.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老夫不收东西。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.兵部.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "兵部？庾子建的兵部。他掌兵马，朝里一半的人是他的门生。你要说什么，先说凭据。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.兵部.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的事，问兵部去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.寻剑令.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先帝的寻剑令？老夫当年在场。先帝亲笔，一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。后来兵部颁下去的是什么，老夫就不知道了——没人给老夫看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.寻剑令.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先帝的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "奏本"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你已经是御前侍卫了，皇上见过你。还要老夫递什么本。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "本子写好了。明日卯时，午门外候着，跟着老夫上朝。别说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "听你说完，半晌没有出声。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "乔阴程县令录了供，槐阳王拒了兵部的令——两处说的是一件事：兵部拿着先帝的寻剑令，干先帝没让干的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "铺开一张折子，提笔写了很久，写完吹了吹墨。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "本子老夫写了。递上去，庾子建当殿就会驳。驳不驳得倒，要看皇上——皇上十六岁。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "明日卯时，午门外候着，跟着老夫上朝。别说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "接过那卷发黄的抄本，看了很久，手指在最后一个没有点墨的名字上停了一下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前的抄本。一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。——这是先帝的话，老夫认得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "铺开一张折子，提笔写了很久。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "本子老夫写了。明日卯时，午门外候着，跟着老夫上朝。别说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "空口告兵部尚书？老夫不递这种本。去乔阴找程县令——他录过供。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.奏本.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你是什么人，要老夫递本？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "早朝"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.早朝.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "卯时，午门外。天亮前就得到。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.早朝.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "早朝是官的事。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.骆云舟
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "骆家的二小子？他父亲骆易在老夫门下读过书。后来父子俩都去练剑了，可惜了那一手字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_zhizhong inquiry.庾子建
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "当年打仗是一把好手，老夫亲眼见过。如今……如今他的门生比老夫的书多。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiangguo_servant name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老仆"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiangguo_servant long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个弯着腰的老仆，手里一把竹扫帚，扫得很慢，扫过的地方一片落叶也没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiangguo_servant chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"老仆扫着院子里的落叶。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiangguo_servant chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"老仆把鸡赶回菜畦边上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiangguo_servant inquiry.相国
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "相国在正厅。夜里在书房，常常看书看到天亮。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao name
#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "於兰昭"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao title
#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "天子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个十六岁的少年，穿着明黄的龙袍，袍子做得大了一点，袖口挽过一道。他坐得很直，直得像有人在背后看着他。说话之前他总要先看一眼站在百官最前面的那个人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"太监尖着嗓子喊：「武状元上殿——」百官分成两列，你从当中走过去，跪下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你……你就是今年的武状元？抬起头来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一会儿，又看了一眼百官最前头那个人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "陛下，校武场三场，臣的武选司亲眼看着打的。此人武艺尚可，出身不明。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "出身……朕也不知道朕的武状元该是什么出身。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "臣请陛下赐他一个侍卫的差事——兵部正缺人手，臣可以替陛下看着他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "陛下，大内侍卫营归臣管。人，臣来看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "像是松了一口气。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "准。赐御前侍卫腰牌——冯总教头，人归你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.lines.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个太监捧着托盘走下台阶，托盘里一块铜腰牌，刻着「御前侍卫」四个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "笑了笑，没有再说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"太监喊：「退朝——」百官鱼贯而出。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao calls.steps.whisper
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇上说，今夜养心殿。冯总教头的人会领你进去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao inquiry.寻剑令
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇的寻剑令……你也知道？——这里说不得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao inquiry.庾尚书
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_wind title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "皇叔"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao inquiry.皇叔
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "朕没有皇叔。——布告上写着的那个人，朕不认识。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_court inquiry.寻剑令
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先帝的旨意，兵部奉旨办差。你是什么人，问这个？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_court inquiry.槐阳王
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "槐阳王不奉诏。不奉诏是什么，你读过书就知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_official name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "朝臣"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_official long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿朝服的官，笏板捧在胸前，眼睛看着自己的靴尖。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_official inquiry.庾尚书
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "……下官什么都没说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fu_an name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "福安"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fu_an title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "内侍"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fu_an long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个十五岁的小太监，脸白，眼睛机灵，走路没有声音。他总站在皇上身后半步，皇上一皱眉他就先低头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fu_an inquiry.皇上
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇上睡得晚。夜里在养心殿，看先帝的手札。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fu_an inquiry.养心殿
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "养心殿在西边。白天跟着我走，夜里……夜里别问我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "司礼太监"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "司礼监"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个上了年纪的太监，嗓子尖，站在龙椅下的台阶边上，手里一柄拂尘，替皇上喊话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "有本早奏，无本退朝——"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "臣韦执中有本。乔阴县令程不平录供，槐阳王拒令：兵部奉先帝寻剑之旨，征民夫、设关卡、拿人——先帝的旨意里没有这一句。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冷笑了一声，出班。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的事，相国也要管？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "臣也有本：槐阳王程朔，兴兵踏平兵部工地，杀朝廷命官，劫民夫——槐阳王反了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"满殿哗然。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "手按在龙椅的扶手上，看看相国，又看看尚书。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "……容朕想想。退、退朝。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.whisper
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇上请相国的随员到养心殿说话。皇上说……先别出宫。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "兵部的事，相国也要管？先帝的旨意是寻剑，兵部办的是寻剑。一个县令、一个藩王，说兵部办错了，凭据呢？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.court_herald calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "……容朕想想。退朝。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes name
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate name
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "巡夜禁军"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes long
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate long
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个披甲的禁军，红缨盔，一手提着灯笼，一手按着刀，走几步停一停，往暗处照一照。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes inquiry topic
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate inquiry topic
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "巡夜"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes inquiry.巡夜
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate inquiry.巡夜
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden inquiry.巡夜
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "夜里宫里不许有人走动。你是哪个宫的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes accept_fight.say
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate accept_fight.say
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "宫里不许比划。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes watch.caught.say
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate watch.caught.say
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden watch.caught.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "什么人！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden watch.caught.lines
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "两个禁军一左一右扭住你的胳膊，提着灯笼把你押到了侍卫营。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden watch.caught.lines
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯策披着衣服从值房里出来，借着灯看了你半晌。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden watch.caught.lines
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯策说道：我认得你。滚出去，别让我看见第二回。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.night_guard_lanes watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_gate watch.caught.lines
#. native.npc.night_guard_garden watch.caught.lines
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "天亮时，侍卫营的人把你从午门推了出去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_eunuch name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "小太监"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_eunuch long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个十几岁的小太监，抱着一摞文书，低着头小步快走，走过你身边的时候眼睛也不抬。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_eunuch inquiry.养心殿
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇上……皇上在养心殿。你、你是哪个宫的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_maid name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "宫女"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_maid long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿青衣的宫女，提着一只竹篮，在柏树底下拣落下的枯枝。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.palace_maid inquiry.冷宫
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "西北角那边？别去。那里只住着一个老嬷嬷，脾气怪。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "钟嬷嬷"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先帝女官"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个七十来岁的老妇人，头发全白了，梳得一丝不乱。她坐在灯下，手里拈着一根绣花针，眼睛却很亮——不像是个住冷宫的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "抬起头看了你一眼，手里的针没有停。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "又是走那条道的？——不对。你不是他们的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "那口井，二十年来只有一个人走。黑衣裳，戴个黑冠，见了我连头都不点。你是第二个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.井
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "那口井通到宫外头的祭坛底下。先帝在的时候封过，后来有人又打开了。是谁，我老婆子不说你也猜得到。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "先帝"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.先帝
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "先帝……先帝病着的时候，还天天让我念那些找岚城的手札给他听。他走了两年了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.寻剑令.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "接过那两卷，凑到灯下，先看了原令，又看了抄本。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.寻剑令.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "这一卷是我誊的。先帝口授，一句话，我一笔一笔写的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.寻剑令.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "那一卷不是。字学得像，可是「寻」字最后一笔，我从来不那么钩。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.寻剑令.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "寻剑令是我誊的。先帝口授，一句话：寻剑，不得扰民一户。我誊了一份，先帝用了宝。——后来外头传的那些，不是这一句。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.养心殿.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇上睡得晚。养心殿西暖阁的窗，窗闩是坏的，先帝在时就坏了，没人修。夜里门口有侍卫，窗下没有。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.养心殿.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "养心殿？你问这个做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.zhong_momo inquiry.禁军
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "夜里他们提着灯笼走，走几步停一停。灯照得到的地方，他们看得远；灯照不到的地方，他们就是瞎子。御花园的石头后头，他们从来不照。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard name
#. native.npc.camp_guard title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个年轻的侍卫，光着膀子对着木人劈刀，一刀一刀都砍在同一道口子上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"大内侍卫一刀劈在木人上，木屑飞了一地。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard accept_fight.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "收了刀，抱拳。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard accept_fight.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "侍卫营里练手，请。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯总教头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.camp_guard inquiry.冯总教头
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "总教头在值房。夜里他也不睡，坐着看簿子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个十六岁的少年，脱了龙袍，只穿一件月白的夹衣，坐在灯下翻他父亲的手札。他看人的时候先往后缩一下，又坐直了——像是想起来自己是皇帝。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "听见响动，抬起头，往后缩了一下，又坐直了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你……你不是来杀朕的。杀朕的人不翻窗。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你从哪儿来的？冷宫的井？——那条路，原来真有人走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇的寻剑令，你也在找？……朕只知道父皇找了一辈子岚城，临走还念着。兵部说征民夫是父皇的意思——朕不知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "庾尚书说，皇叔勾结水烟阁谋反，朕的布告是他拟的。朕……信了一半。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "御书房里有父皇的匣子。钥匙在朕这里。你去看——朕跟你去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "把手札合上，示意福安退到门外。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "坐。……白天殿上，朕不敢说话。你也看见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇的寻剑令，朕只知道一句：寻剑。兵部说征民夫是父皇的意思——朕不知道是不是。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "还有——槐阳王反了，尚书是这么说的。你从关北来，你说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "看见你腰间那把剑，脸一下子白了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "那是……你拔了它？父皇说过，那把剑钉着的东西，不能放出来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.寻剑令.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "原令只一句。多出来的三句……是兵部的。朕现在知道了，可朕不知道该拿它怎么办。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.寻剑令.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇的寻剑令在御书房的匣子里。朕跟你去看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.父皇
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇找了一辈子岚城。临走那天还让钟嬷嬷念手札给他听。朕那年十四岁，在帘子外头听。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.皇叔
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "皇叔……朕小时候他抱过朕。后来布告上说他谋反。朕不信，可是朕不敢不信。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.庾尚书
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "他是父皇的老臣，朝里一半的人听他的。白天你也看见了——朕说一句，他说三句。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.槐阳王.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "尚书说槐阳王兴兵踏平了兵部的工地，杀了朝廷命官。……你说那是兵部在征民夫？那朕的父皇——父皇的令里有没有这一句？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.槐阳王.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "槐阳王程朔，父皇的老朋友。兵部说他不奉诏。朕没见过他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.岚城
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "寻风而至，寻风而逝——父皇的手札里抄了一百遍。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.穿灵.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "你拔了它……那就只能往前走了。父皇的手札里说，要灭它，三样东西都得在。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.穿灵.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "父皇说，玉螺湖底钉着一把剑。他说那把剑不能动。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "怎么办"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_zhao_private inquiry.怎么办
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "……朕还没想好。你先看完父皇的匣子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.neizhai_guard long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个膀大腰圆的护院，抱着胳膊站在内宅的帘子外头，谁来都先瞪一眼。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.neizhai_guard inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "小姐"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.neizhai_guard inquiry.小姐
#. native.npc.neizhai_guard inquiry.庾清尘
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老爷吩咐了，小姐这几天不见人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan name
#. native.npc.wei_canglan_lake name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "卫沧澜"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan title
#. native.npc.wei_canglan_lake title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "武林盟主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦得脱了形的老人，头发胡子全白了，坐在窗下翻一本诗集。他的手腕上有两道旧印，一圈一圈的，是镣铐磨的。墙上那把剑他没看一眼——像是看了二十年，看够了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "从诗集上抬起头，看了你很久。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "二十年，第一个不是庾家的人进这道门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老夫卫沧澜。——你认得这个名字？不认得也好。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.老松岭
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前，先帝召老夫进京，带着水烟阁藏的岚城记载。走到老松岭，一队白衣武官把我们围了。随从替老夫挡了刀，死在山洞里。老夫醒来，就在这间屋里了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.白衣武官.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "白衣，腰里是兵部的刀，领头的人老夫认得——庾子建的亲兵。你要人证？老夫活着走出这道门，就是人证。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.南危水.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "危水……活着？他回了水烟阁？……好。好。二十年，老夫以为他死在那个洞里了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.南危水.rules.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "南危水是老夫的副手。那天他也在。……老夫不知道他是死是活。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.岚城
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁藏的岚城记载，被庾子建收走了。他要的不是剑——是握剑的那只手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.岚城
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "记载上写着：岚城人出城都带一只铃，铃上刻着名字。铃在，风认人；铃丢了，人就回不去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.庾子建
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "他留着老夫，不杀不放，是要水烟阁一直有个「盟主还活着」的念想——盟主在，阁里就不另立；不另立，武林就没有一个能说话的人。二十年，他来过三回，每回只问一句：岚城的记载，还有没有没抄全的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "诗集"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.诗集
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "圈的字，从头连起来念。二十年，老夫只能做这个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry topic
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "走"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.走.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "把诗集合上，放回桌上，站起来，腿晃了一下，又站稳了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.走.rules.lines.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "走。老夫先回水烟阁——要人证的时候，去那里找老夫。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.走.rules.lines.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "从墙上摘下那把剑，推门出去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan inquiry.水烟阁
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老夫回去，水烟阁正月十七还选不选盟主，看他们的。老夫只想把那条路——老松岭那条——再走一遍。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_courier name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫信使"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_courier long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，坐在黑暗里，一动不动，只有眼睛亮。他冠上的丝绦断了一根。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_courier vanishes.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "信使一声不响地散成一股黑烟，一封信飘落在地上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"太和殿上，百官分列。皇帝坐在龙椅上，脸色发白，手按着扶手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "朕……朕有话说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "抢先出班。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "陛下，臣先有本：槐阳王程朔兴兵踏平兵部工地，杀朝廷命官——槐阳王反了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "……先听他说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你走到御案前，把先帝的原令和兵部的抄本并排摊开，又把人证物证一样一样摆上去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」朝臣们一个一个伸长了脖子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "槐阳王拒的，是父皇没下过的令。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "庾子建，这三行……是谁加的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "脸色变了，半晌没有出声。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "陛下年幼，被人蒙蔽——"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "站了起来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫营听令——"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "退后一步，刀已经出了鞘。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_accused calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "老夫替先帝打了半辈子仗！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_drawn summoned.arrive
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "庾子建握着刀，一步一步逼过来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_drawn summoned.leave
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "庾子建被押了下去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_drawn spared.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯策一把扭住庾子建的胳膊，刀「当啷」落在金砖上。两个侍卫上来，把他押了下去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_beside name
#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger inquiry topic
#. native.npc.feng_ce name
#. native.npc.feng_ce_lake name
#. native.npc.feng_ce_lakebottom name
#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯策"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_beside title
#. native.npc.feng_ce title
#. native.npc.feng_ce_lake title
#. native.npc.feng_ce_lakebottom title
#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫营总教头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_beside long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个鬓发斑白的老者，素白的武官袍，刀已经出了鞘，站在你身侧半步。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_beside summoned.arrive
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯策拔刀站到你身边：「老夫来。」"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_beside summoned.leave
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯策收了刀，退回殿下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger name
#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror name
#. native.npc.song_pu name
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宋朴"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger title
#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror title
#. native.npc.song_pu title
#: data/imperial/npcs.json data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫营副教头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦削的老者，白袍，靠在长街的红墙上，手里捏着一串核桃慢慢地转，像是在等人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "核桃停了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "尚书大人请你过府一叙。御书房里的东西，他知道了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "去不去由你。不过尚书大人说，他手里有先帝推敲了二十年的东西——你要找的那座城。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger inquiry.庾尚书
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "尚书大人在府里客厅等你。东街，大铁门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger inquiry.冯策
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "冯总教头是个直人。直人在宫里活不长——这话你别告诉他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"宋朴手里的核桃慢慢地转着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_messenger chat_msg
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"宋朴冲你点了点头：尚书大人记着你的情。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror long
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦削的老者，白袍，站在石林那面镜子旁边，手里捏着一串核桃，没有转。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "从镜子旁边直起身来，核桃在手心里停着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "尚书大人问，剑在谁手里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror calls.steps.emote
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "看了你一眼，又看了看你身后的镜子，没等你答。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror calls.steps.say
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid "不用说了。尚书大人会知道的——到了湖边，他自己来问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu_mirror calls.steps.line
#: data/imperial/npcs.json
msgid ""
"宋朴转身走进石林，雾一合，人就没了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/gate_court long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"进了铁门，眼前豁然一空：三面是高得望不到头的红墙，墙帽上一溜暗金的琉璃瓦，墙根返着一圈白碱，灰皮剥了几块，露出里面的砖。脚下的青砖大得一块能躺下一个人，砖缝里钻出几茎枯草。身后铁门两扇，门钉锈成了褐色。东边一道矮些的院门，门里传来吆喝声和刀碰刀的响，是侍卫营。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/bridges long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道弯弯的河从西流到东，河水是绿的，水面上漂着几片落叶。河上并排五座汉白玉的桥，当中一座最宽，栏杆上雕着龙，龙的爪子缺了好几根，青苔从缺口里长出来。桥北是太和门，门前一对铜狮子，被摸了几百年的狮头亮得发黄。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/taihe_gate long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"太和门是一座重檐的大门，檐下的彩画褪成了灰绿，几只燕子在斗拱里做了窝，门槛被踩出一道凹。门洞里站着两排禁军，红缨盔，手按着刀。门里就是太和殿前的广场。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/square long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"好大一片广场。地上铺的砖一眼望不到边，中间一条御道是整块的石板，被车轮和脚磨得发亮。两边一排排大铜缸，缸身生了绿锈，缸沿有一圈被手摸亮的铜色。北面是三层汉白玉的台基，台上立着太和殿，金瓦红柱，殿前一座日晷、一座铜龟。上朝的时候，这里站满了人；不上朝的时候，风从广场上刮过去，什么都没有。西北角一道小门通出去，是西长街。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/throne_hall long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"殿里很高，也很暗。十几根金漆的柱子，柱上盘着龙，漆掉了的地方露出底下的红。地上铺着金砖——其实是深灰的，磨得能照见人影，边上几块裂了缝。殿的尽头是一座七层的台子，台上一把龙椅，椅背后一面雕龙的屏风。龙椅很大，坐上去的人显得很小。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/guard_yard long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一座方方的院子，地上是踩实的黄土，东头一排木人，木人身上的麻绳散了，刀口一道压一道。兵器架掉了漆，架上的刀倒擦得雪亮。北边一排营房，窗户开着，里面一排通铺；北墙根一间小值房，门口挂着一盏灯。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/duty_room long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间窄小的值房，一张桌、一条长凳、一张木床。桌上压着一本值宿的簿子，墨迹一行一行，最后一行还没干。墙上挂着一口刀、一件白袍。夜里这里的灯总是亮着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/lanes_south long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"两道红墙夹着一条长街，墙高得只剩头顶一线天。墙头的铁钩上挂着宫灯，一盏接一盏，灯纸让风吹破了几个洞。街面是青砖，墙根长着一溜青苔。白天太监和宫女低着头来来往往，夜里只有禁军的灯笼一来一回。东边一道小门回太和殿广场。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/lanes_north long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"长街到了这里宽了一些，西墙下堆着几口裂了的大缸，缸里积着雨水。东边一道宫门，门里就是养心殿；北头一道垂花门通御花园。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/yangxin_gate long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道小些的宫门，门楣上的匾写着「养心门」，金字褪成了土黄。门关着，门缝里透出一点灯光。门前两口铜缸，缸里的水结了一层薄薄的绿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/garden long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"园子里到处是太湖石，一块叠着一块，洞眼里长着草。几株古柏，老得树皮一条一条地裂开，枝子伸得比宫墙还高。藤萝架下一条石子路，石子拼成的花纹缺了好些。北面一座小殿，殿门上的漆掉得斑斑驳驳。夜里风一过，柏树沙沙地响，什么人走过都听不见。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/cold_gate long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"园子的西北角，一道窄窄的角门，门上的铜锁锈死了，可是门轴是新上过油的。门外的路上长满了草——只有一行被人踩倒的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/cold_yard long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一个荒了的院子。杂草长到膝盖，台阶缝里钻出小树。廊下的窗纸破了一半，风一吹就呼啦呼啦地响。院子当中一口枯井，井沿上磨出几道绳槽，井口的辘轳不见了，只剩一根木桩。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/cold_room long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间小屋子，收拾得倒干净：一张床、一张桌、一个绣架，绣架上绷着一幅没绣完的牡丹，线都褪了色。桌上一盏油灯，灯旁一叠发黄的纸，上面的字写得很工整。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/well_bottom long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"井底没有水，只有一层湿泥，泥上有脚印，不止一个人的。井壁上嵌着一道一道的铁蹬，往上爬就是冷宫的院子。北边的井壁上开着一个洞，刚够一个人弯腰钻进去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/tunnel long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一条又窄又长的砖砌甬道，顶上滴着水。砖缝里插着烧剩的蜡烛头，有的还很新。地上掉着一根黑色的丝绦，像是从什么冠上扯下来的。甬道往北一直通到看不见的地方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/cellar_end long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"甬道到这里到了头，几级石阶往上，顶上压着一块石板，石板缝里漏下几根乾草。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/yangxin_yard long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"养心门里一个小院，比外头的宫院都小，地上的砖扫得很干净。院里两口铜缸，一株海棠，海棠底下一张石凳，石凳上搁着一本翻开的书，书页被露水打湿了。北面就是养心殿。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/front_hall long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"殿不大，比太和殿暖和得多。正中一张御座，御座旁的小几上堆着奏折，最上面一本摊开着，朱笔搁在砚台上，笔尖的朱砂已经干了。西边一道帘子是西暖阁，东边一道门是御书房。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/west_room long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"西暖阁里一张炕，炕桌上一盏灯、一摞旧手札、一碗凉了的莲子羹。墙上挂着一幅舆图，舆图西南角用朱笔圈了一个地方，旁边写着两个小字：「岚城？」。西墙上一扇窗，窗闩松松地挂着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:imperial/study long
#: data/imperial/rooms.json
msgid ""
"御书房里四壁都是书架，架上的书函一格一格贴着黄签。正中一张御案，案上笔墨齐全。墙角一只樟木匣，匣上贴着一道封条，封条上的字是先帝的：「寻剑」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.bridges.landmark.lions name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "铜狮"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.bridges.landmark.lions long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"太和门前一对铜狮子，蹲在汉白玉的座上。狮头被摸了几百年，亮得发黄；身上别处都生了一层暗绿的锈。东边那只脚下踩着一只绣球，西边那只脚下按着一只小狮子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.square.landmark.sundial name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "日晷"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.square.landmark.sundial long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"一座汉白玉的日晷，晷面斜斜地朝着南天，铜针的影子落在刻度上。刻度旁有人用指甲刻了一道浅痕——大约是哪个站班的侍卫等下朝等得不耐烦。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.throne_hall.landmark.throne name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "龙椅"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.throne_hall.landmark.throne long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"七层台阶上一把金漆的龙椅，椅背上盘着九条龙，扶手的龙头被手握得发亮。椅子太大了：坐垫上另垫了一块厚褥子，脚下还摆着一只脚踏——坐在这上头的人，脚够不着地。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.tunnel.landmark.cord name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "黑丝绦"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.tunnel.landmark.cord long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"一根黑色的丝绦，一头扯断了，另一头还打着结。是从一顶黑冠上扯下来的——逆灵宫的道士戴的那种。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.cold_yard.landmark.well name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "枯井"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.cold_yard.landmark.well long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"一口枯井，井沿是青石的，磨出几道深深的绳槽。往下看，黑得看不见底，可是井壁上嵌着一道道铁蹬，最上面那几道擦得发亮。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.yangxin_gate.landmark.gate name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "养心门"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.yangxin_gate.landmark.gate long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"养心门关着，门闩在里头。门缝里透出一点灯光——皇上睡得晚。（养心殿是这一章后面的事。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.west_room.landmark.map name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "舆图"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.west_room.landmark.map long
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"一幅旧舆图，北到关北，南到玉螺湖，西南角用朱笔圈了一个地方，旁边两个小字：「岚城？」。圈是新描的，墨色比舆图上的字深得多——有人常常对着它看。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.chest name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "樟木匣"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.chest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"樟木匣里还剩几册先帝的手札，记的都是岚城：哪年派了谁去，回来说了什么。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.chest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"你揭开封条。匣子里一卷黄绫裹着的诏书，一卷兵部存档的复本，底下压着几册手札。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.chest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"诏书只有一行字，先帝的御笔：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」后头钤着一方御宝，朱色正红。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.chest act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"兵部的复本同一个日子、同一个开头，「寻剑」之后多出三行：「征民夫，设关卡，拿人。」后头盖着兵部的印，旁边还有一方「镇国大将军」印。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "御案"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.verb
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "比对"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"两卷都在你手里了。原令一句，抄本四句——多出来的三句，是兵部自己加的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"御案上空着。先把樟木匣里的东西拿出来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"你把两卷并排摊在御案上，就着灯看那两方印。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"御宝的朱色正红，压得匀匀的。兵部那方印暗红发黑——和逆灵宫账房那叠文书上的，是一方，是拓了模子的那一方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"原令是真的。抄本上多出来的三句，是拿着假印的人加的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.lines.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝从樟木匣底抽出一页发黄的纸递给你：「父皇的手札。樵夫进过岚城——你拿着。寻剑的事，父皇没办完；朕交给你了。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"你把印模按在抄本那方「镇国大将军」印旁边。模上的朱砂正红；纸上的印暗红发黑——一模一样的纹，不一样的色。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"抄本上多出来的三句，是拿着假印的人加的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"你想起钟嬷嬷的话：「这一卷是我誊的。那一卷不是。」原令上的字工工整整，和她纸上的一样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"两卷摊在御案上，看来看去，印都是红的，字都是工整的。你认不出哪一卷不对。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.study.desk act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"福安小声说：冷宫里有个钟嬷嬷，当年是先帝跟前的女官……先帝的字，她认得。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose name
#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.choice
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "朝上揭发"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.verb
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "揭发"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝摇摇头：这件事，已经定了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝说道：先看完父皇的匣子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.ask
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "明日早朝，当着百官揭发兵部尚书庾子建。原令、人证、物证都摆上去——庾子建不会束手。去吗？"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝把原令卷起来，又展开，看了很久。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝说道：……好。明天早上，朕当着他们说。冯总教头在殿上，你站在朕下首。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"东方的天空中开始出现一丝微曦。太监在殿外喊：上朝——\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝说道：槐阳王的事，他一定先说。凭这些，压不住他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"（关北踏平了工地：揭发要原令加三样人证物证——乔阴陈显祖的证词、卫沧澜、小屋里那人身上的密信、逆灵宫的账册。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"（陈显祖带着箱子走了——他的证词，这回算不上。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝说道：凭这些，朝上压不住他。……再找一样来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.expose act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"（揭发要原令加两样人证物证——乔阴陈显祖的证词、卫沧澜、小屋里那人身上的密信、逆灵宫的账册。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle name
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "皇叔的通缉"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.verb
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "先解"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.ask
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "先不动庾子建，请皇帝亲笔下手诏，撤了皇叔的通缉、召他回朝。庾子建会留在朝上——可有了皇叔，他就不是一个人说了算。要这样吗？"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.choice
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "先解通缉"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝咬着嘴唇想了一会儿，提起笔。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝说道：朕不敢当着他的面……可这一件，朕自己能做。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"他写得很慢，一笔一划。写完，取出一方小印盖上，吹了吹墨，递给你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid ""
"皇帝说道：东二门的布告，今天就撤。皇叔在水烟阁——你替朕送去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. city.midao1.stone lines
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "你在密室里转了一圈。除了那张破床和乾草，什么也没有。"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.yangxin_gate.shut lines
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "养心门关着，门闩在里头。门缝里透出一点灯光。"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.yangxin_gate.window_shut lines
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "养心殿的西墙上一排窗，窗纸后面透着灯光。窗都关得死死的——不知道哪一扇是坏的。"
msgstr ""

#. imperial.front_hall.study lines
#: data/imperial/world.json
msgid "御书房的门锁着，钥匙在皇上身上。"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/wind_bell name
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid "青铜风铃"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/wind_bell long
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid ""
"一只青铜小铃，比拇指大不了多少，铃身长满了绿锈，只有铃舌是亮的。铃舌上刻着一个小小的「尘」字。挂绳是一截褪成粉橘色的红绳，打着一个孩子才打得出的死结。\n"
"在寻风地带里，它会跟着风响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/wind_bell no_drop
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid "这只风铃不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/diviner_slip name
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid "卜风签"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/diviner_slip long
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid ""
"一支黑竹签，上面用朱砂密密地写着小字，是卜风的记录：\n"
"「顺风而行，一日，见坛。」\n"
"「顺风而行，二日，又见坛。」\n"
"「顺风而行，三日，又见此坛。」\n"
"最后一行字歪了：「风欺人。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/xuanmang long
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid ""
"一把三尺长的剑，剑身是白的，白得发亮，转一转，就有一道光从剑身上绕下来，像风打着旋。剑柄上缠着褪成粉橘色的红绳。剑脊上刻着两个字：寒於。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/xuanmang no_drop
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid "旋芒不能丢。它在风里转了三百年。"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/xuanmang act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/items.json
msgid ""
"你把剑举到光里。剑脊上两个字：寒於。字下面一行小字，刻得很浅：「风止之处，城见；剑止之处，人见。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner name
#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head name
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，蹲在黑石坛边烧符，符烧完了就看灰往哪边飞，然后在一支竹签上写一笔。他的嘴唇冻得发紫，眼睛红着，像是很多天没睡。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner vanishes.line
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士一声不响地散成一股黑烟，被风卷着往西去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner inquiry.岚城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士冷笑：宫主算过，剑就在风那头。跟着风走就是了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner inquiry topic
#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner inquiry.风
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士道：风往哪边吹，剑就在哪边。……三天了。三天了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner chat_msg_combat
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卜风道士尖声道：剑是宫主的！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner chat_msg_combat
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卜风道士朝坛上喊：有人来抢剑了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦高的黑衣道士，黑冠上缀着一圈铜钱，坐在坛顶，手里攥着一支写满了字的竹签，一动不动地盯着坛上的灰。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head vanishes.line
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士散成一股黑烟，那支竹签落在坛脚的符灰里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head inquiry.岚城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士头也不抬：顺风走。宫主说顺风走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head inquiry.风
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "卜风道士攥紧了竹签：风欺人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_wind_diviner_head chat_msg_combat
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卜风道士冷冷地道：又一个寻剑的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng name
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace name
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白发白须的老人，坐在十铃架下的蒲团上，衣裳是白的，袖口被门口的风吹得一直在动，他的人却一动不动。看不出他有多大年纪——脸上没有几道皱纹，眼睛却老得很。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng calls.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你一进门，十铃架上的大铃有几口自己响了起来，一声接一声，不是风吹的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng calls.steps.emote
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "睁开眼睛，看了看铃，又看了看你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng calls.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "响的那几口，是有人信你的地方。暗的那几口，你自己知道为什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng calls.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "你是来要剑的。剑在云台。我不卖，也不赏，也不问你拿去做什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "旋芒是寒於氏的剑。寒於氏斩了那东西的头，死前把两把剑分开放——一把钉头，一把寄在风里。三百年前你们拔了钉头的那一把。这一把，在我这里，等人来拔。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "寒於"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.寒於
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "寒於氏是太阳神族的祖。他的血，一份在金乌那里，一份在於兰家——君违嫁过去的那一份。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "烟城"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.烟城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "烟城的人二十年前来过，你们先帝派的。他们站在门口问剑，问完就走了，走的时候风还没停——他们没伏下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.先帝.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "让我看看。……「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」你们先帝要的剑，是不扰民的剑。他要对了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.先帝.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "你们的先帝找了一辈子。他的人到过烟城，没到过这里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "铃"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.铃
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "十口铃，十个地方。哪里有人信你，哪里的铃就响。响的是信，不是功劳——你救过的人、你守过的话、你没拿的东西。走近了看，铃身上刻着地名。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "谁拔"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "你拔的。十口铃里有人信你——到了湖底，别让它们暗下去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "於兰家的人拔的。三百年前他们拔错了一把，这一回，看他拔得对不对。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "萧家的孩子拔的。他回来了一回，又走了。风记得他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "剑在云台，自己转着。谁能拔，不是我说了算。响够六口铃，你自己可以试；不够，就请一个信得过的人来——风会替你去叫。西墙那道梯子上去，就是云台。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.岚城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚城不在哪里。风在哪里停，它就在哪里。你们叫它寻风而至，寻风而逝——说得不错。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.荐信.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风停处，替我再看一眼。——他让你看的，你看过了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.emote
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "接过信，只看了末一行，嘴角动了一下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "这是风纹，岚城的字。写的是：「风停处，替我再看一眼。」"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "那个砍柴的。他在城里住了三天，走的时候问我要了这几个字，说出去以后怕忘了。——他没忘。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.荐信.rules.lines.emote
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "把信还给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.萧辟尘.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "萧家的孩子。那年风大，把他卷出城去了。铃在你手里——那他就还回得来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.萧辟尘.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "萧家的孩子，二十年前被风卷走了。铃丢了，风就找不到他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng inquiry.樵夫
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "那个砍柴的？他伏在石头上睡着了，醒来就看见城。他在城里住了三天，吃不惯——我们这里没有饭。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child name
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚童"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个八九岁的小姑娘，白衣裳，头发被风吹得乱蓬蓬的，脖子上挂着一只小铜铃。她蹲在门洞边上，看你看得很认真。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child calls.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "你是谁的铃带来的？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry.铃.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "给我看看！……是尘哥哥的！铃舌上那个字，铃匠爷爷刻的，我认得！尘哥哥回来了吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry.铃.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "城里人人一只铃。铃丢了，风就不认得你了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "城"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry.城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "城今天在山上头。昨天在湖上头。明天不知道。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry.风
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风是从城里出去的呀。你们外头的人老往风里走，走着走着就到了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "尘哥哥"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_child inquiry.尘哥哥
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "尘哥哥是萧家的。他放风筝，风大，连人带风筝一起飞走了。我没见过他——我是听铃匠爷爷说的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith name
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "老蔺"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith title
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "铃匠"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦小的老人，系着一条皮围裙，手指上全是铜绿，正拿一把细锉一点一点修一只铃的口。他修一下，敲一下，侧着耳朵听一听。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.铃.rules.lines.emote
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "放下锉，接过你那只铃，凑到眼前看了半天，手有点抖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.铃.rules.lines.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "是我打的。「尘」字是我刻的，那孩子非要刻在铃舌上，说这样风一吹，就是在叫他的名字。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.铃.rules.lines.emote
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "拿衣角把铃擦了擦，又还给你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.铃.rules.lines.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "带着吧。它认得路。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.铃.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "城里的铃都是我打的。一个孩子一只，打好了挂在门楣的钩上，孩子长到能自己拿了，就拿下来随身带着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "萧家"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.萧家
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "萧家就在街那头，第二道弯。那孩子四岁那年，风大，他在院子里放风筝，连人带风筝都卷走了，铃也跟着走了。他娘天天擦那只空钩，擦了二十年，前年也走了。钩子还是亮的——现在是我去擦。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.旋芒
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁守着的。不是我们的东西，是寒於氏寄在这里的。我们只是住在它旁边。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_bellsmith inquiry.岚城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "我们不吃饭，不生火，不种地。风来了就听，风走了就睡。你们外头的人觉得这样过日子没意思——我们觉得你们太吵。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper name
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "扫云的老妪"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白发的老婆婆，拿着一把竹扫帚，在街边扫——扫的不是落叶，是飘上来的雾，她一扫，雾就退下去一点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry.城.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "今天城停在西边，底下是天驼关的石头，黄的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry.城.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "今天城停在北边，底下是一片湖，绿的，湖上有船。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry.城.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "今天城停在东边，底下是雪，白茫茫的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry.城.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "城今天停在哪儿？你自己往门外看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "雾"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry.雾
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "雾往上爬，爬到街上就不好走了。我扫一扫，它就回去。扫了七十年了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_sweeper inquiry.烟城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "烟城？那是我们的亲戚。烟霞霓岚，四座城，各住各的。烟城的人爱说话，我们不爱。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident name
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚城人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿白衣的人，在街上慢慢地走，走几步停一下，侧着头听风铃。他看见你，点一点头，没有说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry.岚城
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "……这里就是。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry.风
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "听。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry.旋芒
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "去问岚翁。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry topic
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "吃饭"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_resident inquiry.吃饭
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "吃饭？……我们不吃。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白发白须的老人站在台心旁边，袖子被旋风扯得笔直，人却一动不动，像是长在白石上的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "它在你腰间。寒於氏的剑，不扰民——你拿着它，就照它的脾气走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "跟於兰家的人走了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "跟萧家的孩子走了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.旋芒.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "就在风里。谁拔，你来定。你自己，於兰家的人，萧家的孩子——三个都行，风不挑，铃挑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风认你了。剑在台心，去拿吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "你。那就先接三刃。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.谁拔.rules.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "你自己拔，要十口铃里六口有人信你。请於兰家的人，要他在朝上，风才找得到他。让萧家的孩子来，要他的铃——铃在，风认人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.铃
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "楼下十口铃，响一口，是一处有人信你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.label
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "接风三刃"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace inquiry.接风三刃
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风里拔剑，先要风认你。我替风出三刃，你站得住，剑就落得下来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.confirm
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"岚翁替风出三刃，是真打：\n"
"· 每一刃都实打实地削在你身上，挨中了会受伤。\n"
"· 哪一刃接不住，就算没接下，你随后会昏倒；风只认人，不要人的命。\n"
"倒了可以歇好再来。\n"
"确定接风三刃吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.deed
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "在岚城的云台上接下了岚翁的接风三刃"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.blows.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁袖子一拂：第一刃，是从城外来的风。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.blows.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁点点头：第二刃，是从城里出去的风。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.blows.fail
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁叹了口气：风还不认得你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.blows.say
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁的袖子停了：第三刃，是不动的风。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.blows.fail
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "岚翁摇摇头：差一点。歇好了再来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lan_weng_terrace trials.success
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风停了一停。岚翁说道：站得住。风认你了——剑在台心，去拿吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_wind long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个须发灰白的老人，一身朝服被风吹得猎猎地响，腰间那把暗绿色的鬼头刀还在。他看着台心的风，像在看一件很久以前的事。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_wind summoned.arrive
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "一阵大风落在台上，於兰天武站在风里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_wind summoned.leave
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "一阵风卷过来，於兰天武不见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_home long
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白衣的年轻人，长发和巾带被风吹得乱飞，站在台上四下看，看得很慢，像在一样一样认东西。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_home summoned.arrive
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "风把萧辟尘送到了台上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_home summoned.leave
#: data/lancheng/npcs.json
msgid "一阵风卷过来，萧辟尘不见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/huanying long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一条往上斜的窄道，两壁是磨得发亮的黄石，亮得像镜子，人走过去，石头里也走过去一个人。道里一股迷香，甜得发腻，白雾贴着地面流，一直流到脚背上。\n"
"往下是镜子里那间三条道的屋子；往上，雾的那头透过来一点风。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/windgate long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"出了窄道，眼前一下子宽了：一片高处的野地，天很近，云很低。风从前头一阵一阵地扑过来，草齐腰，被风按得倒成一片，一起来，又倒下去。\n"
"往北是一片石林，一根一根灰白的石柱立在雾里，像许多人站着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/stone_field long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"石柱一根挨一根，高的有三四丈，都被风磨圆了，迎风的一面刻满一道一道的槽，背风的一面长着青苔。雾是一条一条的，跟着风在石柱之间流。\n"
"几条踩出来的小路在石林里分开，往北、西北、东北各有一处背风的石坳；西边下风头隐约有烟，东边有几顶破帐篷。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/diviner_altar long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"石林西边的下风头，一座黑石垒的小坛，坛上插着几面黑幡，烧剩的符纸一层一层压在坛脚，风一吹就飞起来几张，又落回去。地上画着一圈一圈的符，圈套着圈，都是往西开口的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/ministry_camp long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"三顶帐篷，两顶塌了，一顶的帆布被风撕成一条一条的，还在拍。一面兵部的旗倒在草里，旗杆断了。营里的锅是冷的，锅底结着一层黑；帐篷边上一堆石头垒的灶，灶里没有灰——这里很久没人生火了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/calm_west long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"西北一处背风的石坳，三面是石壁，口朝着石林。坳里的草比外头矮，一丛一丛的，石壁脚下堆着被风吹进来的枯叶。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/calm_north long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"正北一处深些的石坳，两道石壁夹着，像一只半合的手掌。坳底一块平石，石面上有几道浅浅的印子，像是有人在这里伏过很久。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/calm_east long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"东北一处背风的石坳，口子窄，里面宽。石壁上垂着几根干枯的藤，藤上不知谁系了一根褪了色的红绳。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/white_gate long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一道白石的门，门洞是圆的，被风磨得没有一个棱角。门外是雾，雾底下很远的地方，隐约是山——城就浮在那上头。\n"
"门里是一块小小的石坪，坪上的石板一块挨一块，中间被人走出一道浅浅的凹。往北，一条白石长街往上绕。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/white_street long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"白石铺的长街往上绕了两折。两边的屋子都是白石砌的，墙角磨圆了，背风的一面爬着青苔；家家的檐下都挂着风铃，铜的、竹的、贝壳的，风一过，一街都响。\n"
"屋子里静悄悄的，没有烟。没有一家的屋顶上有烟囱。\n"
"西边第一道弯下去是一个敞着的院子，叮叮当当的；东边第二道弯过去，一个小院子的门开着，里头没有声音。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/bellsmith long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一个敞着的院子，后头一间棚屋，棚檐下挂满了还没上绳的铃。院子当中一块铁砧，旁边一口铸了一半的铃立在木架上，铃身还是青的。墙边一排木架，架上是泥的铃模、钳子、细锉，一样一样摆得整齐。\n"
"地上一层铜屑，被风扫到墙角，堆成一道细细的绿线。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/xiao_house long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一个小院子，院里一口枯井，井沿上落着叶子。屋门关着，门楣上一只铜钩，钩上什么也没挂，钩子倒擦得很亮——像是一直有人在擦。\n"
"门框上有一道一道刻的印子，从下往上，最高的一道齐你的腰，旁边刻着一个小小的「尘」字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/street_top long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"长街到这里是一块平台，平台尽头一座三层的木阁，檐角一层一层翘上去，每一层的檐下都挂满了铃，风不大，铃也一直在响，一声叠一声，像在说话。\n"
"阁门开着。门楣上一块旧匾：风铃阁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/bell_hall long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"阁里很高，梁上垂下来千百只小铃，长长短短，一直垂到人头顶上。风从门口进来，它们就从门口那一头响起，一层一层响到里头去。\n"
"北墙下一排木架，架上并排挂着十口大铃，每一口的铃身上刻着一个地名。有的铃亮，有的铃是暗的。\n"
"东边一道小门，门帘半卷着。西墙边一道窄梯，一直通到阁顶，梯口有风灌下来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/quiet_room long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间小屋，四壁是木板，一张矮几，一个蒲团。墙边一架旧书，书页被风吹得发脆，有几本摊着，压着一块白石。\n"
"墙上一只铜钩，钩上空着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/deck long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"风铃阁顶上出去，是一片悬在云上的白石台。台子没有栏杆，四边就是云，云下面很远的地方，有山的影子在慢慢往后退——城在走。\n"
"白石被风磨得发亮，石缝里长着一点青苔。北边是台心，白石上一圈一圈的印子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/whirl long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"台子的北边，白石面上被风磨出一圈浅浅的印子，一圈套一圈，像水里的波纹。岚城的人说，这是风在这里转了三百年转出来的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:lancheng/cloud_edge long
#: data/lancheng/rooms.json
msgid ""
"台子的东边，白石到这里就断了，往外一步就是云。云在脚下翻，风从下面往上托，托得人站不稳。\n"
"岚城的人说，剑有了主，风就会送人回去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. canyon.fantasy1.up.closed lines
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "上头一股迷香，甜得发腻，雾浓得伸手不见五指。你走了两步，脚下一空似的，又转回了原处。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_bones name
#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_goathill name
#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_latemoon name
#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_court name
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "雾里的人影"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_bones long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"雾里站着一个人影。走近了，只是磨亮的黄石上映出来的你自己，跟着你停，跟着你走。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_bones looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"雾里站着一个人影，背上一把剑，身形很瘦，穿的是二十年前水烟阁随从的衣裳——你埋过他的骨头。他朝你点了一下头，雾一卷，就没有了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_goathill long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"又一个人影，背对着你，看不清是谁。你一伸手，雾就从指缝里流过去了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_goathill looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"霍铮蹲在雾里，嘴里叼着一根草：「寨子里都好。石头那小子回家了。」他吐掉草，站起来，散了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_goathill looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"黄霸坐在雾里一块石头上，腆着肚子：「三寨主？如今是寨主了。」他咧嘴一笑，连人带石头一起散了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_latemoon long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"雾里一个女人的影子，长发，看不清脸，一晃就不见了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_latemoon looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"安妮儿站在雾里，怀里抱着一件发着寒气的衣裳：「它在我这里。等你用得着的时候。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_latemoon looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦站在雾里，手里握着鞭子，三十七岁的脸，几百年的眼睛：「我还守着。去吧。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_latemoon looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"雾里是瑷伦的背影。她没有回头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_court long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"最后一个人影离出口最近，风吹过来，它就淡一分。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_court looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"冯策披着衣服站在雾里，跟那夜在侍卫营一样：「湖底的事，算老夫一个。先把剑找来。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_court looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武穿着朝服站在雾里，朝服不合身：「找到城，叫我。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.huanying.landmark.shade_court looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"庾子建站在雾里，身边一只火盆，盆里一撮纸灰：「先帝推了二十年。你要是找到了，记得告诉我。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.ministry_camp.landmark.scout name
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "冻僵的探子"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.ministry_camp.landmark.scout long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一个穿兵部号衣的人蜷在塌了的帐篷边，早就冻僵了，脸朝着北边的石坳。他怀里揣着半张纸，字被露水泡开了，还认得出几行：\n"
"「第三次。逆风行至石坳，风止。四顾无城。复行。」\n"
"「风又起。」\n"
"纸的背面是兵部的印，印色暗红发黑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.ministry_camp.landmark.flag name
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "兵部旗"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.ministry_camp.landmark.flag long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一面兵部的旗倒在草里，旗杆从中间断了，断口是新的白茬——是风折的，不是人砍的。旗面上的「兵」字被风扯得只剩半边。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.diviner_altar.landmark.altar long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"黑石垒的坛，一人多高，坛顶压着一块铜盘，盘里的灰被风吹得只剩一层。坛脚的地上画着一圈套一圈的符，每一圈都朝西开口——画符的人一直是顺着风画的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.white_gate.landmark.gate long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"门洞是一整块白石凿出来的，圆的，里外都被风磨亮了。往外看是雾，雾底下很远的地方有山。门洞的顶上刻着两个字，被风磨得快平了，摸得出来：寻风。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.xiao_house.landmark.hook name
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "门楣上的铜钩"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.xiao_house.landmark.hook long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一只铜钩，钩尖朝上，擦得很亮。岚城家家门口都有一只，挂的是孩子的铃；这一只空了二十年。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.xiao_house.landmark.hook looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一只铜钩，钩尖朝上，擦得很亮。钩上挂着一只青铜小铃，绳结是孩子打的死结，风一过就响。萧家的铃回来了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.xiao_house.landmark.hook looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一只铜钩，钩尖朝上，擦得很亮。你怀里那只铃的绳结，和钩子上磨出来的那道印子，一样宽。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.bell_hall.landmark.bell_snow name
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "雪亭的铃"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.bell_hall.landmark.bell_snow long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"雪亭的铃。铃身发暗，刻着「雪亭」两个字，一声不响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.bell_hall.landmark.bell_snow looks.long
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"雪亭的铃。它在响——不是风吹的，风停了它也在响。铃身上的字是亮的：雪亭。\n"
"岚城的铃认人：雪亭有人信你。\n"
msgstr ""

