msgstr ""

#. lancheng.calm_west.lie_down act.acts.ask
#. lancheng.calm_north.lie_down act.acts.ask
#. lancheng.calm_east.lie_down act.acts.ask
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "伏下身子，等风过去？"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.calm_west.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_north.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_east.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你伏在背风的石头上。风从头顶上过去，一阵，又一阵，越过越远。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.calm_west.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_north.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_east.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"四下里静下来。然后是铃声——不是一只，是许许多多只，满耳都是，近得像就挂在你头顶上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.calm_west.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_north.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_east.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你抬起头。雾散了。一座白石的城浮在石坳外头的半空里，城门开着，城墙上挂满了风铃，一条白石长街从城门里往上绕，绕进云里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.calm_west.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_north.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_east.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你站起来往前走了一步。脚下没有空——是一级白石的台阶，台阶上去，就是城门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.calm_west.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_north.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.calm_east.lie_down act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你伏在地上等了好一会儿。风还在吹，草还在倒——这里不是风停的地方。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.white_gate.out act.acts.ask
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "出白石门？城会随风走，下回再来，得重新寻风。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.white_gate.out act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你穿过白石门。脚下一空，又不空——风托着你，雾从两边合拢过来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.white_gate.out act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"等你站稳，人已经在背风的石坳里了。回头看，只有雾。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.white_gate.out act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你穿过白石门。风托着你，雾合拢了。等你站稳，人在风口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.verb
#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.choice
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "自己拔"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"剑已经有人了。台心的风停着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"风太大，你走不近。守剑的人在楼下风铃阁里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你走进旋风。风刃从四面八方削过来，削到身上，却不再伤人——它认得你了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你伸手。剑柄落进掌心，凉的，又是暖的。风一下子散了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "看着台心的风散尽，点了点头。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "十口铃里有人信你，剑就认你。拿去吧——不扰民的剑，你们先帝要对了。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "云边有风，会送你回去。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"岚翁说道：先接三刃。风认了你，剑才落得下来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.ask
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"自己拔旋芒？十铃架上信你的铃够了。\n"
"拔了，终章是你持剑；不拔，旋芒归皇叔或萧辟尘，湖畔和冰龙厅那两仗他会跟你并肩打。先要接岚翁的「接风三刃」——三下风刃是真的，接不住会受伤、会昏倒，歇好了可以再来。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "好。剑在风里，风先要认你。我替风出三刃。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你走近旋风，风把你推了回来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（十铃架上响了五口铃，还差一口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（十铃架上响了四口铃，还差两口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（十铃架上响了三口铃，还差三口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（十铃架上响了两口铃，还差四口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（十铃架上响了一口铃，还差五口：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.self act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（十铃架上一口铃也没响：自己拔，要六处以上有人信你。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.verb
#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.choice
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "请皇叔"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.ask
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"请皇叔来拔？\n"
"京师那口铃一响，风就去京城把於兰天武找来。剑跟他走，终章他持剑，你在旁边。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"岚翁伸手往楼下一指。底下风铃阁里，京师那口大铃自己响了一声，又一声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一阵大风从云里落下来，落在台上，风里站着一个人，朝服被吹得猎猎地响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "四下看了一眼，目光落在台心的风上，看了很久。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "三百年前，於兰家拔错了一把剑。这一把，我来。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武走进旋风。风刃削过他的朝服，他一步也没停。他伸手，剑落进他手里，风散了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "昭儿还在殿上等我。剑我带回去——决战那日，你来叫我。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"又一阵风卷过来，於兰天武不见了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"岚翁说道：京师那口铃还没响到他身上。手诏送到了，他回了朝，风才找得到他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"岚翁说道：於兰家的人？他还在通缉里，躲在水烟阁，朝廷的事他不碰。风找不到不肯来的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.uncle act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（请皇叔拔：只有第九章请皇上先撤了他的通缉、把手诏送到他手里的那一边，他才在朝上。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.verb
#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.choice
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "让萧辟尘拔"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.ask
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"让萧辟尘来拔？\n"
"岚翁会把他的风铃挂回萧家的钩上，风认得铃上的名字，会把他送回来。剑跟他走：他会拿着它去决战，那一战，他可能回不来。铃也就还给他了。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"岚翁接过风铃，拇指在铃舌的「尘」字上摸了一下，朝着白石街的方向摇了摇。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"底下长街上，萧家门楣那只空钩叮的一声。风从街上一路卷上来，卷到台上，风里站着一个人，白衣，长发，被风吹得乱飞。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.emote
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "四下看，看了很久。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "……城还是这个样子。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "铃在，风认人。你替我把铃带回来了。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"萧辟尘走进旋风。风绕着他转，转得慢了，像是认得他。剑落进他手里，风散了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.say
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "我回水烟阁。决战那日，剑跟我下湖。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"又一阵风卷过来，萧辟尘不见了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"岚翁说道：风认铃，不认人。萧家孩子的铃不在你身上，风就找不到他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.whirl.xiao act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"（让萧辟尘拔：要带着他的青铜风铃——在老松岭石洞的石匣里，对着寻风地带的风才开。）\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.cloud_edge.ride act.verb
#. lancheng.cloud_edge.ride act.acts.choice
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "乘风"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.cloud_edge.ride act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你往云边走了一步，风把你托了回来。剑还没有主，风不送人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.cloud_edge.ride act.acts.ask
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid "乘风回去？风会把你放在天驼关石林那面镜子前。岚城随风走，下回再来，得重新寻风。"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.cloud_edge.ride act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"你往云里迈了一步。风从底下托住你，像一只手。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.cloud_edge.ride act.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"云从身边飞快地往上退，铃声越来越远。等你站稳，眼前是石林，那面镜子里映着你自己。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.wilds.wind gale.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"一阵狂风迎面压过来，压得你喘不过气。你运起内力顶住了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. lancheng.wilds.wind gale.acts.steps.line
#: data/lancheng/world.json
msgid ""
"狂风刮得你站不住脚，一跤摔在草里！风大不能行。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.1 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（初阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.1 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具硬木削成的练功木人，手臂和腰身装著机括，一碰便会还手。胸前贴著一张褪色的红纸，写著「初阶」两个字，是武馆给初学的弟子拆招用的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.1 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.2 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.3 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.4 accept_fight.emote
#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.5 accept_fight.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "身上的机括「咔嗒」一响，摆好了架势。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.2 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（二阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.2 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具硬木削成的练功木人，手臂和腰身装著机括，一碰便会还手。胸前的红纸写著「二阶」，木头上满是拳脚留下的印子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.3 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（三阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.3 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具铁木削成的练功木人，机括比旁边几具紧得多，还手又快又沉。胸前的红纸写著「三阶」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.4 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（四阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.4 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这是一具铁木削成的练功木人，关节处包著铜皮，听说是柳馆主亲手调过机括的。胸前的红纸写著「四阶」。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.5 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "木人（五阶）"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wooden_dummy.5 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"这具木人通体乌黑，是一整块铁木雕成的，机括藏在里头看不见。胸前的红纸写著「五阶」，武馆里能把它打得摇晃的人没有几个。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.1 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "流窜毛贼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.1 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个贼眉鼠眼的毛贼，衣衫上补丁叠著补丁，腰间却鼓鼓囊囊的，不知又从谁家摸来了什么。雪亭驿的告示上正画著他的像。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.2 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "剪径贼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.2 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个满脸横肉的汉子，专在山路上拦人剪径，不知劫过多少过往的客商。雪亭驿的告示上正画著他的像。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.3 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "采花贼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.3 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个油头粉面的年轻人，手里摇著一柄折扇，眼神却阴鸷得很。官府悬赏捉拿他已有好些日子了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.4 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "江洋大盗"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.4 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个虬髯大汉，身上带著好几处刀疤，据说在江北做过好几票大买卖，官府悬了重赏要他的人头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.5 name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "杀人魔头"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.outlaw.5 long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个面色青白的中年人，目光扫过来便叫人背脊发凉。告示上说他一夜之间屠了邻县一户人家，官府悬了最重的赏。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "玉螺湖那一夜烧了半个村子——是你拔的剑。……拔了就往前走，别回头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你在湖底没动那把剑。老夫活了五十八年，见过的人十个有九个会动。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个鬓发斑白的老者，一身素白的武官袍服，腰背挺得笔直，坐在广场中间的木凳上不动如山。四面探头探脑的武林人没有一个敢靠得太近。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry topic
#. native.npc.song_pu inquiry topic
#. native.npc.white_officer inquiry topic
#. native.npc.courier inquiry topic
#. native.npc.onlooker inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "寻剑"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.寻剑.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "奉旨寻剑。先帝没寻到的那一把，皇上要寻到。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.寻剑.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大声点，让众位兄弟都听见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.寻剑.rules.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "信使一怔，随即大声说道：「方位是在西南二十四里，黄石隘口。」"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.黄石隘口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "那不是你该去的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.旋芒
#. native.npc.white_officer inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "奉旨办差，闲人少问。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "湖底的事，算老夫一个。大内侍卫营还有三十个能打的——你开口，他们跟老夫走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "湖底？老夫守的是宫门，不是湖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.刀谱.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刀谱给过你了。练到四十，剩下的在刀上，不在谱上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.刀谱.rules.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "从值房的抽屉里摸出一册蓝布面的小本子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.刀谱.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "侍卫营的刀，叫禁中刀。七招，招招在宫门里头——拿去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.刀谱.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "下湖之前，你学两招侍卫营的刀。七招，招招在宫门里头——拿去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce inquiry.刀谱.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "侍卫营的刀谱，不外传。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个瘦削的老者，白袍，坐在冯策身侧半步之后，眼睛半开半合，手里捏着一串核桃慢慢地转。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老夫只是陪冯总教头走一趟。寻剑的事，问他去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.song_pu inquiry.黄石隘口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "方位信使已经报过了，还问老夫？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.white_officer long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个身著白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑，站得笔直，目不斜视。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "信使"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个风尘满面的信使，白袍下摆沾著泥点，刚从马上跳下来，气还没喘匀。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "下官只管传话。方位将军叫我当众报了，你也听见了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier inquiry topic
#. native.npc.bai_daozhang name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "白道长"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.courier inquiry.白道长
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "白道长命下官回禀，说时辰已到。道长自己在何处，下官不敢说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "江湖客"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个风尘仆仆的江湖人，背著个长条布包，缩在广场边上探头探脑地往官队那边张望。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker inquiry.黄石隘口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "小兄弟也听见了？西南二十四里，黄石隘口。大内的人要去那儿找一把剑，咱们这些人……也想去瞧瞧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.onlooker inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "听说是奉了皇上的旨，去岚城找什麽旋芒宝剑。岚城？谁知道在哪儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "太乙观观主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个须眉皆白的老道士，道袍洗得发灰，一柄拂尘搭在臂弯上。他站在山壁下新挖开的土坑边，眼睛一直盯着坑里，官兵们挖一锹，他的眉头就皱一分。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.石匣
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "那不是什么宝剑，是岚城的风铃。寻风的人才用得上，旁人开了，只会招祸。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.风铃
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前一阵怪风过隘口，风停的地方落下这只铃。先帝寻岚城的人把它收了，拿来问老道；老道不敢留，也不敢让他们带进京——寻风的东西，就封进石匣，埋回风停的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.黑衣道士
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠黑衣，一身邪气，这一带没有这样的道观。他往老松岭去了——拾起他掉的那块布条看看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.寻剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯总教头奉旨寻的是旋芒宝剑。皇上要寻岚城，满朝只有老道知道岚城的东西埋在哪儿——老道不说，他们挖遍西南也要挖；说了，老道还能在旁边看着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.老松寨
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老松岭上的匪寨。那道士慌忙间掉了块布条，上头刻的就是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "布条"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.布条.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "就是你手里那块。上头那个记号——一棵松、三道横——是老松寨的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.布条.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "那道士掉的，就落在土坑边上。拾起来看看——上头是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.布条.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "给了你了。上头那个记号，是老松寨的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.布条.rules.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "从袖子里取出一块粗麻布条。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.布条.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "方才一个黑衣黑冠的道士从崖上掠下来，抢了石匣就走，慌忙间掉了这个。老道替你拾起来了——上头刻的是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang inquiry.布条.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "什么布条？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "一名白衣武官从山壁下的土坑里捧出一只尺许长的石匣，匣面刻着一圈风纹。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "总教头，挖出来了！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "打开。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯总教头，匣子开不得。这是岚城的风铃，寻风的人才用得上，旁人开了，只会招祸。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "崖上忽然一道黑影掠下，一个黑衣黑冠的道士落在土坑边，一把抢过石匣，转身便往山壁上纵去！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "多谢诸位代劳！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣道士衣角一扯，一块布条飘落在地。他几个起落，已经翻上山壁，往北面的老松岭去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "追！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "回过头来，目光落在你身上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "这不是你该来的地方。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.bai_daozhang calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "小友，那道士往老松岭去了。官军追的是人——那种人翻山比猴子快，他们追不上。他慌忙间掉的那块布条倒会说话：你拾起来看看，那上头是老松寨的记号。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist_pass long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，瘦得颧骨突出，眼神鬼鬼祟祟的。他怀里紧紧抱着一只石匣。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist_pass inquiry.石匣
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "滚开！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，瘦得颧骨突出，眼神鬼鬼祟祟的。他蹲在那具骸骨旁边，石匣摆在脚边，正掰下一根指骨往匣口的缝里捅，捅一下，骂一声。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist greeting.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你也是来寻风铃的？晚了！这骨头开不了匣子，你的骨头说不定行。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑衣道士尖声道：宫里的人很快就到，你跑不了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑衣道士一边招架一边往洞口瞟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.black_taoist spared.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑衣道士捂着伤口翻身爬起，连滚带爬地逃出了山洞，往北边去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的道士，袖子挽到肘上，手里攥着一根粗麻绳，绳子的另一头没进北边山壁的裂口里。他盯着车上的箱子，不看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist greeting.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "此处无路，施主请回。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry.纳供
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "道士头也不抬：野羊寨的供，与你何干。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "道士拉绳的手停了一停：施主听谁说的这个名字？……回去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist inquiry.裂口
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "道士冷冷道：上头没有路，有也不是给你走的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"押车道士厉声道：野羊寨的供都敢劫，不要命了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.tribute_taoist chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"押车道士往裂口上头喊了一声，上面没有人应。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "野羊山二寨主"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄脱了门房的青布衫，换回了一身短打，单刀挂在腰上。他靠着土地庙的柱子，像是回到了自己的地方——只是看人的眼神还带着当门房时的那股子躲闪。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄擦着单刀，没有抬头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"刘安禄朝里屋喊了一声：大哥，酒来了！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "回寨"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.回寨
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄道：大哥回来了，老子还在雪亭镇看什么门。淳风武馆的门房，让他们另找人吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.霍铮
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄道：大哥在里屋。他说你横着走，那就横着走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.逆灵宫
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄啐了一口：那群牛鼻子的账，野羊寨记着。等大哥养好了身子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "血手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.血手
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄沉默了一会儿：血手刘三是老子。老子认。你放过我一回，野羊寨欠你两条命。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_anlu_home inquiry.黄霸
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "刘安禄压低声音：老三纳供的事，大哥没追究。老子也不说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "东方神教杀手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙着面，眉眼看起来有些面熟——书房里那个老妇人的眉眼。衣襟上有血，不是她的。她站在前厅正中，像在等人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙面杀手说：衣不在了，这庄还守什么？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.cult_killer moods.seen.chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"蒙面杀手看着你，没再出手。面巾下的眼睛和书房里那个老妇人一样。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "庾家管事"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个穿酱色便衣的中年人，腰里的刀用布裹着，手搭在上头。他不像是来喝酒的——眼睛在街上扫，扫到陈显祖就停了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事的手在刀柄的布上摩挲了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事喝道：拿下！人要活的！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事说道：兵部有令，拦的人一并拿！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "从酒楼对面的屋檐下走出来，拦在街心。身后三个便衣的汉子散开，手都按着刀柄。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "陈显祖，兵部有令拿你。箱子留下，人跟我们走。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "站住了，手慢慢按到剑柄上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年了，还是找来了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "动手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"三个汉子抽刀围了上来——冲的是你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_steward moods.fighting.chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家管事的刀出了布。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.inn_raider long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个身著白衣的朝廷武官，腰悬长剑。他把客栈的桌子一张张掀开，靴子踩在碎碗上，手里攥着一张海捕文书，上头画的人像你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.inn_raider greeting.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "就是你！海捕文书上画的人——逆灵宫的同党，拿下！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.inn_raider chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白衣武官喝道：兵部的文书在此，你还敢动手？\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.inn_raider chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"白衣武官一脚踢翻了长凳。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "庾家打手"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个便衣的壮汉，刀已经出了鞘。酱色的短衣，和管事一个颜色。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家打手喝道：让开！我们拿的是逃兵，不是你！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_henchman chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾家打手的刀横着扫过来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一位相貌威武的武官，坐在内厅的茶桌旁，鬓角白了。他不再发呆了——二十年压在身上的东西，在堂上说出来之后，人反倒直了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"陈显祖端起茶，手不抖了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"陈显祖说道：二十三个名字，我一个一个念过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "在下陈显祖。如今是乔阴县衙的人证——总算是个名目。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.供词
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我说了：原令只一句，「寻剑，不得扰民一户」。征民夫、拿人的，不是先帝的令。程大人都录下了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.寻剑令
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前念给全队听的那一卷，我抄了一份，藏到今天。该念给公堂听了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.槐阳王
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "程大人的叔父。听说老王爷拒过兵部的令——有人肯拒，我这份供词就不算白说。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.chen_witness inquiry.箱子
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "箱子还给我了，书也给了你。里头最要紧的东西，如今在程大人的卷宗里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong name
#. native.npc.lihong_weak name
#. native.npc.lihong_ashore name
#. native.npc.lihong_finale name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "璃虹"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong title
#. native.npc.lihong_weak title
#. native.npc.lihong_ashore title
#. native.npc.lihong_finale title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "金乌"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冰柱里站着一个女人，看着二十来岁，眼睛是睁着的。她一身浅金的衣，衣角在冰里像还在飘。她身上发着白光，光照在冰上，冰就不化。她的嘴唇没有动，声音却从冰里传出来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_weak inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "封法"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.封法.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "钉拔，它成形，先回这附近的村子。要灭它，三器齐：穿灵、旋芒、宝衣。要再封，须有人留下。——铜上刻了三句，我补了三句，都是实话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.封法.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "先把铜上的话念给我听。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.穿灵.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "它在你手里了。三百年钉着一颗头，钉的是它的名，不是肉——到了灭它那一天，还得是它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.穿灵.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "寒於的剑。三百年前我哥哥借了它来钉这颗头——剑是皇叔的，皇叔是人，人活不过三百年，剑能。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "杞庸"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.杞庸.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我哥哥。金乌的长子。它捉了我，他追到这里，钉了它——然后他走了。金乌不能留在地上，留下来的只能是我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#. native.npc.wutian_gui name
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing name
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown name
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "侮天鬼"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.侮天鬼.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "它没有头的时候，是一团焰。有了头，就有了名，有了名，就能把人当柴烧。这颗头在冰里睡了三百年，它在底下长了三百年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.商玦.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "他要的是鬼成形。成了形的鬼才找得到头，找到了头，他才能把它养成他的。他不骗你，他只是不说完。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.商玦.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "逆灵宫的人。他来过，站在潭口上面，看了很久，没下来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_weak inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "三百年"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.三百年.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "三百年。冰里不冷，也不饿，就是长。头在长，我在等。第一个带着铜来的，是你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry topic
#. native.npc.elon_altar inquiry topic
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar inquiry topic
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar inquiry topic
#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_altar inquiry topic
#. native.npc.annie_altar inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "留下"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.留下.rules.marks_asker
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.留下.rules.marks_asker
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "璃虹说了或者是你"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.留下.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "把我的羽还给我——光回来一点，够再守三百年。穿灵交给我，我钉回去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.留下.rules.lines.say
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.留下.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……或者是你。你也可以。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.留下.rules.lines.say
#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我没有光了。没有那片羽，我留不住。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "再封，须有人留下。留下的人，就是下一块冰。我的光不多了——那片羽在你手里，到时候还给我，我还能再守一回。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "再封，须有人留下。留下的人，就是下一块冰。我哥哥没有留，我留了；这一回要是再封，不会是我——我已经没有光了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry topic
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我留下"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.我留下.confirm
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.我留下.confirm
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你留下？你会成为下一块冰。\n"
"片尾以后回到主菜单；「决战前」存档还在。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.我留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.我留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "三器齐了。灭了它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.我留下.rules.marks_asker
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.我留下.rules.marks_asker
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你留在了冰里"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.我留下.rules.lines.say
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.我留下.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……好。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.我留下.rules.lines.line
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.我留下.rules.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"你握着穿灵走上封坛，一剑钉进那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，冷得不像冷，像很长很长的一觉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong inquiry.我留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.我留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……你在说什么。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.say
#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.say
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.say
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你已经留下了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.say
#. native.npc.elon_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.say
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.say
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "三器齐了。钉下去，用不着谁留下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.ask
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"把穿灵和那片羽交给璃虹？\n"
"她把剑钉回那颗头上，光回来，再守三百年——再封。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"那片羽在你怀里亮了一下，又暗了——光回到了冰柱里，一下子亮了起来。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "三百年。再三百年。去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"穿灵从你手里滑出去，钉回了那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，合拢了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong accept_object.say
#. native.npc.elon_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.say
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.say
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "先把它打倒。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冰柱里的光亮了一亮。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你带着铜来的。三百年了，第一个带着铜来的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我是璃虹，杞庸的妹妹。它捉了我，我哥哥钉了它——我就留在这里，照着这块冰。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你念过那片铜。念给我听。念对了，我再说下面的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_weak long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"璃虹靠着封坛坐在冰上，身上的光只剩一点，像快灭的灯。她的衣角湿了——三百年来第一次湿。她在喘。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_weak inquiry.封法.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "钉没了，它在长。要灭它，三器齐——穿灵在你手里了，还差旋芒和宝衣。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_weak inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "上岸"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_weak inquiry.上岸.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "带我上岸。我在冰里三百年，忘了岸上是什么样子。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_weak inquiry.三百年.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……别问。先上去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"商玦站在封坛对面，黑衣湿透了贴在身上，水顺着袖口往下滴。他没有看你，看着冰里那颗头，像看一件等了很久的东西。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "拔"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry.拔.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦看着冰里的头：拔了它。钉着，它是一颗头；拔了，它是一个东西——有形的东西才打得死。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry.拔.rules.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "抬起右手给你看：掌心一片焦黑，像握过烧红的铁。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry.拔.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我试过。寒於的剑认干净的手——修过逆灵天书的人碰它，就是这个样子。所以要你来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry.头.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦的声音没有起伏：五千年的头。你以为它封着就是安稳？它在长。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake inquiry.逆灵宫.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦没有回头：逆灵者，逆天地之灵而用之。你割了我的绳索，我下了崖，就到了这里——比你早一步。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"潭口的水面上一响。商玦湿淋淋地站在封坛对面——不是来打的，手垂着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "拔了它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你拿着剑，鬼醒了才找得到头；找到了头，才灭得了它。你以为它封着就是安稳？它在长。三百年，长了三百年。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_lake calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "他要的是鬼成形。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"璃虹躺在东房的榻上，盖着田老财家的一床旧被。她身上的光只剩一线，像灯芯上的最后一点火。她的眼睛是睁着的，看着房梁。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry.封法.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "钉没了，它在长。要灭它，三器齐——穿灵在你手里了，还差旋芒和宝衣。旋芒在岚城，宝衣在晚月庄。岚城寻风而至——你们的先帝找了它一辈子，他的档案在皇城。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "它在长"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry.它在长.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "每一夜。它回了村子，就不会再走远——它在等头。你走得越久，它长得越大。可你不走，三器也凑不齐。去吧。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry.鬼卒.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "它的卒子。湖里本来就有，封着的时候爬不上来。昨夜是第一夜，还会有第二夜。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "再封，须有人留下。我已经没有光了，这一回留下的不会是我。你到时候再想。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore inquiry.三百年.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……岸上的风是这样的。我忘了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "听见脚步声，眼睛转过来看着你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你来了。村子……我听见了。它回了家，先烧了一把。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_ashore calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "钉没了。它每一夜都在长。去京师，去岚城，把三器凑齐——别回头看我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"傅家坡的农妇，围裙没解，站在岸边的柳树底下，一手攥着衣角，眼睛一直盯着湖面。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry.湖.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "湖底那盏灯，这几夜一夜比一夜暗。村里人说，灯一灭，水怪就上来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry.湖.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "湖里那东西，这几夜一夜比一夜近。冰底下有东西在敲。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry.石头.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "在家里，门我闩上了。这一回我不让他出门。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry.石头.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……别问了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside inquiry.人.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "都是来等你的。我不认得他们，他们认得你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你回来了。湖底那盏灯，这几夜一夜比一夜暗。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你回来了。湖里那东西，这几夜一夜比一夜近。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"湖面平得像一块铁，结着一层黑冰。冰底下有光，一下一下地暗下去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "这几天岸上来了好些人。都说是来等你的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "野羊寨的弟兄都来了。村口那条黄土道，交给我们。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "王爷说：关北的骑兵欠你一阵。马在岸上，湖畔这一段，我们守。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "会首让我们来。卢卡说你会来。稻田那边，盾顶着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "大内侍卫营三十个人，老夫都带来了。湖底的事，算老夫一个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣在我身上。东方神教守了三百年——三器齐了，我们就不必再守。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前，老松岭有人替我挡了一刀。今天我来还。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "水烟阁来了。关了二十年的人，今天也出门了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "手里的旋芒转了一转，一道白光。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老夫说过会回来。剑在这儿。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我拿旋芒来了。回不来，就回不来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "剑交给朝廷。你一个江湖人，拿着它像什么话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宋朴说，剑在你身上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宋朴说，剑在皇叔手里。皇叔，朝廷的剑，该回朝廷。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宋朴说，剑在一个江湖人手里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"三器都在，来的人也够。今夜能灭它。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"三器不齐，或者守的人不够——这一回，只能再封。缺的是什么，任务页上记着。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.woman_lakeside calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "天一黑，它就上来。你什么时候下湖，我们就什么时候守。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"霍铮扛着一把开山刀站在岸边，肉养回来了一些，手腕上的铁链印子还在。身后野羊寨的弟兄蹲了一排。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.huo_zheng_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我在逆灵宫的地牢里见过那东西的影子。这一回，它别想上岸。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"郭承牵着马站在柳树边，皮甲上落了一层土。六骑在他身后一字排开，马不叫。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.guo_cheng_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "马不怕鬼。人怕。我们这几个，不怕。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个高鼻深目的异族汉子，左臂的圆盾擦得锃亮，短剑横在盾沿上。他看着湖，嘴里念着一句谁也听不懂的话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_swordsman_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "会首说，这是还人情。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冯策一身素白的武官袍，刀在腰上，站得笔直。三十个大内侍卫散在岸上，没有一个说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "湖底的事，算老夫一个。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.annie_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安妮儿披着寒於宝衣站在水边，衣角沾不上水。她看湖的样子，像看一个等了很久的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.annie_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "金乌的人等了三百年，等一个配得上三器的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"南危水站在岸上，焦殇剑背在身后。他看着湖面，二十年前的事像是又回来了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年。够了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"卫沧澜拄着一根竹杖站在岸边，背比在尚书府的时候直了一些。水烟阁的弟子围在他身边。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wei_canglan_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老夫在客房里关了二十年，出来第一件事，是来看这个湖。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武一身朝服，手里握着旋芒。剑身一转，一道白光从湖面上掠过去。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "三百年前於兰家拔错了一把剑。这一回，老夫看着它落下去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"萧辟尘背着旋芒站在岸边，风从湖上过来，他的衣角往城的方向飘。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "城里的人说，风会送我回去。先过了今夜。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦披着寒於宝衣站在岸边，衣角压着湖风，一动不动。鞭子还在腰上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我在这里。你下去的时候，我在你前头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_lake calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "看见你，点了点头。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_lake calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你叫了，我就来了。宝衣在我身上。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"庾子建骑着马停在岸边的柳树下，一身便服，身后跟着几个兵部的白衣武官。他不看湖，只看你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "剑在朝廷手里了。湖底的事，本官等着看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "皇叔的剑……本官不好硬要。可湖底的事办砸了，朝上总得有人说话。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "一个江湖人拿着天下的剑。你们好自为之。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.剑.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "剑交给朝廷。交给本官，天下就记得是朝廷带回了它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "不交"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.不交.confirm
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "不把剑交给庾子建？他会带着他的人回京城去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.不交.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "已经交了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.不交.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "好。湖底的事，本官等着看。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake inquiry.不交.rules.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "翻身上马，带着他的人往京城去了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake accept_object.ask
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"把旋芒交给庾子建？\n"
"交了，这一回三器不齐，只能再封；京城会记得是兵部尚书带回了剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "接过剑，掂了掂，交给身后的武官。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yu_zijian_lake accept_object.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "好。天下会记得是谁带回了它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"商玦站在冰龙厅的水潭边，黑衣上结了一层霜。他在等你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "站在水潭边，黑衣上结了一层霜。他看着你，像看一个来晚了的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "它找了五千年的头。你要在它找到的那一刻毁了它。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"六条白鳞冰龙同时抬起头。这一回它们没有盘回去——龙影扑下来，冰柱后面四个黑冠道士连黑烟都没来得及散，就被卷进了冰缝里。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"四个黑冠道士从冰柱后面走出来，围住了你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_waiting calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你们管这叫除魔。我管这叫还债。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"商玦拔出了剑。剑身是黑的，没有一点光。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting summoned.arrive
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦拔出了剑，一步一步走过来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting summoned.leave
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦走进了水潭。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting spared.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦撑着剑站起来，看了你一眼，一步一步走进了水潭：「我等下一个三百年。」"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting vanishes.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "商玦散成一股黑烟，从水潭上散了出去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"商玦说道：它不是妖魔。它是金乌欠下的债。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shang_jue_fighting chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"商玦的剑不带风，像念经。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_taoist_lake name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠道士"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_taoist_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个黑衣黑冠的逆灵宫道士，脸冻得发青，手里的剑结了霜。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_taoist_lake summoned.arrive
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "一个黑冠道士从冰柱后面走了出来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_taoist_lake summoned.leave
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠道士退进了冰缝里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.niling_taoist_lake vanishes.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑冠道士一声不响地散成一股黑烟。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_lakebottom long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冯策一身素白的武官袍，刀已经出了鞘，站在你身侧半步。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_lakebottom summoned.arrive
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯策从冰洞里跟了下来，拔刀站到你身边：「老夫来。」"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.feng_ce_lakebottom summoned.leave
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冯策收了刀，守在了水潭边。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lakebottom long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武站在你身边，旋芒横在身前，剑身上的风声压过了冰龙厅里的寒气。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lakebottom summoned.arrive
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武从冰缝里走出来，旋芒在他手里一转：三百年前於兰家拔错了一把剑——这一回，老夫替你挡着。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_lakebottom summoned.leave
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "於兰天武收了剑，退到水潭边。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lakebottom long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"萧辟尘站在你身边，旋芒背在身后，两只手空着，掌心朝外。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lakebottom summoned.arrive
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "萧辟尘背着旋芒从冰缝里走出来，站到你身边：风记得我。这一回，我先出手。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_lakebottom summoned.leave
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "萧辟尘收了手，退到水潭边。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wutian_gui long
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing long
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown long
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一团人形的黑焰，没有头。那颗头悬在它肩膀上方，眼睛睁着，还没有长上去。它不出声——它没有嘴。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wutian_gui summoned.arrive
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing summoned.arrive
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown summoned.arrive
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing summoned.arrive
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑焰从坛下涌上来，一团没有头的人形站了起来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wutian_gui summoned.leave
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing summoned.leave
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown summoned.leave
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing summoned.leave
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "黑焰退回了那颗头底下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wutian_gui vanishes.line
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing vanishes.line
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown vanishes.line
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing vanishes.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "侮天鬼散成一团黑焰，退回了那颗头底下。焰还在一下一下地跳。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wutian_gui chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"黑焰卷过来，冰「嗤」地化了一片。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.wutian_gui chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_blazing chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown chat_msg_combat
#. native.npc.wutian_gui_grown_blazing chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"那颗头在它肩上转过来，看着你。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"瑷伦披着寒於宝衣站在封坛边，衣角压着黑焰的风，一动不动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我留下了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "把穿灵给我。我把它钉回去，留在冰里——守衣守了几百年，换一样东西守。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.ask
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"把穿灵交给瑷伦？\n"
"她把剑钉回那颗头上，自己留在冰里——再封。她不会再回晚月庄。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "接过穿灵，走上封坛，一剑钉进那颗头里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "宝衣跟着我。下一个来的人，记得它在这里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_altar accept_object.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冰从坛心长起来，没过她的脚、她的腰、她的肩。她没有回头。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"南危水站在封坛边，焦殇剑出了鞘。二十年前的事，他好像终于等到了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "二十年前有人替我死了。这一回，我替他把账还上。把穿灵给我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.ask
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"把穿灵交给南危水？\n"
"他把剑钉回那颗头上，自己留在冰里——再封。水烟阁再也等不到他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "接过穿灵，掂了掂，笑了一下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "告诉颜违：五长老这回是真死了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_altar accept_object.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"他一剑钉进那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，没过了他。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"萧辟尘握着旋芒站在封坛边，风从潭口灌下来，他的衣角往城的方向飘。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我说过，回不来就回不来。把穿灵给我。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.ask
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"把穿灵交给萧辟尘？\n"
"他把剑钉回那颗头上，自己留在冰里——再封。旋芒跟着他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "接过穿灵，回头看了一眼潭口。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "城里的风要是问起我，就说我在这里。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_altar accept_object.lines.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"他一剑钉进那颗头里。冰从坛心长起来，没过了他，旋芒还在他手里转。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_altar long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武握着旋芒站在封坛边，朝服下摆被黑焰燎焦了一角。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.yulan_tianwu_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老夫的命是朝廷的。冰里，老夫留不得。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.annie_altar long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"安妮儿披着寒於宝衣站在封坛边，黑焰卷到她跟前就散了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.annie_altar inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "东方神教守的是封法，不是冰。留下的，得是跟它有账的人。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_finale long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"璃虹扶着冰壁站在潭口边，身上的光只剩一点。她跟着你下来了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.留下.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我没有光了，留不住。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.lihong_finale inquiry.留下.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "先下去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_ice title
#. native.npc.nan_weishui_ice title
#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_ice title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "守者"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.elon_ice long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冰柱里站着瑷伦，披着寒於宝衣，眼睛睁着。冰里的光是暖的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.nan_weishui_ice long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冰柱里站着南危水，手按在剑柄上，像还在等什么人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.xiao_pichen_ice long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冰柱里站着萧辟尘，旋芒在他手里，冰里有一点风的影子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"冯策站在广场中间，素白的武官袍，手里一卷黄绫。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"广场上，那队白衣武官又站在了三年前那个地方。这一回，他们是来宣诏的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "奉旨。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「……玉螺湖妖氛已靖。寻剑令，到此为止。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「……玉螺湖患暂平。湖底守者，朝廷记其名。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"念到「瑷伦」两个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"念到「璃虹」两个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"念到「南危水」三个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"念到「萧辟尘」三个字，宣诏的人顿了一下。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「……前兵部尚书庾子建，伪造诏令，扰民拿人，即日问罪。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「……兵部尚书庾子建，寻回旋芒，功在社稷。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.line
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"「……皇叔於兰天武，复其爵位。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_feng_ce calls.steps.say
#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.say
#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "江湖上的人，各回各家。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_uncle long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"於兰天武一身朝服站在广场中间，手里一卷黄绫。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_uncle calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "老夫替陛下念。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_ministry long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个白衣武官站在广场中间，手里一卷黄绫，身后站着他的人。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.herald_ministry calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "兵部奉旨，宣——"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "罗七"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head title
#. native.npc.fake_disciple title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "封山弟子"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个三十上下的汉子，穿一件不合身的青布长衫，腰里别着一柄竹剑，胸前挂一块黄杨木腰牌，逢人便把牌子亮一亮。他身后的旗杆上挑着一面布旗：淳风武馆收徒。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"罗七把胸前的腰牌一亮，高声道：淳风武馆收徒！封山剑法，童叟无欺！先交十两拜师钱！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"罗七对过路的人道：这位小哥，想学剑么？柳馆主是我师父。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"罗七叫道：弟兄们并肩子上！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"罗七的竹剑乱挥一气，一招封山剑法也没有。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"罗七喘着气嚷道：你们武馆自己门口就站着野羊山的血手刘三，倒有脸来管老子！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry topic
#. native.npc.fake_disciple inquiry topic
#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "拜师钱"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.拜师钱
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "十两银子。交了钱，明日辰时到武馆点卯，柳馆主亲自教。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.淳风武馆
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "就在镇里，石狮子后头。不过馆主近来不见生人——拜师的事，都交给我们师兄弟几个办了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "把胸前的木牌摘下来，在你眼前晃了晃。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.腰牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "看清楚：正面一座山，背面是姓。封山弟子人手一块，假不了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.封山剑法
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "封山剑法，讲究的是……是一个快字。别问那么多，交了钱自然教你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "冒牌"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.冒牌.confirm
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"当面说破他们是冒牌的。三个人收了钱还没走，不会善罢甘休——他们会一起动手。\n"
"要说破吗？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.冒牌.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "少废话！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.冒牌.rules.lines.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "的脸色变了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.冒牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……你是武馆的人？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head inquiry.冒牌.rules.lines.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "弟兄们，这小子要砸咱们的饭碗！"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple_head spared.line
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"罗七把腰牌扯下来扔在地上：拿去！牌是绮云镇赌场里一个姓逄的押给我的，不是偷的！……你们武馆的门房是野羊山的血手刘三，你们怎么不查他？\n"
"罗七爬起来，头也不回地往西跑了。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "帮闲"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个游手好闲的后生，学着武馆弟子的样子在腰里扎了一条麻布带子，手里攥着一把还没捂热的碎银。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple chat_msg
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"帮闲扯着嗓子喊：拜师的这边交钱！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"帮闲叫道：七哥，这小子手硬！\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple chat_msg_combat
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"帮闲一边打一边往后缩。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple inquiry.拜师钱
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "十两，交给七哥。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.fake_disciple inquiry.淳风武馆
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我……我们都是武馆的弟子。问七哥去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy name
#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry topic
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "阿桂"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个十二三岁的男孩，裤脚短了一截，手里的竹剑是自己削的，握柄上缠着一圈麻绳。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy inquiry.剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "绘心姐说，剑尖别抬，等别人先刺空。我等了三天了，小满总也不刺。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy inquiry.拜师钱
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "十两。我娘说，够我们家吃一年的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy inquiry.柳绘心
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "绘心姐不收钱。她说爹爹不教的，她教。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "握着阿桂的手腕，把他手里的竹剑往下压了半寸。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "剑尖别抬。等他刺空了，你这一剑才有地方去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "绘心姐，我娘说武馆的拜师钱要十两……我们家一年也攒不下。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我不收钱。爹爹不教的，我教。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "把圆盾靠在墙根，学着她的样子把竹剑平平递出去。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "会首说：我们的盾，换你们的剑。等别人先刺空——这个，大秦没有。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.emote
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "站在廊下，不知已经看了多久。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "绘心。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "封山的剑不外传。雪亭这一支本来叫北宗；我接了掌门，才并回本宗，把这两个字去了——并回去的条件只有一条：剑不外传。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "去了两个字，剑就不是封山的剑了么？阿桂他爹去年死在卧龙岗的强盗手里。他要是会一招「封」，死的就不是他。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "「起迄中空立，随风飘不定」——竹子弯了才不折。爹爹，这是你二十岁自己写的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我二十岁也这样想过，还写成了一卷书。后来才知道：随风飘的不是竹子，是没有根的东西。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你是这一辈的大弟子。本宗的规矩，你守不守？"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_boy calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你要是觉得我没有错，就留下来。北宗只有我一个人，我的剑也只学了个皮毛——可它是往外传的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_girl name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "小满"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_girl long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个扎着两条小辫的女孩，竹剑比她的胳膊还长，站桩站得一丝不苟。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_girl inquiry.剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我不刺。绘心姐说了，先刺的人吃亏。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.north_pupil_girl inquiry.柳绘心
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "绘心姐的剑上系着一条粉穗子。等我学会了「封」，她说也给我系一条。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_youth name
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "铁盾会少年"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_youth long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"一个十六七岁的异族少年，高鼻深目，头发卷得像羊毛。左臂上套着一面小圆盾，右手握着一柄竹剑——握法还是握短剑的握法。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_youth inquiry.安敦
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "会首说，欠了人情要还，学了本事也要还。我们的盾，换你们的剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.shield_youth inquiry.剑
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "我们的剑短，只往前。她的剑会等。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳绘心在镇口的公告旁支了一张小桌，身后立着一根新削的旗杆：「封山剑派北宗」。字是她自己写的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry.北宗
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "镇口的公告上写着「封山剑派北宗所在的雪亭镇」。雪亭不要这两个字了，我就把它带到还写着它的地方来。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry.柳淳风
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "爹爹没有拦我。他站在武馆门里，一直看到我过了卧龙岗。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry.点字诀
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "你那一诀是爹爹亲传的，比我自己悟的准。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north inquiry.阿桂
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "他们隔几天走卧龙岗过来。强盗现在不大敢拦了——他们手里有竹剑。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "……是你。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_north calls.steps.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "牌子是我自己写的。字不好，爹爹看见要笑的。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_chunfeng_lake title
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "封山剑派掌门人"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_chunfeng_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳淳风站在渡口的船头，玄苏剑还在鞘里。他身后，淳风武馆的弟子在岸边站成了一排，没有一个人说话。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_chunfeng_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "封山的剑不外传。可也没有哪一条规矩说，外面的事封山不管。"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_lake long
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid ""
"柳绘心站在渡口的船边，细剑横在臂弯里。阿桂他们没有来——她身后是几个镇上的后生，握的是竹剑，手都在抖，脚却没有动。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native.npc.liu_huixin_lake inquiry.湖底.rules.say
#: data/native/npcs.json
msgid "爹爹说剑不外传。可是你看——传出去的剑，今夜站在这里。"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_chen name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "雪亭驿的书信"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_chen long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封封好的书信，信封上写着：绮云镇 振远镖局 陈剑秋 亲启。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_chen no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这封信是要送到陈镖头手里的，不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/cloth_strip name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "刻着记号的布条"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/cloth_strip no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这块布条不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/cloth_strip long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一截粗麻布条，像是从衣角撕下来的，上面用刀尖刻着一个歪歪扭扭的记号：一棵松、三道横。老松岭一带的人管这叫老松寨的记号。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:waterfog/guild_token name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "水烟阁武士腰牌"
msgstr ""

#. native:waterfog/guild_token long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一面黄铜腰牌，正面铸着一只展翅的金乌，背面刻着「水烟阁」三字和一个「岭」字。铜面发黑，边角磨得发亮，不知在谁身上挂了多少年。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:waterfog/guild_token no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这面腰牌不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/old_letter long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封折了又折的信，信封上写着「雪亭镇淳风武馆 柳馆主 亲启」，字歪歪扭扭，一看就是不常拿笔的手。\n"
"信里写：「柳爷：当年您在山里迷了路，是小老儿领您下的山。如今小老儿要走了，这孩子没处去，求您收下。山里老岑。」\n"
"末一行不是字，是几道弯弯的纹，像风。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/old_letter no_drop
#. native:snow/letter_to_pan no_drop
#. native:choyin/magistrate_letter no_drop
#. native:city/courier_letter no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这封信不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_pan name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "柳淳风的引荐信"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/letter_to_pan long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封封好的信，封皮上写着「水烟阁 潘军禅贤弟 亲启」，落款「柳淳风」。封口的火漆上印着一枝柳。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:cloud/escort_note name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "二十年前的镖单"
msgstr ""

#. native:cloud/escort_note long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一张发黄的镖单，振远镖局的印鉴已经模糊。所押之物写着：水烟阁盟主印一方，密件一匣。起运地关北，收件人水烟阁盟主卫沧澜。末尾一行小字：乙丑年失镖于老松岭瀑布一带，镖师随从无一人生还。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:cloud/escort_note no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这张镖单不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "刻着风纹的石匣"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一只尺许长的青石匣子，匣面刻着一圈风纹，匣口严丝合缝，看不出锁眼在哪里。摇一摇，里面有极轻的一声响。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这只石匣不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box act.verb
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "对着风"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box act.acts.steps.line
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"匣子开着，里面空了，只剩匣底一圈铃的印子。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box act.acts.steps.line
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"你把匣子举起来，让匣面那圈风纹对着风来的方向。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box act.acts.steps.line
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"风灌进匣口的缝里，呜的一声，匣盖自己弹开了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box act.acts.steps.line
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"匣子里垫着一层朽了的丝绵，丝绵上躺着一只青铜小铃。风一过，它就响了。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/stone_box act.acts.steps.line
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"你把匣子转来转去，匣口的缝严丝合缝，一动不动。这里的风，不是它等的那一阵。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:goathill/tribute_cart name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "纳供车"
msgstr ""

#. native:goathill/tribute_cart long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一辆双轮板车，车上盖着油布，油布底下露出几只箱子的角。车辕上拴着一根粗麻绳，绳子绷得笔直，一头没进北边山壁的裂口里——上头有人在拉。车板上烙着一个「羊」字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:goathill/tribute_cart unit
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "辆"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/cold_robe name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "寒於宝衣"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/cold_robe long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一件月白的衣，料子像结了霜的水，摸上去不冷，站在它旁边却觉得凉。衣襟里缝着一行小字：寒於留衣，月神守之，火不能近。守衣人瑷伦说，它挡得住黑焰——几百年没人试过。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/cold_robe no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这件衣不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_maid name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "婢女的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_maid long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一个婢女倒在前厅的地上，手里还攥着抹布。喉下一道细口，是极细的剑。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_zhaorong name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "昭蓉的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:latemoon/body_zhaorong long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"昭蓉倒在内厅的门边，像是听见前厅的动静跑出来，没跑到。她的手还搭在门框上。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/decree_copy name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "寻剑令抄本"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/decree_copy long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一卷发黄的纸，边角磨得起了毛，叠过又展开过许多回。抄的是二十年前兵部颁下的寻剑令，一句：「寻剑，不得扰民一户。」底下另起一行，密密地写着一队人的名字——二十三个，每个名字后头点了一个墨点，像在数人。最后一个名字是陈显祖，没有点。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/magistrate_letter name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "程不平的信"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/magistrate_letter long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封封好的信，火漆上压着乔阴县印，封皮写着「叔父大人亲启」。程不平说：兵部的印是真的，令不是先帝的；假印和失踪的人都往关北去了——这封信替你敲开天驼关军营的门。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/soul_impaler long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一把三尺长的剑，剑身是透青的，像一条冻住的水。剑脊上刻着两个字：寒於。剑锋上没有血——三百年，它钉的是一颗头，不是人。握在手里，整条胳膊都是凉的。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/soul_impaler no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "穿灵不能丢。它钉过三百年。"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/soul_impaler act.acts.steps.line
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"你把剑举到光里。剑脊上两个字：寒於。字下面还有一行小的，是另一只手刻的，刻得很浅：「钉之三百年。杞庸。」\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/lihong_feather name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "璃虹的羽"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/lihong_feather long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一片巴掌长的羽毛，浅金色，拿在手里不冷也不热。它不沾水，也不化；放在暗处，边上有一圈很淡的光。璃虹说，再封的时候把它放回坛上，她认得它。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/lihong_feather no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这是璃虹的羽，不能丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/body_fisher name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "渔夫的尸首"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/body_fisher long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一个渔夫倒在岸边的泥里，脸朝下。网还攥在手里，网里什么都没有。背上三个孔，是钢叉。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/luo_card name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "骆家名帖"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/luo_card long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一张大红的名帖，折成三折。正面一行字：「京师骆氏 骆建炎 拜上 韦相国」，字写得飞快，最后一笔甩出了格子——骆云舟的字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:choyin/luo_card no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这张名帖不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/courier_letter name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "密信"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/courier_letter long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一封没有封皮的信，字是庾子建的，一笔不苟：「湖底之事，子时前办妥。人已送去北麓，勿再来府。」信尾没有落款，只盖了一方小印——兵部尚书私印。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/blinding_charm name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "障眼符"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/blinding_charm long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一张黄纸符，朱砂画的符纹弯弯绕绕，纸角写着一行小字：「茅山 障眼」。带在身上，夜里巡夜的人眼睛短一截。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/blinding_charm no_drop
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "这张符不能随便丢。"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/fonxan_tally name
#: data/native/items.json
msgid "封山腰牌"
msgstr ""

#. native:snow/fonxan_tally long
#: data/native/items.json
msgid ""
"一块黄杨木腰牌，正面刻着一座山，背面一个「逄」字，包浆很厚，是戴了十几年的东西。系绳上还拴着一枚竹筹，烙着「绮云 · 赌」三个字。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:oldpine/pine_top long
#: data/native/rooms.json
msgid ""
"破旧的栈道到这里到了头。崖上的松树比下面密得多，树冠遮去了大半天光，\n"
"地上一条踩出来的小径往东去，南边树隙间透着山涧的水声，北边的林子更深。\n"
"小径旁好几株松树的树干上有刀划的记号。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:village/seal_altar long
#: data/native/rooms.json
msgid ""
"一间圆的冰室，顶上是整块半透明的冰，上面就是冰龙厅的水潭，能看见龙的影子游过去。\n"
"当中一座黑石封坛，坛心一块透明的冰，冰里一颗头，一把剑从头顶直钉下去，剑柄露在冰外。\n"
"坛边一根冰柱，柱里一个女人，眼睛是睁着的；她身上发着白光，光照在冰上，冰就不化。\n"
"这里不冷——她的光照着的地方都不冷。脚下黑石的台阶通上去，是潭口。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/xiangguo_yard long
#: data/native/rooms.json
msgid ""
"进了大门是一个小院子。影壁上的白灰掉了一半，露出底下的青砖。院子里没有花，种的是菜：两畦白菜、一架豆角，一只鸡在菜畦边上刨土。北面的正厅是旧的，柱子上的漆剥得斑斑驳驳。真的寒酸——可是扫得很干净。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/xiangguo_hall long
#: data/native/rooms.json
msgid ""
"正厅里只有几把旧椅子、一张八仙桌，桌上一把缺了嘴的茶壶。墙上挂着一幅字，写的是「先天下之忧而忧」，纸已经黄了，裱的边也卷了。西边一道门通到书房，门里透出灯光，书堆得比人还高。\n"
msgstr ""

#. native:city/xiangguo_study long
#: data/native/rooms.json
msgid ""
"书房里到处是书：架子上、桌上、地上，一摞一摞，有的用绳子捆着，有的摊开着，上面压着砚台。窗下一张榻，榻上一床旧被子——这屋子的主人常常在这里过夜。桌上一盏油灯，灯芯剪得很短。\n"
msgstr ""

